window.COURSE = {"slug": "applied-statistics", "title": "應用統計完整教學", "shortTitle": "應用統計", "updated": "2026-11-02", "baseline": "SciPy 1.18.1 · statsmodels 0.15.0 · Python 3.13", "footerLabel": "THE APPLIED STATISTICS GUIDE", "exampleBundle": "examples.zip", "searchHint": "搜尋信賴區間、Welch、ANOVA、因素分析…", "groups": [{"id": "introduction", "number": "01", "title": "緒論", "description": "定義、分類、名詞、資料與衡量尺度。"}, {"id": "tables", "number": "02", "title": "統計資料的整理與圖表", "description": "屬質與屬量整理、圖形與分配型態。"}, {"id": "descriptive", "number": "03", "title": "統計量數之測量", "description": "集中、差異、Z分數、經驗法則與離群值。"}, {"id": "probability", "number": "04", "title": "機率及機率分配", "description": "機率法則、隨機變數、期望與常見分配。"}, {"id": "sampling", "number": "05", "title": "抽樣及抽樣分配", "description": "抽樣設計、平均數、比例、t、卡方與F。"}, {"id": "intervals", "number": "06", "title": "區間估計", "description": "平均、比例、樣本數與變異數區間。"}, {"id": "testing", "number": "07", "title": "假設檢定", "description": "誤差、檢定力、單樣本、雙樣本與卡方檢定。"}, {"id": "anova", "number": "08", "title": "變異數分析", "description": "單因子、多重比較、二因子與交互作用。"}, {"id": "regression", "number": "09", "title": "相關與迴歸分析", "description": "關聯、直線模式、推論與殘差診斷。"}, {"id": "survey", "number": "10", "title": "問卷調查分析與Python實作", "description": "設計、計分、信效度、因素與完整分析流程。"}, {"id": "appendices", "number": "附", "title": "解答、附錄與完整專題", "description": "查表、選方法、穩健分析與可重現報告。"}], "lessons": [{"id": "01-statistics-definition", "group": "introduction", "title": "統計學的定義：從問題到不確定性", "summary": "先定義想了解的對象，再決定資料、量數與推論範圍。", "tags": ["緒論", "statistics definition"], "html": "<h1 id=\"1-1\">統計學的定義：從問題到不確定性</h1>\n<p>先定義想了解的對象，再決定資料、量數與推論範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">統計學處理什麼問題</h2>\n<p>統計學研究如何蒐集、整理、分析資料，並在變動與資訊不完整的情況下做判斷。它包含設計與溝通，不只是最後套一個公式。說「這次問卷平均3.2」是資料摘要；說「所有使用者都滿意」則跨出了樣本，需要母體、抽樣、衡量與不確定性的證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">把含糊問題改成可研究的問題</h2>\n<p>「服務好不好」太廣；可以改為「本季有使用紀錄的使用者，對指定三個題項的平均分數是多少」。還要說明期間、地區、納入排除規則、觀察單位及分數定義。若只是網站自願填答者，研究對象與目標母體可能不同，不能省略這個差距。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一條完整分析流程</h2>\n<p>先訂問題與估計目標，規劃資料來源和設計，建立欄位與品質檢查，再整理、估計、診斷與報告。檢定只佔其中一段。若量表題目無法衡量概念，計算得很精確也不能補救；若抽樣框漏掉某類人，增加同一框內樣本也不會自動消除偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">本課如何閱讀</h2>\n<p>本課依你提供的十章編排，各章內的單元由閱讀器重新編號，標題只保留主題文字，細目放在頁內。第十章改以Python實作問卷分析，不包含SPSS操作。共70個閱讀單元：54節、十章習題及6個附錄／整合單元。可以先看概念與手算，再下載範例核對數字；程式不是理解假設的替代品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">例子：同一個平均，兩種結論</h2>\n<p>五名填答者的評分為[2,3,3,4,4]，平均3.2。若這五人就是某小組全員，3.2是該組此次結果；若他們只是十萬名使用者中的方便樣本，3.2只直接描述這五人。兩個算術式相同，證據支持的結論不同。資料的來源和用途決定可以說多遠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">檢核與解答</h2>\n<p>問：統計顯著是否就代表值得採用？答：還要看估計差異、區間、成本與使用條件。問：樣本非常大能否免除研究設計？答：不能；它主要降低某些隨機誤差，未必修正選擇偏差、錯誤測量或混淆。學完整門課的目標，是能解釋方法為何適合，以及還有哪些不確定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">估計目標也可能改變</h2>\n<p>平均「每筆訂單等待」與平均「每名客戶的平均等待」不一定相同。甲有10筆各1小時，乙有1筆10小時，按訂單平均20/11約1.818，先對人平均再平均則5.5。兩者都可算，卻回答不同目標。分析前應決定要給每筆事件還是每個人相同權重，而不是看哪個結果更好再選。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 統計學的定義：從問題到不確定性 {#1-1}\n\n先定義想了解的對象，再決定資料、量數與推論範圍。\n\n## 統計學處理什麼問題\n\n統計學研究如何蒐集、整理、分析資料，並在變動與資訊不完整的情況下做判斷。它包含設計與溝通，不只是最後套一個公式。說「這次問卷平均3.2」是資料摘要；說「所有使用者都滿意」則跨出了樣本，需要母體、抽樣、衡量與不確定性的證據。\n\n## 把含糊問題改成可研究的問題\n\n「服務好不好」太廣；可以改為「本季有使用紀錄的使用者，對指定三個題項的平均分數是多少」。還要說明期間、地區、納入排除規則、觀察單位及分數定義。若只是網站自願填答者，研究對象與目標母體可能不同，不能省略這個差距。\n\n## 一條完整分析流程\n\n先訂問題與估計目標，規劃資料來源和設計，建立欄位與品質檢查，再整理、估計、診斷與報告。檢定只佔其中一段。若量表題目無法衡量概念，計算得很精確也不能補救；若抽樣框漏掉某類人，增加同一框內樣本也不會自動消除偏差。\n\n## 本課如何閱讀\n\n本課依你提供的十章編排，各章內的單元由閱讀器重新編號，標題只保留主題文字，細目放在頁內。第十章改以Python實作問卷分析，不包含SPSS操作。共70個閱讀單元：54節、十章習題及6個附錄／整合單元。可以先看概念與手算，再下載範例核對數字；程式不是理解假設的替代品。\n\n## 例子：同一個平均，兩種結論\n\n五名填答者的評分為[2,3,3,4,4]，平均3.2。若這五人就是某小組全員，3.2是該組此次結果；若他們只是十萬名使用者中的方便樣本，3.2只直接描述這五人。兩個算術式相同，證據支持的結論不同。資料的來源和用途決定可以說多遠。\n\n## 檢核與解答\n\n問：統計顯著是否就代表值得採用？答：還要看估計差異、區間、成本與使用條件。問：樣本非常大能否免除研究設計？答：不能；它主要降低某些隨機誤差，未必修正選擇偏差、錯誤測量或混淆。學完整門課的目標，是能解釋方法為何適合，以及還有哪些不確定。\n\n## 估計目標也可能改變\n\n平均「每筆訂單等待」與平均「每名客戶的平均等待」不一定相同。甲有10筆各1小時，乙有1筆10小時，按訂單平均20/11約1.818，先對人平均再平均則5.5。兩者都可算，卻回答不同目標。分析前應決定要給每筆事件還是每個人相同權重，而不是看哪個結果更好再選。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "1-1", "name": "統計學的定義：從問題到不確定性", "html": "統計學的定義：從問題到不確定性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "統計學處理什麼問題", "html": "統計學處理什麼問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "把含糊問題改成可研究的問題", "html": "把含糊問題改成可研究的問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一條完整分析流程", "html": "一條完整分析流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "本課如何閱讀", "html": "本課如何閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "例子：同一個平均，兩種結論", "html": "例子：同一個平均，兩種結論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "檢核與解答", "html": "檢核與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "估計目標也可能改變", "html": "估計目標也可能改變", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "02-statistics-branches", "group": "introduction", "title": "統計學的分類：描述、推論與應用", "summary": "分清四個常見名稱的分類軸，讓理論與實務互相支援。", "tags": ["緒論", "statistics branches"], "html": "<h1 id=\"1-2\">統計學的分類：描述、推論與應用</h1>\n<p>分清四個常見名稱的分類軸，讓理論與實務互相支援。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-2-1\">敘述統計學</h2>\n<p>敘述統計將已觀察資料整理成表、圖與數字，如次數、平均、中位數及標準差。它可以描述全體也可以描述樣本，重點是摘要對象。將30筆交貨時間畫成直方圖，是在保留形狀的同時降低閱讀負擔；不同分箱也可能造成不同視覺印象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-2-1_1\">推論統計學</h2>\n<p>推論統計在指定設計與模型下，由樣本對母體參數或其他未知量做估計、檢定與預測。它必須處理資料若重新取得會如何變動，並說明結果依賴哪些假設。平均的標準誤、信賴區間及假設檢定不是三個互不相干的工具，都建立在抽樣分配之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-2-2\">數理統計學</h2>\n<p>數理統計研究估計量與程序的性質，例如偏差、變異、充分性及漸近分布。證明樣本平均在某條件下無偏，與評估一份問卷是否有代表性，是不同層次的問題。公式的結論有條件，不能把條件藏起來再推廣到所有資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-2-2_1\">應用統計學</h2>\n<p>應用統計把研究問題、資料設計、方法選擇、假設診斷與結果解讀接起來。本課保留必要推導和手算，讓你能判斷軟體輸出；估計理論的完整證明則由獨立數理統計課深化。兩者不是誰比較高階，而是回答不同問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">同一案例的四個面向</h2>\n<p>描述某批產品的尺寸分布，是敘述；估整個製程平均的區間，是推論；推導區間覆蓋率，是數理；確認尺寸是否按隨機時間點抽樣、量測是否校正，以及如何對製程報告，是應用。實際專案會在四者之間來回，而非只能選其中一個名稱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">常見誤解與解答</h2>\n<p>只用圖表也可能犯錯：例如圓餅圖分母混入多選題。只做推導也可能用錯問題：例如對重複量測假設獨立。練習：把「兩組平均差2分、95%區間[−1,5]」拆開。答案：差2是估計值，區間描述程序下的精確度；它沒有證明差異不存在，也沒有自動證明兩組等效，後者需另訂等效界值與程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">計算與判斷的分工</h2>\n<p>用同一資料反覆試很多分組，再只報一個顯著結果，是推論程序的問題，不是計算精度不足。即使每個p都由正確軟體算出，選擇過程仍改變解讀。敘述階段可以自由探索，但確認性結論需要另外規劃、調整或新資料，才能將發現與驗證分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 統計學的分類：描述、推論與應用 {#1-2}\n\n分清四個常見名稱的分類軸，讓理論與實務互相支援。\n\n## 敘述統計學 {#1-2-1}\n\n敘述統計將已觀察資料整理成表、圖與數字，如次數、平均、中位數及標準差。它可以描述全體也可以描述樣本，重點是摘要對象。將30筆交貨時間畫成直方圖，是在保留形狀的同時降低閱讀負擔；不同分箱也可能造成不同視覺印象。\n\n## 推論統計學 {#1-2-1_1}\n\n推論統計在指定設計與模型下，由樣本對母體參數或其他未知量做估計、檢定與預測。它必須處理資料若重新取得會如何變動，並說明結果依賴哪些假設。平均的標準誤、信賴區間及假設檢定不是三個互不相干的工具，都建立在抽樣分配之上。\n\n## 數理統計學 {#1-2-2}\n\n數理統計研究估計量與程序的性質，例如偏差、變異、充分性及漸近分布。證明樣本平均在某條件下無偏，與評估一份問卷是否有代表性，是不同層次的問題。公式的結論有條件，不能把條件藏起來再推廣到所有資料。\n\n## 應用統計學 {#1-2-2_1}\n\n應用統計把研究問題、資料設計、方法選擇、假設診斷與結果解讀接起來。本課保留必要推導和手算，讓你能判斷軟體輸出；估計理論的完整證明則由獨立數理統計課深化。兩者不是誰比較高階，而是回答不同問題。\n\n## 同一案例的四個面向\n\n描述某批產品的尺寸分布，是敘述；估整個製程平均的區間，是推論；推導區間覆蓋率，是數理；確認尺寸是否按隨機時間點抽樣、量測是否校正，以及如何對製程報告，是應用。實際專案會在四者之間來回，而非只能選其中一個名稱。\n\n## 常見誤解與解答\n\n只用圖表也可能犯錯：例如圓餅圖分母混入多選題。只做推導也可能用錯問題：例如對重複量測假設獨立。練習：把「兩組平均差2分、95%區間[−1,5]」拆開。答案：差2是估計值，區間描述程序下的精確度；它沒有證明差異不存在，也沒有自動證明兩組等效，後者需另訂等效界值與程序。\n\n## 計算與判斷的分工\n\n用同一資料反覆試很多分組，再只報一個顯著結果，是推論程序的問題，不是計算精度不足。即使每個p都由正確軟體算出，選擇過程仍改變解讀。敘述階段可以自由探索，但確認性結論需要另外規劃、調整或新資料，才能將發現與驗證分開。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "1-2", "name": "統計學的分類：描述、推論與應用", "html": "統計學的分類：描述、推論與應用", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "1-2-1", "name": "敘述統計學", "html": "敘述統計學", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-2-1_1", "name": "推論統計學", "html": "推論統計學", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-2-2", "name": "數理統計學", "html": "數理統計學", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-2-2_1", "name": "應用統計學", "html": "應用統計學", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "同一案例的四個面向", "html": "同一案例的四個面向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "常見誤解與解答", "html": "常見誤解與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "計算與判斷的分工", "html": "計算與判斷的分工", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "03-key-terms", "group": "introduction", "title": "名詞解釋：變數、母體、樣本與統計量", "summary": "用固定參數與隨機統計量的差異，建立後面抽樣分配的語言。", "tags": ["緒論", "key terms"], "html": "<h1 id=\"1-3\">名詞解釋：變數、母體、樣本與統計量</h1>\n<p>用固定參數與隨機統計量的差異，建立後面抽樣分配的語言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-3-1\">變數與變量</h2>\n<p>變數是可在觀察單位間取不同值的特徵，如交貨時間X；某次觀察得到的12.5小時是實現值x。variate在不同教材也可指隨機變數或其實現值，中文「變量」沒有全領域唯一譯法。本課明確區分隨機變數X、觀察值x與資料欄位，避免靠譯名猜意思。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-3-2\">母體與樣本</h2>\n<p>母體是研究目標的全部單位，樣本是實際觀察的部分。目標母體、抽樣框與可取得樣本不一定相同：想研究全體顧客、卻只從電子報訂戶抽樣，可能有涵蓋不足。N常表示有限母體大小，n表示樣本大小；大n也不能讓未涵蓋的顧客自動出現。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-3-3\">參數與統計量</h2>\n<p>參數是母體或模型的特徵，如μ、σ²、p；頻率學派下通常視為固定但未知。統計量是不含未知參數、由樣本算出的函數，如樣本平均、S²、樣本比例。抽樣前它會隨樣本變，觀察後得到一個數值。估計量指程序，估計值指此次結果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\bar X=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_i,\\qquad\n\\bar x=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_i\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"1-3-4\">簡單隨機樣本</h2>\n<p>有限母體不放回的SRS，大小n的每個可能子集合機會相同；各次抽取因不放回而相依。另一種理論慣例把「隨機樣本」定義為來自同一分布的獨立觀察，稱iid。本課會說明使用哪一種，不把不放回SRS與精確iid混成同一條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">例子與推論邊界</h2>\n<p>某公司100位員工，抽20人量通勤時間。全員平均μ是參數，20人平均x̄是估計值；換一組20人就可能不同。若母體只有100人，不放回抽掉20%時，抽樣誤差可能需有限母體修正。若同住員工或同車隊產生關聯，還要檢查設計，不能僅因抽了20人就套獨立公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：已觀察到的樣本平均是否仍是一個會變的數字？答：此次數值固定，重抽時的估計程序才有抽樣分布。問：抽樣前μ是否每次跟著重抽改變？答：對同一指定母體而言不會。後面信賴區間的長期覆蓋解釋，就建立在這個分工上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 名詞解釋：變數、母體、樣本與統計量 {#1-3}\n\n用固定參數與隨機統計量的差異，建立後面抽樣分配的語言。\n\n## 變數與變量 {#1-3-1}\n\n變數是可在觀察單位間取不同值的特徵，如交貨時間X；某次觀察得到的12.5小時是實現值x。variate在不同教材也可指隨機變數或其實現值，中文「變量」沒有全領域唯一譯法。本課明確區分隨機變數X、觀察值x與資料欄位，避免靠譯名猜意思。\n\n## 母體與樣本 {#1-3-2}\n\n母體是研究目標的全部單位，樣本是實際觀察的部分。目標母體、抽樣框與可取得樣本不一定相同：想研究全體顧客、卻只從電子報訂戶抽樣，可能有涵蓋不足。N常表示有限母體大小，n表示樣本大小；大n也不能讓未涵蓋的顧客自動出現。\n\n## 參數與統計量 {#1-3-3}\n\n參數是母體或模型的特徵，如μ、σ²、p；頻率學派下通常視為固定但未知。統計量是不含未知參數、由樣本算出的函數，如樣本平均、S²、樣本比例。抽樣前它會隨樣本變，觀察後得到一個數值。估計量指程序，估計值指此次結果。\n\n$$\n\\bar X=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_i,\\qquad\n\\bar x=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_i\n$$\n\n## 簡單隨機樣本 {#1-3-4}\n\n有限母體不放回的SRS，大小n的每個可能子集合機會相同；各次抽取因不放回而相依。另一種理論慣例把「隨機樣本」定義為來自同一分布的獨立觀察，稱iid。本課會說明使用哪一種，不把不放回SRS與精確iid混成同一條件。\n\n## 例子與推論邊界\n\n某公司100位員工，抽20人量通勤時間。全員平均μ是參數，20人平均x̄是估計值；換一組20人就可能不同。若母體只有100人，不放回抽掉20%時，抽樣誤差可能需有限母體修正。若同住員工或同車隊產生關聯，還要檢查設計，不能僅因抽了20人就套獨立公式。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：已觀察到的樣本平均是否仍是一個會變的數字？答：此次數值固定，重抽時的估計程序才有抽樣分布。問：抽樣前μ是否每次跟著重抽改變？答：對同一指定母體而言不會。後面信賴區間的長期覆蓋解釋，就建立在這個分工上。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "1-3", "name": "名詞解釋：變數、母體、樣本與統計量", "html": "名詞解釋：變數、母體、樣本與統計量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "1-3-1", "name": "變數與變量", "html": "變數與變量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-3-2", "name": "母體與樣本", "html": "母體與樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-3-3", "name": "參數與統計量", "html": "參數與統計量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-3-4", "name": "簡單隨機樣本", "html": "簡單隨機樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "例子與推論邊界", "html": "例子與推論邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "04-data-and-scales", "group": "introduction", "title": "統計資料的性質、種類與衡量尺度", "summary": "從欄位字典開始，決定哪些運算與比較有合理意義。", "tags": ["緒論", "data and scales"], "example": "01_data_types.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"1-4\">統計資料的性質、種類與衡量尺度</h1>\n<p>從欄位字典開始，決定哪些運算與比較有合理意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-4-1\">統計資料的意義</h2>\n<p>資料是依某種定義取得的觀察紀錄，不是脫離情境的數字。每列代表人、訂單或人次，結論可能完全不同。欄位字典至少包括觀察單位、名稱、定義、單位、允許值、缺失碼與來源時間。平均等待5沒有單位就不能解讀，代碼999也不能直接當等待時間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-4-2\">統計資料的性質</h2>\n<p>評估正確性、完整性、一致性、時效與可比較性。資料完整不代表抽樣代表性；多筆小數也不等於量測準確。先分辨真零、未發生、未回答與不適用，再定義處理政策。資料清理的每個決定都要可追溯，不能為了讓p變小而刪資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-4-3\">種類</h2>\n<p>屬質資料表類別，屬量資料表數量。屬量又可分離散計數與連續量測；數位裝置將連續時間記到整秒，不會使其實質問題自動變成計數模型。也區分橫斷面、時間序列與追蹤／重複量測，因為獨立性與配對設計會不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-4-4\">衡量尺度</h2>\n<p>名目尺度只支持類別相同與否，例如方案A／B；順序尺度另有次序，如單一五點同意題；等距尺度差值有意義但零點任意，如攝氏溫度；比例尺度有合理零點，如長度。將方案編為1、2、3不會讓「平均方案2」成為有意義量數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">從尺度決定分析</h2>\n<p>單一Likert題先看各選項比例與中位數。多題形成分數後，是否近似連續要有理論、計分與分布依據；不能因為取平均就自動升級成精確等距尺度。程式第一個入口用類別次數示範分母，後面以合成問卷把規則做成可執行檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>顧客ID、攝氏溫度、訂單數、滿意度單題分別是哪種尺度？答：ID名目、溫度等距、訂單數比例且離散、單題通常順序。CV要求有意義的比例零點和通常正平均；因此攝氏溫度CV不具同樣解釋。所有答案先看實際定義，不能只靠儲存型態是int或float決定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/01_data_types.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 01_data_types.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">counts_</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">pd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Series</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value_counts</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sort_index</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;counts&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">counts_</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_dict</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;relative_frequency&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">counts_</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_dict</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;n&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 統計資料的性質、種類與衡量尺度 {#1-4}\n\n從欄位字典開始，決定哪些運算與比較有合理意義。\n\n## 統計資料的意義 {#1-4-1}\n\n資料是依某種定義取得的觀察紀錄，不是脫離情境的數字。每列代表人、訂單或人次，結論可能完全不同。欄位字典至少包括觀察單位、名稱、定義、單位、允許值、缺失碼與來源時間。平均等待5沒有單位就不能解讀，代碼999也不能直接當等待時間。\n\n## 統計資料的性質 {#1-4-2}\n\n評估正確性、完整性、一致性、時效與可比較性。資料完整不代表抽樣代表性；多筆小數也不等於量測準確。先分辨真零、未發生、未回答與不適用，再定義處理政策。資料清理的每個決定都要可追溯，不能為了讓p變小而刪資料。\n\n## 種類 {#1-4-3}\n\n屬質資料表類別，屬量資料表數量。屬量又可分離散計數與連續量測；數位裝置將連續時間記到整秒，不會使其實質問題自動變成計數模型。也區分橫斷面、時間序列與追蹤／重複量測，因為獨立性與配對設計會不同。\n\n## 衡量尺度 {#1-4-4}\n\n名目尺度只支持類別相同與否，例如方案A／B；順序尺度另有次序，如單一五點同意題；等距尺度差值有意義但零點任意，如攝氏溫度；比例尺度有合理零點，如長度。將方案編為1、2、3不會讓「平均方案2」成為有意義量數。\n\n## 從尺度決定分析\n\n單一Likert題先看各選項比例與中位數。多題形成分數後，是否近似連續要有理論、計分與分布依據；不能因為取平均就自動升級成精確等距尺度。程式第一個入口用類別次數示範分母，後面以合成問卷把規則做成可執行檢查。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n顧客ID、攝氏溫度、訂單數、滿意度單題分別是哪種尺度？答：ID名目、溫度等距、訂單數比例且離散、單題通常順序。CV要求有意義的比例零點和通常正平均；因此攝氏溫度CV不具同樣解釋。所有答案先看實際定義，不能只靠儲存型態是int或float決定。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/01_data_types.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 01_data_types.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    labels=['A','B','A','C','B','A']\n    counts_=pd.Series(labels).value_counts().sort_index()\n    result={'counts':counts_.to_dict(),'relative_frequency':(counts_/len(labels)).to_dict(),'n':len(labels)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "1-4", "name": "統計資料的性質、種類與衡量尺度", "html": "統計資料的性質、種類與衡量尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "1-4-1", "name": "統計資料的意義", "html": "統計資料的意義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-4-2", "name": "統計資料的性質", "html": "統計資料的性質", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-4-3", "name": "種類", "html": "種類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "1-4-4", "name": "衡量尺度", "html": "衡量尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "從尺度決定分析", "html": "從尺度決定分析", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "05-exercises-introduction", "group": "introduction", "title": "緒論習題與詳解", "summary": "用資料來源與觀察單位檢驗統計敘述是否說得太遠。", "tags": ["緒論", "exercises introduction"], "html": "<h1 id=\"01\">緒論習題與詳解</h1>\n<p>用資料來源與觀察單位檢驗統計敘述是否說得太遠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：找出目標與樣本</h2>\n<p>題目：平台想知道所有本季活躍使用者的平均滿意度，只寄問卷給付費者，收到300份回覆。請分辨目標母體、抽樣框與回覆樣本。解答：目標是本季活躍者；框是被寄送的付費名單；樣本是實際回覆者。非付費者未涵蓋、未回覆者可能不同，300份本身不能解除這兩種問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：參數或統計量</h2>\n<p>題目：全體120位學員的平均年齡為28；抽取15位的平均為26.8。解答：若研究對象就是這120人，28是母體平均參數，26.8是此次樣本平均估計值。若這120人也是更大目標的樣本，28又成為另一研究層次的統計量；名稱取決於定義的母體，不由數字大小決定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：描述是否等於推論</h2>\n<p>題目：「回覆者中72%選同意，所以全體使用者72%同意」。解答：前半是樣本描述，後半是需設計與不確定性支持的推論。合理改寫為「本次有效回覆中72%選同意；因樣本自願回覆，未直接推論全體」。若有抽樣權重，也需交代權重來源與設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：數字代碼的平均</h2>\n<p>題目：把地區北中南編成1、2、3，平均2.1可否稱為平均地區？解答：不合理，代碼可任意重編，平均會跟著變。應報各區人數／比例。若要分析地理距離，需另外定義座標或距離，不靠類別編碼假裝有等距性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題五：隨機與獨立</h2>\n<p>題目：100人不放回抽10人是否每次抽取精確獨立？解答：不是，抽到某人後剩餘名單改變；但每個10人子集合可有相同選取機率。抽樣比例小時，某些iid近似可能方便，仍要指出近似，不能在定義處就抹去差異。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">申論驗收</h2>\n<p>選你熟悉的一份表格，寫出觀察單位、母體、來源、三個欄位的尺度及一個不能回答的問題。沒有唯一內容答案；合格回答須前後一致，清楚區分人與人次、缺失與零、樣本與目標。若只列方法名稱，尚未回答研究設計問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">延伸題：人數與人次</h2>\n<p>甲每天登入10次、乙登入1次，若每次登入後彈問卷，甲較有機會被多次記錄。直接平均11次回覆不等於兩個人的平均意見。解答應先決定觀察單位，保留使用者ID與時間，再依研究目標去重、彙整或使用相依模型；不能只因CSV有11列就稱11名使用者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 緒論習題與詳解 {#01}\n\n用資料來源與觀察單位檢驗統計敘述是否說得太遠。\n\n## 題一：找出目標與樣本\n\n題目：平台想知道所有本季活躍使用者的平均滿意度，只寄問卷給付費者，收到300份回覆。請分辨目標母體、抽樣框與回覆樣本。解答：目標是本季活躍者；框是被寄送的付費名單；樣本是實際回覆者。非付費者未涵蓋、未回覆者可能不同，300份本身不能解除這兩種問題。\n\n## 題二：參數或統計量\n\n題目：全體120位學員的平均年齡為28；抽取15位的平均為26.8。解答：若研究對象就是這120人，28是母體平均參數，26.8是此次樣本平均估計值。若這120人也是更大目標的樣本，28又成為另一研究層次的統計量；名稱取決於定義的母體，不由數字大小決定。\n\n## 題三：描述是否等於推論\n\n題目：「回覆者中72%選同意，所以全體使用者72%同意」。解答：前半是樣本描述，後半是需設計與不確定性支持的推論。合理改寫為「本次有效回覆中72%選同意；因樣本自願回覆，未直接推論全體」。若有抽樣權重，也需交代權重來源與設計。\n\n## 題四：數字代碼的平均\n\n題目：把地區北中南編成1、2、3，平均2.1可否稱為平均地區？解答：不合理，代碼可任意重編，平均會跟著變。應報各區人數／比例。若要分析地理距離，需另外定義座標或距離，不靠類別編碼假裝有等距性。\n\n## 題五：隨機與獨立\n\n題目：100人不放回抽10人是否每次抽取精確獨立？解答：不是，抽到某人後剩餘名單改變；但每個10人子集合可有相同選取機率。抽樣比例小時，某些iid近似可能方便，仍要指出近似，不能在定義處就抹去差異。\n\n## 申論驗收\n\n選你熟悉的一份表格，寫出觀察單位、母體、來源、三個欄位的尺度及一個不能回答的問題。沒有唯一內容答案；合格回答須前後一致，清楚區分人與人次、缺失與零、樣本與目標。若只列方法名稱，尚未回答研究設計問題。\n\n## 延伸題：人數與人次\n\n甲每天登入10次、乙登入1次，若每次登入後彈問卷，甲較有機會被多次記錄。直接平均11次回覆不等於兩個人的平均意見。解答應先決定觀察單位，保留使用者ID與時間，再依研究目標去重、彙整或使用相依模型；不能只因CSV有11列就稱11名使用者。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "01", "name": "緒論習題與詳解", "html": "緒論習題與詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：找出目標與樣本", "html": "題一：找出目標與樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：參數或統計量", "html": "題二：參數或統計量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：描述是否等於推論", "html": "題三：描述是否等於推論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：數字代碼的平均", "html": "題四：數字代碼的平均", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題五：隨機與獨立", "html": "題五：隨機與獨立", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "申論驗收", "html": "申論驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "延伸題：人數與人次", "html": "延伸題：人數與人次", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "06-categorical-tables", "group": "tables", "title": "屬質資料：表格法與圖示法", "summary": "用人數、比例與明確分母，避免類別圖形誤導。", "tags": ["統計資料的整理與圖表", "categorical tables"], "html": "<h1 id=\"2-1\">屬質資料：表格法與圖示法</h1>\n<p>用人數、比例與明確分母，避免類別圖形誤導。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-1-1\">表格法</h2>\n<p>次數表列類別、次數f、相對次數f/n與百分比。若每筆只有一類，完整有效分類的次數應加總n、相對次數加總1。缺失可以另列一類，也可以有效樣本為分母，但務必說清楚。若方案A有30、B有15、未回答5，以全體50為分母A為60%；以有效45為分母A為66.7%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">單選、多選與分母</h2>\n<p>多選題每人可選數項，選項比例相加可以超過100%。「選項總勾選次數」與「填答人數」是不同分母。若A被30人選、B被25人選，不能推論共有55人，因為可能重疊。表頭需標示每項是人數、次數還是事件數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-1-2\">圖示法</h2>\n<p>長條圖適合比較類別高度，通常由零起點；有自然順序時保留順序，否則可按大小排序。圓餅圖需要互斥且涵蓋全部的部分—整體關係，多選題通常不合適。3D透視、不同面積裝飾及截斷軸容易放大或壓縮差異，應避免用造型代替資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">交叉分類與百分比</h2>\n<p>兩個類別變數可整理為交叉表。列百分比回答「在某列類別內如何分布」，欄百分比回答另一方向。兩者分母不同，都可能合理；不能把某欄最大的格子直接解讀成該組比例最高。統計檢定要用原始計數，不以已四捨五入的百分比當觀察值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">手算一張小表</h2>\n<p>方案A有20人同意、10人不同意；B有12人同意、8人不同意。A同意率20/30=66.7%，B為12/20=60%；同意者中屬A的比例卻是20/32=62.5%。三個比例回答不同問題。完整敘述包含條件與分母，不只寫66.7%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：五個類別各有20%，是否可知樣本數？答：不能，可能5、50或500人，需報n。問：百分比加總99.9是否一定錯？答：可能是四捨五入，原始比例應核對；若差距很大則查缺失、重複與分類定義。第十章以問卷交叉表再次實作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">零點與視覺大小</h2>\n<p>A比例51%、B50%，差1百分點。若長條軸從49%開始，柱高變成2與1，視覺看似兩倍，卻不表示實際比例兩倍。若為看微小差需截軸，應清楚標示並考慮點圖及差異區間。描述圖的尺度選擇也屬分析責任，不能只說軟體預設如此。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 屬質資料：表格法與圖示法 {#2-1}\n\n用人數、比例與明確分母，避免類別圖形誤導。\n\n## 表格法 {#2-1-1}\n\n次數表列類別、次數f、相對次數f/n與百分比。若每筆只有一類，完整有效分類的次數應加總n、相對次數加總1。缺失可以另列一類，也可以有效樣本為分母，但務必說清楚。若方案A有30、B有15、未回答5，以全體50為分母A為60%；以有效45為分母A為66.7%。\n\n## 單選、多選與分母\n\n多選題每人可選數項，選項比例相加可以超過100%。「選項總勾選次數」與「填答人數」是不同分母。若A被30人選、B被25人選，不能推論共有55人，因為可能重疊。表頭需標示每項是人數、次數還是事件數。\n\n## 圖示法 {#2-1-2}\n\n長條圖適合比較類別高度，通常由零起點；有自然順序時保留順序，否則可按大小排序。圓餅圖需要互斥且涵蓋全部的部分—整體關係，多選題通常不合適。3D透視、不同面積裝飾及截斷軸容易放大或壓縮差異，應避免用造型代替資料。\n\n## 交叉分類與百分比\n\n兩個類別變數可整理為交叉表。列百分比回答「在某列類別內如何分布」，欄百分比回答另一方向。兩者分母不同，都可能合理；不能把某欄最大的格子直接解讀成該組比例最高。統計檢定要用原始計數，不以已四捨五入的百分比當觀察值。\n\n## 手算一張小表\n\n方案A有20人同意、10人不同意；B有12人同意、8人不同意。A同意率20/30=66.7%，B為12/20=60%；同意者中屬A的比例卻是20/32=62.5%。三個比例回答不同問題。完整敘述包含條件與分母，不只寫66.7%。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：五個類別各有20%，是否可知樣本數？答：不能，可能5、50或500人，需報n。問：百分比加總99.9是否一定錯？答：可能是四捨五入，原始比例應核對；若差距很大則查缺失、重複與分類定義。第十章以問卷交叉表再次實作。\n\n## 零點與視覺大小\n\nA比例51%、B50%，差1百分點。若長條軸從49%開始，柱高變成2與1，視覺看似兩倍，卻不表示實際比例兩倍。若為看微小差需截軸，應清楚標示並考慮點圖及差異區間。描述圖的尺度選擇也屬分析責任，不能只說軟體預設如此。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "2-1", "name": "屬質資料：表格法與圖示法", "html": "屬質資料：表格法與圖示法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "2-1-1", "name": "表格法", "html": "表格法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "單選、多選與分母", "html": "單選、多選與分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "2-1-2", "name": "圖示法", "html": "圖示法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "交叉分類與百分比", "html": "交叉分類與百分比", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "手算一張小表", "html": "手算一張小表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "零點與視覺大小", "html": "零點與視覺大小", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "07-quantitative-tables", "group": "tables", "title": "屬量資料：次數分配、直方圖與累積圖", "summary": "把分箱邊界、密度與累積意義寫清楚。", "tags": ["統計資料的整理與圖表", "quantitative tables"], "example": "02_tables_histogram.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"2-2\">屬量資料：次數分配、直方圖與累積圖</h1>\n<p>把分箱邊界、密度與累積意義寫清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-2-1\">表格法</h2>\n<p>把連續或很多不同值整理為組距，記下組下限、上限、寬度與次數。分箱需互不重疊且涵蓋資料；例如[0,3)、[3,6)、[6,9]，最後一組特別含9。若每組都兩端包含，邊界3與6會重複；若兩端都不含，邊界又可能遺失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">組中點與資訊流失</h2>\n<p>分組後常以組中點近似原始值，但原來組內分布已丟失。用組中點估平均只是一個近似，不能聲稱和原始資料平均必然相同。開口組例如「100以上」沒有固定中點，若沒有另外假設，就不能隨便補一個數字計算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-2-2\">圖示法</h2>\n<p>直方圖的橫軸是數值區間，柱子相連表達連續區段；長條圖的類別可有間隔。等寬分箱時次數高度方便；不等寬時用密度，讓面積對應比例。累積次數圖則顯示小於某界值的筆數或比例，適合讀中位數及分位位置。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{density}_j=\\frac{f_j}{n\\,w_j},\\qquad\n\\sum_j\\operatorname{density}_jw_j=1\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">分箱會改視覺</h2>\n<p>少數寬箱可能藏住多峰，太多窄箱可能把噪音畫成規律。比較兩組時對齊箱界與尺度，並配合原始點、箱型圖或經驗累積分布。沒有一個分箱數對所有樣本都最佳，軟體的自動規則是起點，應保留選擇與敏感度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">手算與解讀</h2>\n<p>資料[1,2,2,3,4,6,8,9]配[0,3)、[3,6)、[6,9]，次數[3,2,3]，總數8。三組寬皆3，密度分別為.125、.08333、.125。若改用最後一組寬6，其高度就需調整，不能仍以高度當比例比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>直方圖某柱密度1.5是否不合法？答：不一定；密度的單位是數值單位的倒數，面積才是比例。若箱寬.2，該柱面積.3才是比例。不要把此密度高度與第4章連續分布的點機率混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/02_tables_histogram.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 02_tables_histogram.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">8.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">9.</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">edges</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">9.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">frequency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bins</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">histogram</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bins</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">edges</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;edges&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">bins</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;counts&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">frequency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;relative_frequency&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">frequency</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;density&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">frequency</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">diff</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bins</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;closure&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;left-closed, right-open except last bin includes right endpoint&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 屬量資料：次數分配、直方圖與累積圖 {#2-2}\n\n把分箱邊界、密度與累積意義寫清楚。\n\n## 表格法 {#2-2-1}\n\n把連續或很多不同值整理為組距，記下組下限、上限、寬度與次數。分箱需互不重疊且涵蓋資料；例如[0,3)、[3,6)、[6,9]，最後一組特別含9。若每組都兩端包含，邊界3與6會重複；若兩端都不含，邊界又可能遺失。\n\n## 組中點與資訊流失\n\n分組後常以組中點近似原始值，但原來組內分布已丟失。用組中點估平均只是一個近似，不能聲稱和原始資料平均必然相同。開口組例如「100以上」沒有固定中點，若沒有另外假設，就不能隨便補一個數字計算。\n\n## 圖示法 {#2-2-2}\n\n直方圖的橫軸是數值區間，柱子相連表達連續區段；長條圖的類別可有間隔。等寬分箱時次數高度方便；不等寬時用密度，讓面積對應比例。累積次數圖則顯示小於某界值的筆數或比例，適合讀中位數及分位位置。\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{density}_j=\\frac{f_j}{n\\,w_j},\\qquad\n\\sum_j\\operatorname{density}_jw_j=1\n$$\n\n## 分箱會改視覺\n\n少數寬箱可能藏住多峰，太多窄箱可能把噪音畫成規律。比較兩組時對齊箱界與尺度，並配合原始點、箱型圖或經驗累積分布。沒有一個分箱數對所有樣本都最佳，軟體的自動規則是起點，應保留選擇與敏感度。\n\n## 手算與解讀\n\n資料[1,2,2,3,4,6,8,9]配[0,3)、[3,6)、[6,9]，次數[3,2,3]，總數8。三組寬皆3，密度分別為.125、.08333、.125。若改用最後一組寬6，其高度就需調整，不能仍以高度當比例比較。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n直方圖某柱密度1.5是否不合法？答：不一定；密度的單位是數值單位的倒數，面積才是比例。若箱寬.2，該柱面積.3才是比例。不要把此密度高度與第4章連續分布的點機率混淆。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/02_tables_histogram.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 02_tables_histogram.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    x=np.array([1.,2.,2.,3.,4.,6.,8.,9.]);edges=np.array([0.,3.,6.,9.])\n    frequency,bins=np.histogram(x,bins=edges)\n    result={'edges':bins,'counts':frequency,'relative_frequency':frequency/len(x),'density':frequency/(len(x)*np.diff(bins)),'closure':'left-closed, right-open except last bin includes right endpoint'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "2-2", "name": "屬量資料：次數分配、直方圖與累積圖", "html": "屬量資料：次數分配、直方圖與累積圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "2-2-1", "name": "表格法", "html": "表格法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "組中點與資訊流失", "html": "組中點與資訊流失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "2-2-2", "name": "圖示法", "html": "圖示法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "分箱會改視覺", "html": "分箱會改視覺", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "手算與解讀", "html": "手算與解讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "08-distribution-shapes", "group": "tables", "title": "次數分配的型態：對稱、偏態、J型與U型", "summary": "形狀是描述線索，需要與尺度、資料來源及分組方式一起解讀。", "tags": ["統計資料的整理與圖表", "distribution shapes"], "html": "<h1 id=\"2-3-ju\">次數分配的型態：對稱、偏態、J型與U型</h1>\n<p>形狀是描述線索，需要與尺度、資料來源及分組方式一起解讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-3-1\">單峰對稱分配</h2>\n<p>單一主要峰、左右大致對稱，常讓人想到常態，但對稱不保證常態，例如對稱均勻或重尾分布也可能存在。平均與中位接近是線索，不是常態檢定。先看原始點、樣本數與測量範圍，避免從少數箱子過度判讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-3-2\">單峰微偏分配</h2>\n<p>右偏表示較長尾巴伸向大值，左偏則伸向小值，名稱看尾巴而非最高柱位置。等待時間常右偏；受上限限制而多集中高分的量表可能左偏。平均容易被長尾拉動，但「右偏一定平均&gt;中位&gt;眾數」不是所有分布皆成立的定理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-3-3-jj\">J型或反J型</h2>\n<p>J型常用來描述一端高、另一端低而呈彎曲變化的次數；方向命名在教材可能不同，所以應直接描述「低值集中、向高值遞減」或反之。大量零與少數大值可能還有零膨脹、門檻或不同機制，不能僅由外型替分布模型命名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-3-4-u\">U型分配</h2>\n<p>兩端多、中間少，可能來自極化評價、邊界效應或混合來源。平均可能落在幾乎沒有人實際取到的中間，因此要同時看全分布。若從不同群體混在一起產生U型，分組後形狀可能完全不同；這提供分層分析線索，而非證明群體間因果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-3-5\">其他</h2>\n<p>雙峰、多峰、近均勻、離散尖峰及截斷分配都常見。整數題分數與連續量測的圖形也不同。更換分箱、保留原始點及按合理群組分開畫，可檢查形狀是否穩定。離群值可能是錯誤、真實少見值或混合群體，必須回查來源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>一班分數多在40與90，平均65，能否說大部分人在65附近？不能，這可能是雙峰且中間很少。若你看到右偏等待時間，能否直接用常態的±2SD涵蓋95%？不能；經驗法則依常態近似，偏態需實際分位數或合適模型。描述形狀的目的，是幫助選方法與解讀，不是替資料套唯一標籤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">混合資料的例子</h2>\n<p>若兩個設備分別穩定在10與20，合併圖可能雙峰，平均15卻不是任何設備的正常中心。合理下一步是核對設備、時間或製程標記，分開描述再研究差異；不是直接把兩峰之間資料「補齊」成常態。若每組仍有特殊點，也要保留群內診斷。分群線索不等於已證明兩種母體或原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 次數分配的型態：對稱、偏態、J型與U型 {#2-3-ju}\n\n形狀是描述線索，需要與尺度、資料來源及分組方式一起解讀。\n\n## 單峰對稱分配 {#2-3-1}\n\n單一主要峰、左右大致對稱，常讓人想到常態，但對稱不保證常態，例如對稱均勻或重尾分布也可能存在。平均與中位接近是線索，不是常態檢定。先看原始點、樣本數與測量範圍，避免從少數箱子過度判讀。\n\n## 單峰微偏分配 {#2-3-2}\n\n右偏表示較長尾巴伸向大值，左偏則伸向小值，名稱看尾巴而非最高柱位置。等待時間常右偏；受上限限制而多集中高分的量表可能左偏。平均容易被長尾拉動，但「右偏一定平均>中位>眾數」不是所有分布皆成立的定理。\n\n## J型或反J型 {#2-3-3-jj}\n\nJ型常用來描述一端高、另一端低而呈彎曲變化的次數；方向命名在教材可能不同，所以應直接描述「低值集中、向高值遞減」或反之。大量零與少數大值可能還有零膨脹、門檻或不同機制，不能僅由外型替分布模型命名。\n\n## U型分配 {#2-3-4-u}\n\n兩端多、中間少，可能來自極化評價、邊界效應或混合來源。平均可能落在幾乎沒有人實際取到的中間，因此要同時看全分布。若從不同群體混在一起產生U型，分組後形狀可能完全不同；這提供分層分析線索，而非證明群體間因果。\n\n## 其他 {#2-3-5}\n\n雙峰、多峰、近均勻、離散尖峰及截斷分配都常見。整數題分數與連續量測的圖形也不同。更換分箱、保留原始點及按合理群組分開畫，可檢查形狀是否穩定。離群值可能是錯誤、真實少見值或混合群體，必須回查來源。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n一班分數多在40與90，平均65，能否說大部分人在65附近？不能，這可能是雙峰且中間很少。若你看到右偏等待時間，能否直接用常態的±2SD涵蓋95%？不能；經驗法則依常態近似，偏態需實際分位數或合適模型。描述形狀的目的，是幫助選方法與解讀，不是替資料套唯一標籤。\n\n## 混合資料的例子\n\n若兩個設備分別穩定在10與20，合併圖可能雙峰，平均15卻不是任何設備的正常中心。合理下一步是核對設備、時間或製程標記，分開描述再研究差異；不是直接把兩峰之間資料「補齊」成常態。若每組仍有特殊點，也要保留群內診斷。分群線索不等於已證明兩種母體或原因。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "2-3-ju", "name": "次數分配的型態：對稱、偏態、J型與U型", "html": "次數分配的型態：對稱、偏態、J型與U型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "2-3-1", "name": "單峰對稱分配", "html": "單峰對稱分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "2-3-2", "name": "單峰微偏分配", "html": "單峰微偏分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "2-3-3-jj", "name": "J型或反J型", "html": "J型或反J型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "2-3-4-u", "name": "U型分配", "html": "U型分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "2-3-5", "name": "其他", "html": "其他", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "混合資料的例子", "html": "混合資料的例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "09-exercises-tables", "group": "tables", "title": "圖表習題與詳解", "summary": "核對分母、箱界與面積，學會看穿圖形錯覺。", "tags": ["統計資料的整理與圖表", "exercises tables"], "html": "<h1 id=\"02\">圖表習題與詳解</h1>\n<p>核對分母、箱界與面積，學會看穿圖形錯覺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：次數與有效比例</h2>\n<p>50份問卷，A=18、B=22、未答=10。解答：以全體為分母A36%、B44%、未答20%；以有效40份為分母A45%、B55%。兩張表都可使用，但表頭必須說明。「B有55%」若沒有分母，容易被誤認為全體比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：分箱邊界</h2>\n<p>資料[0,1,2,3,4,5]，箱界[0,2,4,6]，左含右不含。解答：各箱2筆，累積次數2、4、6；累積比例1/3、2/3、1。若最後值剛好6，應事前定義最後箱含右界或擴大界值，不能看結果後選方便規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：不等寬直方圖</h2>\n<p>100筆資料中，[0,1)有20筆，[1,3)有40筆。兩柱相對次數都是按n計算的.2與.4，但密度都是.2，因第二箱寬2。柱高相同不表示次數相同；面積分別.2與.4才表達比例。解答需寫出單位與箱寬，不能只算高度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：多選題圓餅圖</h2>\n<p>40人可選三種功能，勾選數為30、25、15。若直接畫成「人數比例」圓餅圖會如何？解答：分母若用40，各項共175%，不是互斥整體；若改用70次勾選，各扇區表示勾選次數占比，不是使用者占比。長條圖並標示每項30/40等會較清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題五：從形狀說到哪裡</h2>\n<p>一張只有三根柱的圖似乎對稱，能證明常態嗎？解答：不能，分箱太粗、樣本也可能很少。應看點圖或QQ圖、了解測量機制，並評估所用方法對偏離常態的敏感程度。圖形與形式診斷都只是證據的一部分，不是保證書。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">實作驗收</h2>\n<p>執行第02例，驗證次數和為8、密度乘箱寬再加總為1，最後一個9沒有遺漏。額外把分箱改成[0,3,9]，重新計算高度。合格解答要說明改圖後哪項資訊被合併，不能只貼出另一張圖而沒有解釋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">延伸題：累積比例</h2>\n<p>一份等待表累積在10分鐘內80%，可否說恰好10分鐘80%？不能，累積包含所有較短等待。若8分鐘內50%、10分鐘內80%，則(8,10]占30%，但前提是表格界值與含界規則相同。這個差分觀念會在第4章CDF再次出現。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">延伸題：面積與單位</h2>\n<p>把等待由小時改成分鐘，直方圖箱寬乘60，若仍以密度呈現，高度需除60，總面積才保持1。次數則不變。這個反向尺度關係可用來檢查你畫的是次數還是密度，避免把不同單位圖的柱高直接相比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_9\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 圖表習題與詳解 {#02}\n\n核對分母、箱界與面積，學會看穿圖形錯覺。\n\n## 題一：次數與有效比例\n\n50份問卷，A=18、B=22、未答=10。解答：以全體為分母A36%、B44%、未答20%；以有效40份為分母A45%、B55%。兩張表都可使用，但表頭必須說明。「B有55%」若沒有分母，容易被誤認為全體比例。\n\n## 題二：分箱邊界\n\n資料[0,1,2,3,4,5]，箱界[0,2,4,6]，左含右不含。解答：各箱2筆，累積次數2、4、6；累積比例1/3、2/3、1。若最後值剛好6，應事前定義最後箱含右界或擴大界值，不能看結果後選方便規則。\n\n## 題三：不等寬直方圖\n\n100筆資料中，[0,1)有20筆，[1,3)有40筆。兩柱相對次數都是按n計算的.2與.4，但密度都是.2，因第二箱寬2。柱高相同不表示次數相同；面積分別.2與.4才表達比例。解答需寫出單位與箱寬，不能只算高度。\n\n## 題四：多選題圓餅圖\n\n40人可選三種功能，勾選數為30、25、15。若直接畫成「人數比例」圓餅圖會如何？解答：分母若用40，各項共175%，不是互斥整體；若改用70次勾選，各扇區表示勾選次數占比，不是使用者占比。長條圖並標示每項30/40等會較清楚。\n\n## 題五：從形狀說到哪裡\n\n一張只有三根柱的圖似乎對稱，能證明常態嗎？解答：不能，分箱太粗、樣本也可能很少。應看點圖或QQ圖、了解測量機制，並評估所用方法對偏離常態的敏感程度。圖形與形式診斷都只是證據的一部分，不是保證書。\n\n## 實作驗收\n\n執行第02例，驗證次數和為8、密度乘箱寬再加總為1，最後一個9沒有遺漏。額外把分箱改成[0,3,9]，重新計算高度。合格解答要說明改圖後哪項資訊被合併，不能只貼出另一張圖而沒有解釋。\n\n## 延伸題：累積比例\n\n一份等待表累積在10分鐘內80%，可否說恰好10分鐘80%？不能，累積包含所有較短等待。若8分鐘內50%、10分鐘內80%，則(8,10]占30%，但前提是表格界值與含界規則相同。這個差分觀念會在第4章CDF再次出現。\n\n## 延伸題：面積與單位\n\n把等待由小時改成分鐘，直方圖箱寬乘60，若仍以密度呈現，高度需除60，總面積才保持1。次數則不變。這個反向尺度關係可用來檢查你畫的是次數還是密度，避免把不同單位圖的柱高直接相比。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "02", "name": "圖表習題與詳解", "html": "圖表習題與詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：次數與有效比例", "html": "題一：次數與有效比例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：分箱邊界", "html": "題二：分箱邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：不等寬直方圖", "html": "題三：不等寬直方圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：多選題圓餅圖", "html": "題四：多選題圓餅圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題五：從形狀說到哪裡", "html": "題五：從形狀說到哪裡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "實作驗收", "html": "實作驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "延伸題：累積比例", "html": "延伸題：累積比例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "延伸題：面積與單位", "html": "延伸題：面積與單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "10-central-tendency", "group": "descriptive", "title": "集中趨勢：平均、中位、分位與眾數", "summary": "依問題與尺度選摘要，清楚交代分位數的計算慣例。", "tags": ["統計量數之測量", "central tendency"], "example": "03_descriptive.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"3-1\">集中趨勢：平均、中位、分位與眾數</h1>\n<p>依問題與尺度選摘要，清楚交代分位數的計算慣例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-1-1\">算術平均數</h2>\n<p>平均x̄=Σx/n使用每個值，保持總量資訊；加常數c，平均加c；乘a，平均乘a。加權平均Σwᵢxᵢ/Σwᵢ需權重有意義，不能將大小不同群體平均再簡單平均。[1,2,3,4,100]平均22，少數大值可以強烈影響它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-1-2\">中位數</h2>\n<p>排序後居中的位置；奇數取中央，偶數常取中央兩值平均。它對少數極端值較穩健，卻不保留總量。上例中位3。對順序尺度，中位通常較有直接解釋，但偶數題的兩類之間未必有可觀察類別，應描述原類別分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-1-3\">其他分位數</h2>\n<p>四分位、百分位將排序資料分成位置比例。有限樣本存在多種插值定義；本課NumPy採<code>method='linear'</code>，如[1,2,3,4]的Q1=1.75、Q3=3.25。手算課本若使用不同秩規則，答案可不同；應核對慣例，而非直接認定軟體錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-1-4\">眾數</h2>\n<p>最常見的值或類別，可以多個並列，也可能每值同次數而沒有實用的單一眾數。連續資料的分組眾數受箱界影響。眾數可用在名目資料，但不能從類別數字代碼算平均替代它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-1-5\">關係與取捨</h2>\n<p>完全對稱且定義良好的分布可能讓平均與中位相同，常態再有眾數相同；偏態時常見排序只是經驗趨勢，不是普遍公式。比較收入、等待時間、量表或製程尺寸時，選擇需配合目的。平均回答每單位總量分攤，中位回答典型排序位置，兩者可一起報。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>兩組平均分別10與20，樣本數10與30，合併平均為(100+600)/40=17.5，不是15。將所有資料加5，中位與各分位也加5，標準差卻不變。第03例同時對照離群值前後各量數，觀察哪些量被拉動。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/03_descriptive.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 03_descriptive.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;ordinary&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;with_outlier&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">90</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;constant&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">])}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 集中趨勢：平均、中位、分位與眾數 {#3-1}\n\n依問題與尺度選摘要，清楚交代分位數的計算慣例。\n\n## 算術平均數 {#3-1-1}\n\n平均x̄=Σx/n使用每個值，保持總量資訊；加常數c，平均加c；乘a，平均乘a。加權平均Σwᵢxᵢ/Σwᵢ需權重有意義，不能將大小不同群體平均再簡單平均。[1,2,3,4,100]平均22，少數大值可以強烈影響它。\n\n## 中位數 {#3-1-2}\n\n排序後居中的位置；奇數取中央，偶數常取中央兩值平均。它對少數極端值較穩健，卻不保留總量。上例中位3。對順序尺度，中位通常較有直接解釋，但偶數題的兩類之間未必有可觀察類別，應描述原類別分布。\n\n## 其他分位數 {#3-1-3}\n\n四分位、百分位將排序資料分成位置比例。有限樣本存在多種插值定義；本課NumPy採`method='linear'`，如[1,2,3,4]的Q1=1.75、Q3=3.25。手算課本若使用不同秩規則，答案可不同；應核對慣例，而非直接認定軟體錯。\n\n## 眾數 {#3-1-4}\n\n最常見的值或類別，可以多個並列，也可能每值同次數而沒有實用的單一眾數。連續資料的分組眾數受箱界影響。眾數可用在名目資料，但不能從類別數字代碼算平均替代它。\n\n## 關係與取捨 {#3-1-5}\n\n完全對稱且定義良好的分布可能讓平均與中位相同，常態再有眾數相同；偏態時常見排序只是經驗趨勢，不是普遍公式。比較收入、等待時間、量表或製程尺寸時，選擇需配合目的。平均回答每單位總量分攤，中位回答典型排序位置，兩者可一起報。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n兩組平均分別10與20，樣本數10與30，合併平均為(100+600)/40=17.5，不是15。將所有資料加5，中位與各分位也加5，標準差卻不變。第03例同時對照離群值前後各量數，觀察哪些量被拉動。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/03_descriptive.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 03_descriptive.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result={'ordinary':describe([2,4,4,6,9]),'with_outlier':describe([2,4,4,6,90]),'constant':describe([3,3,3])}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "3-1", "name": "集中趨勢：平均、中位、分位與眾數", "html": "集中趨勢：平均、中位、分位與眾數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "3-1-1", "name": "算術平均數", "html": "算術平均數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-1-2", "name": "中位數", "html": "中位數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-1-3", "name": "其他分位數", "html": "其他分位數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-1-4", "name": "眾數", "html": "眾數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-1-5", "name": "關係與取捨", "html": "關係與取捨", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "11-dispersion", "group": "descriptive", "title": "差異量數：全距、四分位差、平均差與標準差", "summary": "分清變異數分母、穩健尺度與相對差異的適用條件。", "tags": ["統計量數之測量", "dispersion"], "html": "<h1 id=\"3-2\">差異量數：全距、四分位差、平均差與標準差</h1>\n<p>分清變異數分母、穩健尺度與相對差異的適用條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-2-1-3-2-2\">全距與四分位差</h2>\n<p>全距=max−min，只看兩端，對極端值與樣本數敏感。IQR=Q3−Q1保留中間50%的跨度；四分位差QD=IQR/2，兩者不能寫成同一名稱而不說明。本課分位計算採linear插值，與其他教材比較時先對齊規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-2-3\">平均差</h2>\n<p>以平均數為中心的平均絕對差為Σ|x−x̄|/n，與以中位數為中心的中位絕對離差MAD不同。後者常定義median(|x−median(x)|)，有時再乘常態一致化係數。單寫MAD縮寫可能混淆，本課完整寫出中心、絕對值及彙整方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-2-4\">變異數與標準差</h2>\n<p>描述有限母體可用Σ(x−μ)²/N；估iid母體變異數的樣本S²用n−1。估過平均後偏差和為零，少一個自由度；n−1使S²在iid有限變異下無偏，但S本身不因此自動無偏。標準差還原成原單位，變異數是平方單位。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\ns^2=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2}{n-1},\\qquad s=\\sqrt{s^2}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"3-2-5\">相對差異量數</h2>\n<p>CV=s/x̄常乘100%，適合正平均且有比例零點的量。攝氏溫度加273.15就變Kelvin，同一物理分散卻有不同CV，因此不能套相同相對解釋。平均接近0時CV也很不穩定；數學可算不代表分析合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-2-6\">關係與線性變換</h2>\n<p>Y=a+bX的標準差為|b|SD(X)、變異數為b²Var(X)，加常數不改分散。IQR與全距也乘|b|。兩個資料集可有相同平均與SD卻形狀不同，因此量數不能取代圖形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">手算與解答</h2>\n<p>[2,4,6]平均4，平方偏差和8，樣本變異數4、SD2；母體描述若三人即全體，變異數8/3。平均絕對差為4/3。若輸入軟體用預設<code>np.std</code>，預設ddof=0；要樣本SD明確指定ddof=1。第03例已有這個區分，不為了湊課本答案而任意改分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 差異量數：全距、四分位差、平均差與標準差 {#3-2}\n\n分清變異數分母、穩健尺度與相對差異的適用條件。\n\n## 全距與四分位差 {#3-2-1-3-2-2}\n\n全距=max−min，只看兩端，對極端值與樣本數敏感。IQR=Q3−Q1保留中間50%的跨度；四分位差QD=IQR/2，兩者不能寫成同一名稱而不說明。本課分位計算採linear插值，與其他教材比較時先對齊規則。\n\n## 平均差 {#3-2-3}\n\n以平均數為中心的平均絕對差為Σ|x−x̄|/n，與以中位數為中心的中位絕對離差MAD不同。後者常定義median(|x−median(x)|)，有時再乘常態一致化係數。單寫MAD縮寫可能混淆，本課完整寫出中心、絕對值及彙整方式。\n\n## 變異數與標準差 {#3-2-4}\n\n描述有限母體可用Σ(x−μ)²/N；估iid母體變異數的樣本S²用n−1。估過平均後偏差和為零，少一個自由度；n−1使S²在iid有限變異下無偏，但S本身不因此自動無偏。標準差還原成原單位，變異數是平方單位。\n\n$$\ns^2=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2}{n-1},\\qquad s=\\sqrt{s^2}\n$$\n\n## 相對差異量數 {#3-2-5}\n\nCV=s/x̄常乘100%，適合正平均且有比例零點的量。攝氏溫度加273.15就變Kelvin，同一物理分散卻有不同CV，因此不能套相同相對解釋。平均接近0時CV也很不穩定；數學可算不代表分析合理。\n\n## 關係與線性變換 {#3-2-6}\n\nY=a+bX的標準差為|b|SD(X)、變異數為b²Var(X)，加常數不改分散。IQR與全距也乘|b|。兩個資料集可有相同平均與SD卻形狀不同，因此量數不能取代圖形。\n\n## 手算與解答\n\n[2,4,6]平均4，平方偏差和8，樣本變異數4、SD2；母體描述若三人即全體，變異數8/3。平均絕對差為4/3。若輸入軟體用預設`np.std`，預設ddof=0；要樣本SD明確指定ddof=1。第03例已有這個區分，不為了湊課本答案而任意改分母。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "3-2", "name": "差異量數：全距、四分位差、平均差與標準差", "html": "差異量數：全距、四分位差、平均差與標準差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "3-2-1-3-2-2", "name": "全距與四分位差", "html": "全距與四分位差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-2-3", "name": "平均差", "html": "平均差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-2-4", "name": "變異數與標準差", "html": "變異數與標準差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-2-5", "name": "相對差異量數", "html": "相對差異量數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-2-6", "name": "關係與線性變換", "html": "關係與線性變換", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "手算與解答", "html": "手算與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "12-standardization-outliers", "group": "descriptive", "title": "平均與標準差的應用：Z分數、界限與離群值", "summary": "區分分布無關的保證、常態近似的經驗法則及探索旗標。", "tags": ["統計量數之測量", "standardization outliers"], "html": "<h1 id=\"3-3-z\">平均與標準差的應用：Z分數、界限與離群值</h1>\n<p>區分分布無關的保證、常態近似的經驗法則及探索旗標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-3-1-z\">Z分數</h2>\n<p>母體標準化Z=(X−μ)/σ；樣本的描述分數zᵢ=(xᵢ−x̄)/s。它表示距中心幾個標準差，不會把任意分布變成常態。σ或s必須大於0；全相同資料不能除零。比較不同測驗的Z，也要知道各自參照母體是否合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-3-2\">柴比雪夫不等式</h2>\n<p>對具有有限平均與正有限變異數的分布，k&gt;1時，距μ至少kσ的機率不超過1/k²；因此嚴格在kσ內的比例至少1−1/k²。k=2給至少75%，k=3給至少88.9%。這是保守界限，不是說實際比例恰等於此數。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP(|X-\\mu|\\geq k\\sigma)\\leq\\frac1{k^2}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"3-3-3\">經驗法則</h2>\n<p>若資料分布近似常態，約68.27%、95.45%、99.73%落在μ±1σ、±2σ、±3σ。這些近似取決於分布；右偏等待時間或重尾資料不能只套95%口訣。精確95%常態中央區間使用約1.96σ，與2σ的95.45%稍不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-3-4\">離群值偵測</h2>\n<p>箱型圖常以Q1−1.5IQR與Q3+1.5IQR標記候選離群值。Z絕對值較大也是旗標，但中心與SD可能已被極端值拉動。旗標不是自動刪除命令；回查輸入、單位、儀器、群體與真實罕見事件，保存修改紀錄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">例子：轉換不等於修正</h2>\n<p>資料[1,2,3,4,30]右偏，標準化後仍右偏。若30是合法等待事件，刪除會改你正在研究的服務風險；若原來輸入30分鐘卻誤存為30小時，則屬需可追溯修正的資料錯誤。兩者不應用相同機械規則處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>某人分數80、參照平均70、SD5，Z=2。能否直接說排名97.7百分位？只有近似常態才可由常態CDF得到這個數；單靠Z=2不能知道實際百分位。需要實際經驗分布或明示模型。若只問高出幾個SD，答案2不需常態假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">以母體資訊或樣本資訊建立旗標</h2>\n<p>若有固定參照μ、σ，新觀察的Z不受其他新觀察影響；若每批都用自己的x̄、s，旗標會隨批次改變。監控程序需先決定基準來源與更新方式，避免異常值進入基準後把自己掩蓋。描述同批資料與監測未來資料是不同工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 平均與標準差的應用：Z分數、界限與離群值 {#3-3-z}\n\n區分分布無關的保證、常態近似的經驗法則及探索旗標。\n\n## Z分數 {#3-3-1-z}\n\n母體標準化Z=(X−μ)/σ；樣本的描述分數zᵢ=(xᵢ−x̄)/s。它表示距中心幾個標準差，不會把任意分布變成常態。σ或s必須大於0；全相同資料不能除零。比較不同測驗的Z，也要知道各自參照母體是否合理。\n\n## 柴比雪夫不等式 {#3-3-2}\n\n對具有有限平均與正有限變異數的分布，k>1時，距μ至少kσ的機率不超過1/k²；因此嚴格在kσ內的比例至少1−1/k²。k=2給至少75%，k=3給至少88.9%。這是保守界限，不是說實際比例恰等於此數。\n\n$$\nP(|X-\\mu|\\geq k\\sigma)\\leq\\frac1{k^2}\n$$\n\n## 經驗法則 {#3-3-3}\n\n若資料分布近似常態，約68.27%、95.45%、99.73%落在μ±1σ、±2σ、±3σ。這些近似取決於分布；右偏等待時間或重尾資料不能只套95%口訣。精確95%常態中央區間使用約1.96σ，與2σ的95.45%稍不同。\n\n## 離群值偵測 {#3-3-4}\n\n箱型圖常以Q1−1.5IQR與Q3+1.5IQR標記候選離群值。Z絕對值較大也是旗標，但中心與SD可能已被極端值拉動。旗標不是自動刪除命令；回查輸入、單位、儀器、群體與真實罕見事件，保存修改紀錄。\n\n## 例子：轉換不等於修正\n\n資料[1,2,3,4,30]右偏，標準化後仍右偏。若30是合法等待事件，刪除會改你正在研究的服務風險；若原來輸入30分鐘卻誤存為30小時，則屬需可追溯修正的資料錯誤。兩者不應用相同機械規則處理。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n某人分數80、參照平均70、SD5，Z=2。能否直接說排名97.7百分位？只有近似常態才可由常態CDF得到這個數；單靠Z=2不能知道實際百分位。需要實際經驗分布或明示模型。若只問高出幾個SD，答案2不需常態假設。\n\n## 以母體資訊或樣本資訊建立旗標\n\n若有固定參照μ、σ，新觀察的Z不受其他新觀察影響；若每批都用自己的x̄、s，旗標會隨批次改變。監控程序需先決定基準來源與更新方式，避免異常值進入基準後把自己掩蓋。描述同批資料與監測未來資料是不同工作。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "3-3-z", "name": "平均與標準差的應用：Z分數、界限與離群值", "html": "平均與標準差的應用：Z分數、界限與離群值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "3-3-1-z", "name": "Z分數", "html": "Z分數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-3-2", "name": "柴比雪夫不等式", "html": "柴比雪夫不等式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-3-3", "name": "經驗法則", "html": "經驗法則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "3-3-4", "name": "離群值偵測", "html": "離群值偵測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "例子：轉換不等於修正", "html": "例子：轉換不等於修正", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "以母體資訊或樣本資訊建立旗標", "html": "以母體資訊或樣本資訊建立旗標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "13-exercises-descriptive", "group": "descriptive", "title": "量數習題與詳解", "summary": "完整手算一組資料，並檢查每項量數的用途。", "tags": ["統計量數之測量", "exercises descriptive"], "html": "<h1 id=\"03\">量數習題與詳解</h1>\n<p>完整手算一組資料，並檢查每項量數的用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：集中量數</h2>\n<p>資料[2,4,4,6,9]。平均=25/5=5，中位=4，眾數=4。將9改為90後平均=21.2，中位與眾數仍4。解答不是說平均錯，而是它回答的總量分攤問題對大值敏感；若關心典型排序位置，可同時報中位與分位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：分散量數</h2>\n<p>原資料相對平均5的平方偏差為9、1、1、1、16，和28。樣本變異數7，SD=√7約2.646；若這五個就是完整目標母體，描述變異數5.6。平均絕對差=(3+1+1+1+4)/5=2。分母選擇必須從問題推導。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：分位與箱型界限</h2>\n<p>採linear插值，Q1=4、Q3=6，IQR=2，四分位差1，下上界為1與9。9在界上，依嚴格超界旗標不標離群；90則超界。另一種分位慣例可能改界限，答案要把規則寫出來，而非只列「90是錯資料」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：尺度變換</h2>\n<p>若Y=10+2X，新平均20、中位18、樣本SD=2√7、變異數28。加10改平均卻不改原分散，乘2改尺度。若改為Y=10−2X，中位位置需反向排序但此例中位仍2×4的轉換結果2；SD仍2√7，不會是負數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題五：兩種界限</h2>\n<p>無分布資訊、只知有限μ和σ，±2σ內至少75%；若另外假設常態，約95.45%。解答需區分保證與模型比例，不能把較漂亮的95%寫成對所有資料有效。這也是為何後面估計與檢定總是先列條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">申論驗收</h2>\n<p>對一份偏態交貨資料，選三個摘要並說理由。可接受答案如中位、IQR與90百分位，再加平均協助總量計畫；必須說明各自用途、單位與樣本數。沒有唯一組合，但只有「因為軟體會算」不是充分理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">延伸題：同平均不等於同資料</h2>\n<p>[0,0,10,10]與[5,5,5,5]的平均都5，前者有很大分散、後者全相同；中位也同5。解答至少補SD或IQR與圖形。若業務只報平均改善，卻忽略尾端等待或不平等，可能錯過真正需要處理的風險。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 量數習題與詳解 {#03}\n\n完整手算一組資料，並檢查每項量數的用途。\n\n## 題一：集中量數\n\n資料[2,4,4,6,9]。平均=25/5=5，中位=4，眾數=4。將9改為90後平均=21.2，中位與眾數仍4。解答不是說平均錯，而是它回答的總量分攤問題對大值敏感；若關心典型排序位置，可同時報中位與分位。\n\n## 題二：分散量數\n\n原資料相對平均5的平方偏差為9、1、1、1、16，和28。樣本變異數7，SD=√7約2.646；若這五個就是完整目標母體，描述變異數5.6。平均絕對差=(3+1+1+1+4)/5=2。分母選擇必須從問題推導。\n\n## 題三：分位與箱型界限\n\n採linear插值，Q1=4、Q3=6，IQR=2，四分位差1，下上界為1與9。9在界上，依嚴格超界旗標不標離群；90則超界。另一種分位慣例可能改界限，答案要把規則寫出來，而非只列「90是錯資料」。\n\n## 題四：尺度變換\n\n若Y=10+2X，新平均20、中位18、樣本SD=2√7、變異數28。加10改平均卻不改原分散，乘2改尺度。若改為Y=10−2X，中位位置需反向排序但此例中位仍2×4的轉換結果2；SD仍2√7，不會是負數。\n\n## 題五：兩種界限\n\n無分布資訊、只知有限μ和σ，±2σ內至少75%；若另外假設常態，約95.45%。解答需區分保證與模型比例，不能把較漂亮的95%寫成對所有資料有效。這也是為何後面估計與檢定總是先列條件。\n\n## 申論驗收\n\n對一份偏態交貨資料，選三個摘要並說理由。可接受答案如中位、IQR與90百分位，再加平均協助總量計畫；必須說明各自用途、單位與樣本數。沒有唯一組合，但只有「因為軟體會算」不是充分理由。\n\n## 延伸題：同平均不等於同資料\n\n[0,0,10,10]與[5,5,5,5]的平均都5，前者有很大分散、後者全相同；中位也同5。解答至少補SD或IQR與圖形。若業務只報平均改善，卻忽略尾端等待或不平等，可能錯過真正需要處理的風險。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "03", "name": "量數習題與詳解", "html": "量數習題與詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：集中量數", "html": "題一：集中量數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：分散量數", "html": "題二：分散量數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：分位與箱型界限", "html": "題三：分位與箱型界限", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：尺度變換", "html": "題四：尺度變換", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題五：兩種界限", "html": "題五：兩種界限", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "申論驗收", "html": "申論驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "延伸題：同平均不等於同資料", "html": "延伸題：同平均不等於同資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "14-probability-rules", "group": "probability", "title": "機率概論：測度、性質與運算法則", "summary": "從事件關係出發，分清互斥、獨立與條件。", "tags": ["機率及機率分配", "probability rules"], "example": "04_probability_bayes.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"4-1\">機率概論：測度、性質與運算法則</h1>\n<p>從事件關係出發，分清互斥、獨立與條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-1-1\">機率測度的方法</h2>\n<p>古典等可能法以有利結果數／全部結果數，需要基本結果等可能；相對頻率法透過重複機制理解長期比例；主觀機率則以資訊與一致性描述信念。不是所有問題都可隨意假設等可能，也不是看到一次結果就知道真實機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-1-2\">基本性質</h2>\n<p>樣本空間Ω包含可能結果，事件為其子集合。P(A)介於0與1，P(Ω)=1；可列互斥事件的機率可加。補事件P(Aᶜ)=1−P(A)。計算前先定義單位與事件，例如「一筆訂單至少一次延誤」不同於「每次配送延誤率」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-1-3\">聯集、交集與條件</h2>\n<p>P(A∪B)=P(A)+P(B)−P(A∩B)避免重算交集。若P(B)&gt;0，P(A|B)=P(A∩B)/P(B)。獨立使P(A∩B)=P(A)P(B)；互斥則交集為0。兩個正機率事件若互斥，反而不獨立，因知道一個發生便排除另一個。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP(A\\mid B)=\\frac{P(B\\mid A)P(A)}{P(B)},\\qquad\nP(B)=P(B\\mid A)P(A)+P(B\\mid A^c)P(A^c)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">抽象檢查分類器例子</h2>\n<p>某種狀況占10%，有狀況時80%被標記，沒狀況時20%也被標記。全部被標記機率=.1×.8+.9×.2=.26；被標記中真正有狀況為.08/.26≈30.77%。在這個低先驗例子裡，誤標占被標記案例的大部分。條件方向不同，80%不能直接當成後驗比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>P(A)=.3、P(B)=.4且獨立，交集.12、聯集.58。若改為互斥，交集0、聯集.7，前面的獨立乘法便不能沿用。機率表是否正確，先核對邊際、條件分母及總和，再看小數位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/04_probability_bayes.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 04_probability_bayes.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">prior</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">sensitivity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.8</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">false_positive</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">positive</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">prior</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">sensitivity</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">prior</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">false_positive</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;P_positive&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">positive</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;P_condition_given_positive&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">prior</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">sensitivity</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">positive</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;independent_example_P_A_and_B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mf\">.3</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mf\">.4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;example&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;abstract inspection classifier&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 機率概論：測度、性質與運算法則 {#4-1}\n\n從事件關係出發，分清互斥、獨立與條件。\n\n## 機率測度的方法 {#4-1-1}\n\n古典等可能法以有利結果數／全部結果數，需要基本結果等可能；相對頻率法透過重複機制理解長期比例；主觀機率則以資訊與一致性描述信念。不是所有問題都可隨意假設等可能，也不是看到一次結果就知道真實機率。\n\n## 基本性質 {#4-1-2}\n\n樣本空間Ω包含可能結果，事件為其子集合。P(A)介於0與1，P(Ω)=1；可列互斥事件的機率可加。補事件P(Aᶜ)=1−P(A)。計算前先定義單位與事件，例如「一筆訂單至少一次延誤」不同於「每次配送延誤率」。\n\n## 聯集、交集與條件 {#4-1-3}\n\nP(A∪B)=P(A)+P(B)−P(A∩B)避免重算交集。若P(B)>0，P(A|B)=P(A∩B)/P(B)。獨立使P(A∩B)=P(A)P(B)；互斥則交集為0。兩個正機率事件若互斥，反而不獨立，因知道一個發生便排除另一個。\n\n$$\nP(A\\mid B)=\\frac{P(B\\mid A)P(A)}{P(B)},\\qquad\nP(B)=P(B\\mid A)P(A)+P(B\\mid A^c)P(A^c)\n$$\n\n## 抽象檢查分類器例子\n\n某種狀況占10%，有狀況時80%被標記，沒狀況時20%也被標記。全部被標記機率=.1×.8+.9×.2=.26；被標記中真正有狀況為.08/.26≈30.77%。在這個低先驗例子裡，誤標占被標記案例的大部分。條件方向不同，80%不能直接當成後驗比例。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nP(A)=.3、P(B)=.4且獨立，交集.12、聯集.58。若改為互斥，交集0、聯集.7，前面的獨立乘法便不能沿用。機率表是否正確，先核對邊際、條件分母及總和，再看小數位。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/04_probability_bayes.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 04_probability_bayes.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    prior=.1;sensitivity=.8;false_positive=.2\n    positive=prior*sensitivity+(1-prior)*false_positive\n    result={'P_positive':positive,'P_condition_given_positive':prior*sensitivity/positive,'independent_example_P_A_and_B':.3*.4,'example':'abstract inspection classifier'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "4-1", "name": "機率概論：測度、性質與運算法則", "html": "機率概論：測度、性質與運算法則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "4-1-1", "name": "機率測度的方法", "html": "機率測度的方法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-1-2", "name": "基本性質", "html": "基本性質", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-1-3", "name": "聯集、交集與條件", "html": "聯集、交集與條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "抽象檢查分類器例子", "html": "抽象檢查分類器例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "15-random-variables", "group": "probability", "title": "隨機變數及離散、連續機率分配", "summary": "把結果映射成數字，分清PMF、PDF、CDF與點機率。", "tags": ["機率及機率分配", "random variables"], "example": "05_random_variable.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"4-2\">隨機變數及離散、連續機率分配</h1>\n<p>把結果映射成數字，分清PMF、PDF、CDF與點機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-2-1\">隨機變數</h2>\n<p>隨機變數把基本結果映射成數值，例如兩次擲硬幣的正面數X可為0、1、2。它不是任意變動的代數未知數，而是定義在隨機機制上的函數。單位轉換、總和與差也會產生新的隨機變數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-2-2\">機率分配</h2>\n<p>分配描述哪些值可能出現及其機率結構。累積分配F(x)=P(X≤x)對離散連續皆適用，單調不減，兩端極限為0與1。區間機率需注意含不含邊界，離散資料在邊界可能有正機率，連續分布通常沒有。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-2-3\">間斷或離散分配</h2>\n<p>PMF p(x)=P(X=x)，每項非負、全部相加為1。若X取[0,1,2]、機率[.2,.5,.3]，F(1)=.7，P(X≥1)=.8。用CDF算P(a≤X≤b)時，整數情況常寫F(b)−F(a−1)，不是F(b)−F(a)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-2-4\">連續分配</h2>\n<p>PDF f(x)的積分為1，區間機率是面積；單點機率為0，密度可以大於1。連續均勻U(0,.5)的密度2，但整體面積2×.5=1，並未違反機率上限。CDF為密度累積積分；對連續分布P(a&lt;X≤b)=F(b)−F(a)。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nF(x)=P(X\\leq x),\\qquad\nP(a&lt;X\\leq b)=\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">軟體與尾端計算</h2>\n<p>SciPy以pmf對離散、pdf對連續、cdf對左尾、sf對右尾、ppf對分位數。極小右尾用sf通常比1−cdf穩定。每種分配的參數命名也需查，例如normal的scale是SD而非variance。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：連續X恰等於1機率0，是否表示不會觀察到顯示值1？答：裝置通常四捨五入，顯示1代表一段範圍，不是精確單點。資料記錄機制和理論分布需分清；也可能有零點質量與連續部分的混合分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/05_random_variable.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 05_random_variable.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.3</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"nd\">@p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;expectation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;variance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(((</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"nd\">@p</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;cdf_at_1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;uniform_continuous_interval_probability&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 隨機變數及離散、連續機率分配 {#4-2}\n\n把結果映射成數字，分清PMF、PDF、CDF與點機率。\n\n## 隨機變數 {#4-2-1}\n\n隨機變數把基本結果映射成數值，例如兩次擲硬幣的正面數X可為0、1、2。它不是任意變動的代數未知數，而是定義在隨機機制上的函數。單位轉換、總和與差也會產生新的隨機變數。\n\n## 機率分配 {#4-2-2}\n\n分配描述哪些值可能出現及其機率結構。累積分配F(x)=P(X≤x)對離散連續皆適用，單調不減，兩端極限為0與1。區間機率需注意含不含邊界，離散資料在邊界可能有正機率，連續分布通常沒有。\n\n## 間斷或離散分配 {#4-2-3}\n\nPMF p(x)=P(X=x)，每項非負、全部相加為1。若X取[0,1,2]、機率[.2,.5,.3]，F(1)=.7，P(X≥1)=.8。用CDF算P(a≤X≤b)時，整數情況常寫F(b)−F(a−1)，不是F(b)−F(a)。\n\n## 連續分配 {#4-2-4}\n\nPDF f(x)的積分為1，區間機率是面積；單點機率為0，密度可以大於1。連續均勻U(0,.5)的密度2，但整體面積2×.5=1，並未違反機率上限。CDF為密度累積積分；對連續分布P(a<X≤b)=F(b)−F(a)。\n\n$$\nF(x)=P(X\\leq x),\\qquad\nP(a<X\\leq b)=\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt\n$$\n\n## 軟體與尾端計算\n\nSciPy以pmf對離散、pdf對連續、cdf對左尾、sf對右尾、ppf對分位數。極小右尾用sf通常比1−cdf穩定。每種分配的參數命名也需查，例如normal的scale是SD而非variance。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：連續X恰等於1機率0，是否表示不會觀察到顯示值1？答：裝置通常四捨五入，顯示1代表一段範圍，不是精確單點。資料記錄機制和理論分布需分清；也可能有零點質量與連續部分的混合分配。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/05_random_variable.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 05_random_variable.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    values=np.array([0.,1.,2.]);p=np.array([.2,.5,.3]);mean=float(values@p)\n    result={'expectation':mean,'variance':float(((values-mean)**2)@p),'cdf_at_1':float(p[:2].sum()),'uniform_continuous_interval_probability':stats.uniform.cdf(.7)-stats.uniform.cdf(.2)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "4-2", "name": "隨機變數及離散、連續機率分配", "html": "隨機變數及離散、連續機率分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "4-2-1", "name": "隨機變數", "html": "隨機變數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-2-2", "name": "機率分配", "html": "機率分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-2-3", "name": "間斷或離散分配", "html": "間斷或離散分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-2-4", "name": "連續分配", "html": "連續分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "軟體與尾端計算", "html": "軟體與尾端計算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "16-expectation-variance", "group": "probability", "title": "期望值與變異數的性質：總和與相依", "summary": "從加權平均推到變異，特別留意共變異數不能任意省略。", "tags": ["機率及機率分配", "expectation variance"], "html": "<h1 id=\"4-3\">期望值與變異數的性質：總和與相依</h1>\n<p>從加權平均推到變異，特別留意共變異數不能任意省略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-3-1\">離散隨機變數</h2>\n<p>E(X)=Σxp(x)，是分配加權平均，不保證是能實際取到的值。公平骰子平均3.5，沒有一面是3.5。Var(X)=E[(X−μ)²]=E(X²)−μ²，須期望存在；有些重尾分布的平均或變異數不存在，不能對所有隨機變數強套SD。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-3-2\">連續隨機變數</h2>\n<p>將加總改為積分，E[g(X)]=∫g(x)f(x)dx。U(0,1)的均值∫x dx=.5，二階矩∫x² dx=1/3，變異數1/3−1/4=1/12。期望對應模型下長期平均，不是每次抽樣一定得到的中心數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">線性期望</h2>\n<p>E(a+bX)=a+bE(X)，E(X+Y)=E(X)+E(Y)不需要獨立。一般E[g(X)]不等於g(E(X))，例如E(X²)=Var(X)+μ²。把平均丟進非線性函數，通常不能取代先算每筆再平均。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">變異數與共變異數</h2>\n<p>Var(a+bX)=b²Var(X)。總和的變異數還要加相依項；若獨立且變異數存在，共變異數為0，但反向一般不成立。不放回抽樣或同一人重複量測，正是後面需要特別處理相依的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{Var}(X+Y)=\\operatorname{Var}(X)+\\operatorname{Var}(Y)+2\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一組手算</h2>\n<p>X取0、1、2，機率.2、.5、.3，E(X)=1.1，E(X²)=1.7，Var=.49。若Y=10+2X，E(Y)=12.2、Var(Y)=1.96。若再令Z=X，X與Z不是獨立；Var(X+Z)=4Var(X)=1.96，不能只相加得到.98。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>兩個獨立裝箱時間平均3、4，變異數1、2，總時間平均7、變異數3。若二者共變異數.5，總變異數4。平均不需獨立、簡單變異數相加需要不相關或適當條件；答題要把這兩個規則分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 期望值與變異數的性質：總和與相依 {#4-3}\n\n從加權平均推到變異，特別留意共變異數不能任意省略。\n\n## 離散隨機變數 {#4-3-1}\n\nE(X)=Σxp(x)，是分配加權平均，不保證是能實際取到的值。公平骰子平均3.5，沒有一面是3.5。Var(X)=E[(X−μ)²]=E(X²)−μ²，須期望存在；有些重尾分布的平均或變異數不存在，不能對所有隨機變數強套SD。\n\n## 連續隨機變數 {#4-3-2}\n\n將加總改為積分，E[g(X)]=∫g(x)f(x)dx。U(0,1)的均值∫x dx=.5，二階矩∫x² dx=1/3，變異數1/3−1/4=1/12。期望對應模型下長期平均，不是每次抽樣一定得到的中心數字。\n\n## 線性期望\n\nE(a+bX)=a+bE(X)，E(X+Y)=E(X)+E(Y)不需要獨立。一般E[g(X)]不等於g(E(X))，例如E(X²)=Var(X)+μ²。把平均丟進非線性函數，通常不能取代先算每筆再平均。\n\n## 變異數與共變異數\n\nVar(a+bX)=b²Var(X)。總和的變異數還要加相依項；若獨立且變異數存在，共變異數為0，但反向一般不成立。不放回抽樣或同一人重複量測，正是後面需要特別處理相依的原因。\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{Var}(X+Y)=\\operatorname{Var}(X)+\\operatorname{Var}(Y)+2\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y)\n$$\n\n## 一組手算\n\nX取0、1、2，機率.2、.5、.3，E(X)=1.1，E(X²)=1.7，Var=.49。若Y=10+2X，E(Y)=12.2、Var(Y)=1.96。若再令Z=X，X與Z不是獨立；Var(X+Z)=4Var(X)=1.96，不能只相加得到.98。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n兩個獨立裝箱時間平均3、4，變異數1、2，總時間平均7、變異數3。若二者共變異數.5，總變異數4。平均不需獨立、簡單變異數相加需要不相關或適當條件；答題要把這兩個規則分開。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "4-3", "name": "期望值與變異數的性質：總和與相依", "html": "期望值與變異數的性質：總和與相依", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "4-3-1", "name": "離散隨機變數", "html": "離散隨機變數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-3-2", "name": "連續隨機變數", "html": "連續隨機變數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "線性期望", "html": "線性期望", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "變異數與共變異數", "html": "變異數與共變異數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一組手算", "html": "一組手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "17-discrete-families", "group": "probability", "title": "常用離散分配：均等、二項、超幾何與Poisson", "summary": "依抽樣機制選分配，而不是依資料是整數就隨便挑。", "tags": ["機率及機率分配", "discrete families"], "example": "06_discrete_distributions.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"4-4-poisson\">常用離散分配：均等、二項、超幾何與Poisson</h1>\n<p>依抽樣機制選分配，而不是依資料是整數就隨便挑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-4-1\">間斷型均等分配</h2>\n<p>有限k個等可能整數，各機率1/k。對a至b整數，均值(a+b)/2，變異數((b−a+1)²−1)/12。SciPy randint(low,high)不含high，所以公平骰子用randint(1,7)，不是(1,6)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-4-2\">二項分配</h2>\n<p>固定n次、每次二元、相互獨立且成功率p相同，X為成功次數。均值np、變異數np(1−p)。n與成功定義需事先固定；同一批產品缺陷有群聚或p隨時間改變時，簡單二項可能低估變動。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP(X=k)=\\binom nk p^k(1-p)^{n-k}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"4-4-3\">超幾何分配</h2>\n<p>有限N個中有K個成功，不放回抽n個，成功數X為超幾何。機率為C(K,k)C(N−K,n−k)/C(N,n)。均值nK/N，變異數除二項部分還乘(N−n)/(N−1)。抽樣比例小時可能近似二項，但精確機制仍不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-4-4-poisson\">Poisson分配</h2>\n<p>指定時窗／區域的事件數，參數λ代表該窗預期次數，均值與變異數皆λ。理想Poisson過程還有獨立增量等條件；計數資料不會自動符合。若平均2、變異數20，應檢查群聚、異質或模型，而非忽略過度離散。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP(X=k)=e^{-\\lambda}\\frac{\\lambda^k}{k!}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">選擇與解答</h2>\n<p>20件有5件缺陷、不放回抽4件，用超幾何；固定10次獨立成功率.2，用二項；每小時到達數在適當過程下用Poisson。P(X≥3)可用sf(2)，不要寫sf(3)而漏掉3。第06例並列四種分配，讓參數與事件定義可核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/06_discrete_distributions.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 06_discrete_distributions.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;uniform_mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randint</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;binomial_P_X_eq_3&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binom</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pmf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;hypergeometric_P_X_eq_2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hypergeom</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pmf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;poisson_P_X_ge_3&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">poisson</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;poisson_mean_variance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">poisson</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">poisson</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)]}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 常用離散分配：均等、二項、超幾何與Poisson {#4-4-poisson}\n\n依抽樣機制選分配，而不是依資料是整數就隨便挑。\n\n## 間斷型均等分配 {#4-4-1}\n\n有限k個等可能整數，各機率1/k。對a至b整數，均值(a+b)/2，變異數((b−a+1)²−1)/12。SciPy randint(low,high)不含high，所以公平骰子用randint(1,7)，不是(1,6)。\n\n## 二項分配 {#4-4-2}\n\n固定n次、每次二元、相互獨立且成功率p相同，X為成功次數。均值np、變異數np(1−p)。n與成功定義需事先固定；同一批產品缺陷有群聚或p隨時間改變時，簡單二項可能低估變動。\n\n$$\nP(X=k)=\\binom nk p^k(1-p)^{n-k}\n$$\n\n## 超幾何分配 {#4-4-3}\n\n有限N個中有K個成功，不放回抽n個，成功數X為超幾何。機率為C(K,k)C(N−K,n−k)/C(N,n)。均值nK/N，變異數除二項部分還乘(N−n)/(N−1)。抽樣比例小時可能近似二項，但精確機制仍不同。\n\n## Poisson分配 {#4-4-4-poisson}\n\n指定時窗／區域的事件數，參數λ代表該窗預期次數，均值與變異數皆λ。理想Poisson過程還有獨立增量等條件；計數資料不會自動符合。若平均2、變異數20，應檢查群聚、異質或模型，而非忽略過度離散。\n\n$$\nP(X=k)=e^{-\\lambda}\\frac{\\lambda^k}{k!}\n$$\n\n## 選擇與解答\n\n20件有5件缺陷、不放回抽4件，用超幾何；固定10次獨立成功率.2，用二項；每小時到達數在適當過程下用Poisson。P(X≥3)可用sf(2)，不要寫sf(3)而漏掉3。第06例並列四種分配，讓參數與事件定義可核對。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/06_discrete_distributions.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 06_discrete_distributions.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result={'uniform_mean':stats.randint.mean(1,7),'binomial_P_X_eq_3':stats.binom.pmf(3,10,.2),'hypergeometric_P_X_eq_2':stats.hypergeom.pmf(2,20,5,4),'poisson_P_X_ge_3':stats.poisson.sf(2,2),'poisson_mean_variance':[stats.poisson.mean(2),stats.poisson.var(2)]}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "4-4-poisson", "name": "常用離散分配：均等、二項、超幾何與Poisson", "html": "常用離散分配：均等、二項、超幾何與Poisson", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "4-4-1", "name": "間斷型均等分配", "html": "間斷型均等分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-4-2", "name": "二項分配", "html": "二項分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-4-3", "name": "超幾何分配", "html": "超幾何分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-4-4-poisson", "name": "Poisson分配", "html": "Poisson分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "選擇與解答", "html": "選擇與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "18-continuous-families", "group": "probability", "title": "連續均勻、常態與二項的常態近似", "summary": "分清精確模型、標準化與近似條件，完整處理連續性修正。", "tags": ["機率及機率分配", "continuous families"], "example": "07_normal_approximation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"4-5\">連續均勻、常態與二項的常態近似</h1>\n<p>分清精確模型、標準化與近似條件，完整處理連續性修正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-5-1\">連續均勻分配</h2>\n<p>U(a,b)在區間內密度1/(b−a)，均值(a+b)/2、變異數(b−a)²/12。區間機率等於交集長度／總長度。SciPy uniform(loc=a,scale=b−a)，scale不是上界b；這個參數差異常造成看似合理但錯誤的答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4-5-2\">常態分配</h2>\n<p>X∼N(μ,σ²)，對稱、單峰，μ決定位置、σ&gt;0決定尺度；標準化Z=(X−μ)/σ後為N(0,1)。SciPy norm的scale輸入σ，不是σ²。面積由CDF或SF計算，求切點用PPF；右尾極小時優先用SF。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nf(x)=\\frac1{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\exp\\!\\left[-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right]\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"4-5-3\">二項與常態的關係</h2>\n<p>對二項X，常用N(np,np(1−p))近似。np、n(1−p)不能太小是常見檢查，但門檻5或10只是經驗規則，尾端精確度仍需比較。電腦可直接算binom時，保留精確值作核對；近似用來理解形狀與抽樣推論，不必為省事放棄可取得的精確答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">連續性修正</h2>\n<p>P(a≤X≤b)用常態區間[a−.5,b+.5]；P(X≥k)對應大於k−.5；P(X≤k)對應小於k+.5。這是以連續面積代表整數格子，方向寫反會造成系統誤差。若算雙尾檢定，還要依檢定定義，不能任意拼湊兩尾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">完整例子</h2>\n<p>n=100、p=.4，平均40、SD√24。P(35≤X≤45)的精確值為CDF(45)−CDF(34)；近似使用34.5與45.5標準化。第07例實際列兩值及絕對誤差，而非只說「樣本大可用常態」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>σ=4時variance為16；若誤把16當scale，分布會寬四倍。n=10、p=.02，np=.2，常態近似可能給不合理尾部；應直接用二項。常態資料與樣本平均漸近常態是不同敘述，下一章會專門分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/07_normal_approximation.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 07_normal_approximation.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.4</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">lower</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">35</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">upper</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">45</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">sd</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sqrt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binom</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">upper</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binom</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lower</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">approx</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">upper</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">sd</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">lower</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">sd</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;exact_binomial&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;normal_with_continuity_correction&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">approx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;absolute_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">approx</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;np_nq&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)]}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 連續均勻、常態與二項的常態近似 {#4-5}\n\n分清精確模型、標準化與近似條件，完整處理連續性修正。\n\n## 連續均勻分配 {#4-5-1}\n\nU(a,b)在區間內密度1/(b−a)，均值(a+b)/2、變異數(b−a)²/12。區間機率等於交集長度／總長度。SciPy uniform(loc=a,scale=b−a)，scale不是上界b；這個參數差異常造成看似合理但錯誤的答案。\n\n## 常態分配 {#4-5-2}\n\nX∼N(μ,σ²)，對稱、單峰，μ決定位置、σ>0決定尺度；標準化Z=(X−μ)/σ後為N(0,1)。SciPy norm的scale輸入σ，不是σ²。面積由CDF或SF計算，求切點用PPF；右尾極小時優先用SF。\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac1{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\exp\\!\\left[-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right]\n$$\n\n## 二項與常態的關係 {#4-5-3}\n\n對二項X，常用N(np,np(1−p))近似。np、n(1−p)不能太小是常見檢查，但門檻5或10只是經驗規則，尾端精確度仍需比較。電腦可直接算binom時，保留精確值作核對；近似用來理解形狀與抽樣推論，不必為省事放棄可取得的精確答案。\n\n## 連續性修正\n\nP(a≤X≤b)用常態區間[a−.5,b+.5]；P(X≥k)對應大於k−.5；P(X≤k)對應小於k+.5。這是以連續面積代表整數格子，方向寫反會造成系統誤差。若算雙尾檢定，還要依檢定定義，不能任意拼湊兩尾。\n\n## 完整例子\n\nn=100、p=.4，平均40、SD√24。P(35≤X≤45)的精確值為CDF(45)−CDF(34)；近似使用34.5與45.5標準化。第07例實際列兩值及絕對誤差，而非只說「樣本大可用常態」。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nσ=4時variance為16；若誤把16當scale，分布會寬四倍。n=10、p=.02，np=.2，常態近似可能給不合理尾部；應直接用二項。常態資料與樣本平均漸近常態是不同敘述，下一章會專門分開。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/07_normal_approximation.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 07_normal_approximation.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    n=100;p=.4;lower=35;upper=45;sd=np.sqrt(n*p*(1-p))\n    exact=stats.binom.cdf(upper,n,p)-stats.binom.cdf(lower-1,n,p)\n    approx=stats.norm.cdf((upper+.5-n*p)/sd)-stats.norm.cdf((lower-.5-n*p)/sd)\n    result={'exact_binomial':exact,'normal_with_continuity_correction':approx,'absolute_error':abs(exact-approx),'np_nq':[n*p,n*(1-p)]}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "4-5", "name": "連續均勻、常態與二項的常態近似", "html": "連續均勻、常態與二項的常態近似", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "4-5-1", "name": "連續均勻分配", "html": "連續均勻分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-5-2", "name": "常態分配", "html": "常態分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "4-5-3", "name": "二項與常態的關係", "html": "二項與常態的關係", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "連續性修正", "html": "連續性修正", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "完整例子", "html": "完整例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "19-exercises-probability", "group": "probability", "title": "機率與分配習題詳解", "summary": "從事件、參數到尾端計算，逐步驗證每個答案。", "tags": ["機率及機率分配", "exercises probability"], "html": "<h1 id=\"04\">機率與分配習題詳解</h1>\n<p>從事件、參數到尾端計算，逐步驗證每個答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：條件方向</h2>\n<p>某抽象分類器先驗.1、偵測率.8、誤標率.2，標記後真正有狀況的比例？答案.08/(.08+.18)=4/13≈.3077。若只回.8，就把P(標記|狀況)反成P(狀況|標記)。畫兩層樹狀機率或2×2表可檢查每條路徑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：離散期望</h2>\n<p>X取0、1、2，機率.25、.5、.25。E(X)=1、E(X²)=1.5、Var=.5。Y=3−2X的均值1、變異數2；標準差√2。負係數不會讓變異數負，因為它要平方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：不放回抽樣</h2>\n<p>N=10、K=3、n=2，恰有1個成功的機率=C(3,1)C(7,1)/C(10,2)=21/45。若誤用Binomial(2,.3)會得.42，與21/45不同。兩者差異來自相依，而不是組合公式有四捨五入問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"poisson\">題四：Poisson尾端</h2>\n<p>λ=2，至少一次機率1−e⁻²≈.8647；至少三次為1−e⁻²(1+2+2²/2)。用SciPy為poisson.sf(2,2)。如果時窗從一小時換成半小時，只有在強度等條件成立時λ才可相應縮成1，不能忽略單位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題五：均勻與密度</h2>\n<p>U(2,6)落在[3,5]機率2/4=.5，均值4、變異數16/12。密度.25不是單點機率；P(X=4)=0。若儀器記到整數，顯示4對應如[3.5,4.5)的區間，需另外定義讀值規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題六：常態與連續修正</h2>\n<p>X∼N(10,4)，此記號第二參數是variance，SD2，P(X&gt;14)=P(Z&gt;2)≈.02275。Binomial的P(X≥14)若採常態近似，界值則13.5，因事件是整數。解題時先寫分配與參數慣例，再標準化，可避免把兩種14混為一談。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">延伸題：至少與超過</h2>\n<p>整數X的「至少3」含3，「超過3」不含3。因此Poisson sf(2)與sf(3)差的正是P(X=3)。連續分布單點機率為0時，這兩種邊界差異通常不影響理論面積；離散與四捨五入資料則需明確。先將中文事件寫成不等式，再選CDF／SF。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 機率與分配習題詳解 {#04}\n\n從事件、參數到尾端計算，逐步驗證每個答案。\n\n## 題一：條件方向\n\n某抽象分類器先驗.1、偵測率.8、誤標率.2，標記後真正有狀況的比例？答案.08/(.08+.18)=4/13≈.3077。若只回.8，就把P(標記|狀況)反成P(狀況|標記)。畫兩層樹狀機率或2×2表可檢查每條路徑。\n\n## 題二：離散期望\n\nX取0、1、2，機率.25、.5、.25。E(X)=1、E(X²)=1.5、Var=.5。Y=3−2X的均值1、變異數2；標準差√2。負係數不會讓變異數負，因為它要平方。\n\n## 題三：不放回抽樣\n\nN=10、K=3、n=2，恰有1個成功的機率=C(3,1)C(7,1)/C(10,2)=21/45。若誤用Binomial(2,.3)會得.42，與21/45不同。兩者差異來自相依，而不是組合公式有四捨五入問題。\n\n## 題四：Poisson尾端\n\nλ=2，至少一次機率1−e⁻²≈.8647；至少三次為1−e⁻²(1+2+2²/2)。用SciPy為poisson.sf(2,2)。如果時窗從一小時換成半小時，只有在強度等條件成立時λ才可相應縮成1，不能忽略單位。\n\n## 題五：均勻與密度\n\nU(2,6)落在[3,5]機率2/4=.5，均值4、變異數16/12。密度.25不是單點機率；P(X=4)=0。若儀器記到整數，顯示4對應如[3.5,4.5)的區間，需另外定義讀值規則。\n\n## 題六：常態與連續修正\n\nX∼N(10,4)，此記號第二參數是variance，SD2，P(X>14)=P(Z>2)≈.02275。Binomial的P(X≥14)若採常態近似，界值則13.5，因事件是整數。解題時先寫分配與參數慣例，再標準化，可避免把兩種14混為一談。\n\n## 延伸題：至少與超過\n\n整數X的「至少3」含3，「超過3」不含3。因此Poisson sf(2)與sf(3)差的正是P(X=3)。連續分布單點機率為0時，這兩種邊界差異通常不影響理論面積；離散與四捨五入資料則需明確。先將中文事件寫成不等式，再選CDF／SF。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "04", "name": "機率與分配習題詳解", "html": "機率與分配習題詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：條件方向", "html": "題一：條件方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：離散期望", "html": "題二：離散期望", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：不放回抽樣", "html": "題三：不放回抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "poisson", "name": "題四：Poisson尾端", "html": "題四：Poisson尾端", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題五：均勻與密度", "html": "題五：均勻與密度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題六：常態與連續修正", "html": "題六：常態與連續修正", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "延伸題：至少與超過", "html": "延伸題：至少與超過", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "20-sampling-basics", "group": "sampling", "title": "抽樣的基本概念：抽樣誤差與非抽樣誤差", "summary": "樣本數不是唯一品質指標，先看誰有機會被觀察。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "sampling basics"], "html": "<h1 id=\"5-1\">抽樣的基本概念：抽樣誤差與非抽樣誤差</h1>\n<p>樣本數不是唯一品質指標，先看誰有機會被觀察。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為何不總做普查</h2>\n<p>普查可能昂貴、慢或會破壞產品；抽樣可在成本與精確度間取得平衡。普查也有漏列、無回應與測量錯誤，並不自動等於真相。若研究的是未來製程，即使觀察今天全部產品，也仍需考慮跨時間的推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">定義抽樣單位與抽樣框</h2>\n<p>研究個人，卻從家庭抽，再抽家中一人，是多階段設計，納入機率可能不同。抽樣框是實際可抽的名單，不一定覆蓋目標母體。規劃時寫明目標、時間、框、抽取程序、入選機率與聯絡方式，之後才知道估計與權重如何計算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">抽樣誤差</h2>\n<p>在同一設計下換樣本，統計量會變動；這種變動可透過抽樣分配與標準誤描述。樣本數增加通常降低此類誤差，但群聚、抽樣比例與權重都影響實際精確度。不能把「有500人」直接換成任何情況都有效的誤差百分比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">非抽樣誤差</h2>\n<p>涵蓋不足、無回應、問題誘導、回憶偏差、輸入與處理錯誤，可能造成系統偏差。若不願回答者恰好較不滿意，回覆平均偏高，增加相同招募方式的回覆未必修好。追蹤未回應、改善題目與設計，是分析前的重要工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">樣本代表性的限制</h2>\n<p>隨機抽取支持設計式推論，但一次樣本仍可能不平衡；方便或自願樣本可能外觀很大卻無明確入選機率。事後加權要有可信的母體資訊及模型假設，不能把已知邊際比例對齊就聲稱一切選擇偏差消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>題：兩份調查，A隨機抽500人、回應率低；B社群自願收5000人，哪份一定較好？答：沒有只憑這些數字的保證。應比較框、無回應、問題、權重與研究目標。估計精確與偏差控制是不同維度；完整報告要呈現資料取得過程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">分析前留下招募流向</h2>\n<p>例如抽出800個ID、成功聯絡600、回覆360、符合納入條件320，不能只寫「樣本320」。保留每步分母與排除理由，才能區分不可聯絡、拒答與資格不合。若還有題項缺失，之後每項分析的有效n再另外列；抽樣誤差估計不能替代這份來源紀錄。這也讓後續研究能判斷哪些改進應放在抽樣、追蹤或問卷本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">精確度需求的分層</h2>\n<p>若總體需要±3百分點，不代表每個小群也有同樣精度。小群樣本更少，分組區間通常較寬；規劃需要先寫主目標與重要分組，再配置樣本。事後把很多人切成很小子群，不能沿用原總體誤差標示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_9\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 抽樣的基本概念：抽樣誤差與非抽樣誤差 {#5-1}\n\n樣本數不是唯一品質指標，先看誰有機會被觀察。\n\n## 為何不總做普查\n\n普查可能昂貴、慢或會破壞產品；抽樣可在成本與精確度間取得平衡。普查也有漏列、無回應與測量錯誤，並不自動等於真相。若研究的是未來製程，即使觀察今天全部產品，也仍需考慮跨時間的推論。\n\n## 定義抽樣單位與抽樣框\n\n研究個人，卻從家庭抽，再抽家中一人，是多階段設計，納入機率可能不同。抽樣框是實際可抽的名單，不一定覆蓋目標母體。規劃時寫明目標、時間、框、抽取程序、入選機率與聯絡方式，之後才知道估計與權重如何計算。\n\n## 抽樣誤差\n\n在同一設計下換樣本，統計量會變動；這種變動可透過抽樣分配與標準誤描述。樣本數增加通常降低此類誤差，但群聚、抽樣比例與權重都影響實際精確度。不能把「有500人」直接換成任何情況都有效的誤差百分比。\n\n## 非抽樣誤差\n\n涵蓋不足、無回應、問題誘導、回憶偏差、輸入與處理錯誤，可能造成系統偏差。若不願回答者恰好較不滿意，回覆平均偏高，增加相同招募方式的回覆未必修好。追蹤未回應、改善題目與設計，是分析前的重要工作。\n\n## 樣本代表性的限制\n\n隨機抽取支持設計式推論，但一次樣本仍可能不平衡；方便或自願樣本可能外觀很大卻無明確入選機率。事後加權要有可信的母體資訊及模型假設，不能把已知邊際比例對齊就聲稱一切選擇偏差消失。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n題：兩份調查，A隨機抽500人、回應率低；B社群自願收5000人，哪份一定較好？答：沒有只憑這些數字的保證。應比較框、無回應、問題、權重與研究目標。估計精確與偏差控制是不同維度；完整報告要呈現資料取得過程。\n\n## 分析前留下招募流向\n\n例如抽出800個ID、成功聯絡600、回覆360、符合納入條件320，不能只寫「樣本320」。保留每步分母與排除理由，才能區分不可聯絡、拒答與資格不合。若還有題項缺失，之後每項分析的有效n再另外列；抽樣誤差估計不能替代這份來源紀錄。這也讓後續研究能判斷哪些改進應放在抽樣、追蹤或問卷本身。\n\n## 精確度需求的分層\n\n若總體需要±3百分點，不代表每個小群也有同樣精度。小群樣本更少，分組區間通常較寬；規劃需要先寫主目標與重要分組，再配置樣本。事後把很多人切成很小子群，不能沿用原總體誤差標示。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-1", "name": "抽樣的基本概念：抽樣誤差與非抽樣誤差", "html": "抽樣的基本概念：抽樣誤差與非抽樣誤差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為何不總做普查", "html": "為何不總做普查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "定義抽樣單位與抽樣框", "html": "定義抽樣單位與抽樣框", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "抽樣誤差", "html": "抽樣誤差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "非抽樣誤差", "html": "非抽樣誤差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "樣本代表性的限制", "html": "樣本代表性的限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "分析前留下招募流向", "html": "分析前留下招募流向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "精確度需求的分層", "html": "精確度需求的分層", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "21-sampling-designs", "group": "sampling", "title": "四種抽樣方法：簡單、分層、群集與系統", "summary": "將抽取程序與估計變異一起規劃，不把不同設計都當SRS。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "sampling designs"], "example": "08_sampling_designs.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"5-2\">四種抽樣方法：簡單、分層、群集與系統</h1>\n<p>將抽取程序與估計變異一起規劃，不把不同設計都當SRS。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-2-1\">簡單隨機抽樣</h2>\n<p>有限名單中不放回抽n人，使每個n人子集合機會相同。程式先固定完整ID框，再以rng.choice(replace=False)抽取。方便取前n列不是隨機；打散順序若與內容或來源有關，也不能不檢查就當作等機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-2-2\">分層隨機抽樣</h2>\n<p>先依已知層分開，再各層抽樣。比例配置如60／40兩層抽6／4，保留母體占比；若為小層精度超額抽樣，合併時需適當層權重。分層通常想讓層內較相似、層間不同，是否提高效率仍依實際分布與配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-2-3\">群集或部落抽樣</h2>\n<p>先抽群集，如班級，再觀察整班或進一步抽個人，通常可降低現場成本。若同群人很相似，有效資訊可能比相同人數SRS少，標準誤要反映群內關聯。分層「每層都抽一些」與群集「只抽部分群」的邏輯不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-2-4\">系統抽樣</h2>\n<p>從隨機起點後每k個抽一個，例如N=100、n=10、k=10。名單若有恰與k重合的週期，可能嚴重偏誤；隨機起點也不能保證解除所有週期問題。N/n非整數時還需明確設計，不以隨意四捨五入改變納入機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"100\">同一100人框的示範</h2>\n<p>第08例實際產生四種ID樣本：SRS10人；兩層6／4；抽2個各10人的群、觀察20人；隨機起點系統抽10人。群集例樣本數不同是為示範程序，不拿它的結果直接比較效率。要比較設計，需固定成本或樣本數並使用設計一致的變異估計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：為何不能把超額抽小層的所有人直接平均？答：不同層在樣本中的比例偏離母體，未加權平均改了估計目標。若只有一個群集被抽中，亦難可靠估群集間變異。抽樣設計不是最後在軟體選項勾一下即可補回的資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/08_sampling_designs.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 08_sampling_designs.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">population</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">srs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">choice</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">population</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">replace</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">stratified</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">concatenate</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">choice</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">replace</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">choice</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">replace</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">clusters</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">choice</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">replace</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">cluster_sample</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">concatenate</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">c</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">clusters</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">integers</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">));</span><span class=\"n\">systematic</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;srs&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">srs</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;proportionate_stratified&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stratified</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;selected_clusters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">clusters</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;all_members_in_selected_clusters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">cluster_sample</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;systematic_random_start&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;systematic&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">systematic</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 四種抽樣方法：簡單、分層、群集與系統 {#5-2}\n\n將抽取程序與估計變異一起規劃，不把不同設計都當SRS。\n\n## 簡單隨機抽樣 {#5-2-1}\n\n有限名單中不放回抽n人，使每個n人子集合機會相同。程式先固定完整ID框，再以rng.choice(replace=False)抽取。方便取前n列不是隨機；打散順序若與內容或來源有關，也不能不檢查就當作等機率。\n\n## 分層隨機抽樣 {#5-2-2}\n\n先依已知層分開，再各層抽樣。比例配置如60／40兩層抽6／4，保留母體占比；若為小層精度超額抽樣，合併時需適當層權重。分層通常想讓層內較相似、層間不同，是否提高效率仍依實際分布與配置。\n\n## 群集或部落抽樣 {#5-2-3}\n\n先抽群集，如班級，再觀察整班或進一步抽個人，通常可降低現場成本。若同群人很相似，有效資訊可能比相同人數SRS少，標準誤要反映群內關聯。分層「每層都抽一些」與群集「只抽部分群」的邏輯不同。\n\n## 系統抽樣 {#5-2-4}\n\n從隨機起點後每k個抽一個，例如N=100、n=10、k=10。名單若有恰與k重合的週期，可能嚴重偏誤；隨機起點也不能保證解除所有週期問題。N/n非整數時還需明確設計，不以隨意四捨五入改變納入機率。\n\n## 同一100人框的示範\n\n第08例實際產生四種ID樣本：SRS10人；兩層6／4；抽2個各10人的群、觀察20人；隨機起點系統抽10人。群集例樣本數不同是為示範程序，不拿它的結果直接比較效率。要比較設計，需固定成本或樣本數並使用設計一致的變異估計。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：為何不能把超額抽小層的所有人直接平均？答：不同層在樣本中的比例偏離母體，未加權平均改了估計目標。若只有一個群集被抽中，亦難可靠估群集間變異。抽樣設計不是最後在軟體選項勾一下即可補回的資訊。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/08_sampling_designs.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 08_sampling_designs.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    rng=np.random.default_rng(SEED);population=np.arange(100)\n    srs=rng.choice(population,10,replace=False)\n    stratified=np.concatenate([rng.choice(np.arange(0,60),6,replace=False),rng.choice(np.arange(60,100),4,replace=False)])\n    clusters=rng.choice(10,2,replace=False);cluster_sample=np.concatenate([np.arange(c*10,(c+1)*10) for c in clusters])\n    start=int(rng.integers(0,10));systematic=np.arange(start,100,10)\n    result={'srs':srs,'proportionate_stratified':stratified,'selected_clusters':clusters,'all_members_in_selected_clusters':cluster_sample,'systematic_random_start':start,'systematic':systematic}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-2", "name": "四種抽樣方法：簡單、分層、群集與系統", "html": "四種抽樣方法：簡單、分層、群集與系統", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "5-2-1", "name": "簡單隨機抽樣", "html": "簡單隨機抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "5-2-2", "name": "分層隨機抽樣", "html": "分層隨機抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "5-2-3", "name": "群集或部落抽樣", "html": "群集或部落抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "5-2-4", "name": "系統抽樣", "html": "系統抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "100", "name": "同一100人框的示範", "html": "同一100人框的示範", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "22-sampling-distribution", "group": "sampling", "title": "統計量與抽樣分配：資料分布以外的另一張圖", "summary": "分清原始觀察、一次樣本與重複抽樣統計量。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "sampling distribution"], "html": "<h1 id=\"5-3\">統計量與抽樣分配：資料分布以外的另一張圖</h1>\n<p>分清原始觀察、一次樣本與重複抽樣統計量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-3-1\">統計量是樣本的函數</h2>\n<p>樣本平均、比例、中位與變異數都由樣本計算。抽樣前它們是隨機量，抽樣後得到估計值。估計程序可以有偏差、變異與均方誤差；一個估計值看起來接近真值，不等於程序在所有重抽中都可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-3-2\">抽樣分配</h2>\n<p>固定母體、設計、n與統計量，想像反覆抽樣，每次算一個值，這些值的分布即抽樣分配。它與原始X的分布不同。例如等待時間可很右偏，而30筆平均的分布可能較集中且較對稱。n是每次抽多少，重複次數B是模擬多少組，二者不能互換。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">偏差與標準誤</h2>\n<p>偏差是E(θ̂)−θ；標準誤是θ̂抽樣分配的SD。估計值與真值的一次差異不等於偏差；樣本SD描述個別觀察分散，也不等於平均數的SE。精準但偏離目標的程序仍可能給很窄但錯位的區間。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{MSE}(\\hat\\theta)=\\operatorname{Var}(\\hat\\theta)\n+\\big(E[\\hat\\theta]-\\theta\\big)^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">如何做模擬</h2>\n<p>先指定已知母體模型，固定seed，反覆產生大小n的樣本並計算統計量，再與理論平均與SE比較。重複次數更多主要降低Monte Carlo誤差，不會讓每份樣本本身增加資訊。模擬只能展示所指定的機制，不能因此證明真實資料符合模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一次樣本可以知道分布嗎</h2>\n<p>真實情況常只有一份樣本，使用理論、漸近近似或bootstrap估不確定性。每種方式有條件；bootstrap重抽已觀察值，不會自動包含未涵蓋群體、時間相依或選擇偏差。後面附錄再補如何保留群集／配對的重抽單位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>題：模擬B從1000升到100000，是否平均估計的理論SE減少十倍？答：若n未變，該估計量的理論SE不變；只是模擬估SE的誤差降低。若把n升100倍且iid有限變異，平均SE才約縮十倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 統計量與抽樣分配：資料分布以外的另一張圖 {#5-3}\n\n分清原始觀察、一次樣本與重複抽樣統計量。\n\n## 統計量是樣本的函數 {#5-3-1}\n\n樣本平均、比例、中位與變異數都由樣本計算。抽樣前它們是隨機量，抽樣後得到估計值。估計程序可以有偏差、變異與均方誤差；一個估計值看起來接近真值，不等於程序在所有重抽中都可靠。\n\n## 抽樣分配 {#5-3-2}\n\n固定母體、設計、n與統計量，想像反覆抽樣，每次算一個值，這些值的分布即抽樣分配。它與原始X的分布不同。例如等待時間可很右偏，而30筆平均的分布可能較集中且較對稱。n是每次抽多少，重複次數B是模擬多少組，二者不能互換。\n\n## 偏差與標準誤\n\n偏差是E(θ̂)−θ；標準誤是θ̂抽樣分配的SD。估計值與真值的一次差異不等於偏差；樣本SD描述個別觀察分散，也不等於平均數的SE。精準但偏離目標的程序仍可能給很窄但錯位的區間。\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{MSE}(\\hat\\theta)=\\operatorname{Var}(\\hat\\theta)\n+\\big(E[\\hat\\theta]-\\theta\\big)^2\n$$\n\n## 如何做模擬\n\n先指定已知母體模型，固定seed，反覆產生大小n的樣本並計算統計量，再與理論平均與SE比較。重複次數更多主要降低Monte Carlo誤差，不會讓每份樣本本身增加資訊。模擬只能展示所指定的機制，不能因此證明真實資料符合模型。\n\n## 一次樣本可以知道分布嗎\n\n真實情況常只有一份樣本，使用理論、漸近近似或bootstrap估不確定性。每種方式有條件；bootstrap重抽已觀察值，不會自動包含未涵蓋群體、時間相依或選擇偏差。後面附錄再補如何保留群集／配對的重抽單位。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n題：模擬B從1000升到100000，是否平均估計的理論SE減少十倍？答：若n未變，該估計量的理論SE不變；只是模擬估SE的誤差降低。若把n升100倍且iid有限變異，平均SE才約縮十倍。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-3", "name": "統計量與抽樣分配：資料分布以外的另一張圖", "html": "統計量與抽樣分配：資料分布以外的另一張圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "5-3-1", "name": "統計量是樣本的函數", "html": "統計量是樣本的函數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "5-3-2", "name": "抽樣分配", "html": "抽樣分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "偏差與標準誤", "html": "偏差與標準誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "如何做模擬", "html": "如何做模擬", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一次樣本可以知道分布嗎", "html": "一次樣本可以知道分布嗎", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "23-mean-sampling", "group": "sampling", "title": "樣本平均數的抽樣分配與中央極限定理", "summary": "把精確常態結果、漸近結果與有限母體修正分開。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "mean sampling"], "example": "09_sampling_distribution.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"5-4\">樣本平均數的抽樣分配與中央極限定理</h1>\n<p>把精確常態結果、漸近結果與有限母體修正分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-4-1\">平均與變異</h2>\n<p>iid、有限μ與σ²時，E(X̄)=μ、Var(X̄)=σ²/n，SE=σ/√n。期望的線性不需要獨立，但變異簡化需要處理共變異數。時間相關或同群資料會改SE，不能只把人數放入根號。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nE(\\bar X)=\\mu,\\qquad \\operatorname{SE}(\\bar X)=\\frac\\sigma{\\sqrt n}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"5-4-2\">抽樣分配的形態</h2>\n<p>若原母體常態，iid樣本平均任何n皆精確常態。若母體非正態，經典CLT在iid有限正變異等條件下，使標準化平均漸近標準常態；它沒有說原始資料變常態，也沒有普遍保證n=30足夠。偏態、尾端、少見事件與所需精確度都影響近似。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">有限母體修正</h2>\n<p>從有限N不放回SRS，若σ_N²以N為分母定義母體變異，平均SE為σ_N/√n乘√((N−n)/(N−1))。n接近N時修正明顯，普查時抽樣誤差為0；測量錯誤仍可能存在。若用N−1分母定義母體變異，修正式會換等價形式，請先對齊記號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">指數母體的實際模擬</h2>\n<p>第09例以均值1、SD1的Exponential生成4000組，每組30筆，查看平均分布的實際均值與SD，理論SE=1/√30。觀察某一母體下近似表現，是具體證據而非所有分布的通用定理。首頁也可改n觀察偏態平均逐漸集中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">規模與成本</h2>\n<p>SE要縮半，iid條件下n需約四倍，不是兩倍。更多樣本的利益會遞減；改善測量、分層或研究設計也可能提升有效資訊。但改設計後需使用相符SE，不能保留原SRS公式再宣稱精度提升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>σ=12，n=36時SE2；n=144時SE1。某人說「樣本SD從12變2」，哪裡不對？2是平均估計的標準誤，不是單筆資料本身的標準差。兩者描述不同變動，報表應清楚標SD或SE。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/09_sampling_distribution.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 09_sampling_distribution.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">means</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exponential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">scale</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">axis</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;population_mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;population_sd&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;n&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;replicates&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">means</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;simulated_mean_of_means&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">means</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;simulated_se&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">means</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ddof</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;theoretical_se&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sqrt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;illustration for an exponential population, not a universal n=30 rule&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 樣本平均數的抽樣分配與中央極限定理 {#5-4}\n\n把精確常態結果、漸近結果與有限母體修正分開。\n\n## 平均與變異 {#5-4-1}\n\niid、有限μ與σ²時，E(X̄)=μ、Var(X̄)=σ²/n，SE=σ/√n。期望的線性不需要獨立，但變異簡化需要處理共變異數。時間相關或同群資料會改SE，不能只把人數放入根號。\n\n$$\nE(\\bar X)=\\mu,\\qquad \\operatorname{SE}(\\bar X)=\\frac\\sigma{\\sqrt n}\n$$\n\n## 抽樣分配的形態 {#5-4-2}\n\n若原母體常態，iid樣本平均任何n皆精確常態。若母體非正態，經典CLT在iid有限正變異等條件下，使標準化平均漸近標準常態；它沒有說原始資料變常態，也沒有普遍保證n=30足夠。偏態、尾端、少見事件與所需精確度都影響近似。\n\n## 有限母體修正\n\n從有限N不放回SRS，若σ_N²以N為分母定義母體變異，平均SE為σ_N/√n乘√((N−n)/(N−1))。n接近N時修正明顯，普查時抽樣誤差為0；測量錯誤仍可能存在。若用N−1分母定義母體變異，修正式會換等價形式，請先對齊記號。\n\n## 指數母體的實際模擬\n\n第09例以均值1、SD1的Exponential生成4000組，每組30筆，查看平均分布的實際均值與SD，理論SE=1/√30。觀察某一母體下近似表現，是具體證據而非所有分布的通用定理。首頁也可改n觀察偏態平均逐漸集中。\n\n## 規模與成本\n\nSE要縮半，iid條件下n需約四倍，不是兩倍。更多樣本的利益會遞減；改善測量、分層或研究設計也可能提升有效資訊。但改設計後需使用相符SE，不能保留原SRS公式再宣稱精度提升。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nσ=12，n=36時SE2；n=144時SE1。某人說「樣本SD從12變2」，哪裡不對？2是平均估計的標準誤，不是單筆資料本身的標準差。兩者描述不同變動，報表應清楚標SD或SE。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/09_sampling_distribution.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 09_sampling_distribution.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    rng=np.random.default_rng(SEED);n=30;means=rng.exponential(scale=1,size=(4000,n)).mean(axis=1)\n    result={'population_mean':1,'population_sd':1,'n':n,'replicates':len(means),'simulated_mean_of_means':means.mean(),'simulated_se':means.std(ddof=1),'theoretical_se':1/np.sqrt(n),'note':'illustration for an exponential population, not a universal n=30 rule'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-4", "name": "樣本平均數的抽樣分配與中央極限定理", "html": "樣本平均數的抽樣分配與中央極限定理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "5-4-1", "name": "平均與變異", "html": "平均與變異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "5-4-2", "name": "抽樣分配的形態", "html": "抽樣分配的形態", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "有限母體修正", "html": "有限母體修正", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "指數母體的實際模擬", "html": "指數母體的實際模擬", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "規模與成本", "html": "規模與成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "24-student-t", "group": "sampling", "title": "t分配的特性與機率計算", "summary": "當未知母體SD由樣本估計時，理解額外不確定性。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "student t"], "example": "10_sampling_pivots.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"5-5-t\">t分配的特性與機率計算</h1>\n<p>當未知母體SD由樣本估計時，理解額外不確定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-5-1-t\">t統計量從何而來</h2>\n<p>對iid常態母體，(X̄−μ)/(S/√n)服從自由度ν=n−1的t分配。分母S也有抽樣變動，因此相較已知σ的Z有較厚尾。大樣本與適當條件下，t程序也可近似使用，但小樣本重偏態或極端值會使推論敏感。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nT=\\frac{\\bar X-\\mu}{S/\\sqrt n}\\sim t_{n-1}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">對稱與自由度</h2>\n<p>t以0對稱；ν增加時接近標準常態。非常小自由度下部分動差不存在，例如ν=1為Cauchy，平均未定義；ν&gt;2才有有限變異ν/(ν−2)。這提醒我們「所有分配都可列有限平均SD」並不正確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-5-2\">查機率與切點</h2>\n<p>左尾P(T≤t)用t.cdf(t,ν)，右尾用sf，雙尾對對稱零假設用2sf(|t|,ν)。95%中央界值是ppf(.975,ν)，而不是ppf(.95,ν)。查傳統表時先確認表頭寫左尾累積還是上尾面積。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">數值核對</h2>\n<p>ν=9的.975分位約2.2622，比常態1.960大；ν增加時差距縮小。第10例同時計算t、卡方與F切點，並用CDF(PPF(.975))≈.975核對尾向。反函數檢查可抓出把α與1−α弄反的常見錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">樣本數不是唯一分界</h2>\n<p>原目錄的「大樣本／小樣本」仍保留在估計與檢定頁，但本課不把30當自動切換Z的開關。σ未知時通常可持續採t；σ是否已知、設計、分布與估計條件，比單看n更基本。兩樣本Welch的自由度也可能非整數，不需硬取整才能由軟體計算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：t=2、ν=9的雙尾p是否等於常態雙尾p？不是，t厚尾使p較大。問：95%雙側區間為何用.975？因為剩餘5%分到兩尾各2.5%，上界左側累積97.5%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/10_sampling_pivots.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 10_sampling_pivots.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;t_975_df9&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;chi2_025_df9&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chi2</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.025</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;F_95_df4_10&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.95</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;t_two_sided_tail_at_2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;inverse_check&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm\">NIST平均數信賴區間</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# t分配的特性與機率計算 {#5-5-t}\n\n當未知母體SD由樣本估計時，理解額外不確定性。\n\n## t統計量從何而來 {#5-5-1-t}\n\n對iid常態母體，(X̄−μ)/(S/√n)服從自由度ν=n−1的t分配。分母S也有抽樣變動，因此相較已知σ的Z有較厚尾。大樣本與適當條件下，t程序也可近似使用，但小樣本重偏態或極端值會使推論敏感。\n\n$$\nT=\\frac{\\bar X-\\mu}{S/\\sqrt n}\\sim t_{n-1}\n$$\n\n## 對稱與自由度\n\nt以0對稱；ν增加時接近標準常態。非常小自由度下部分動差不存在，例如ν=1為Cauchy，平均未定義；ν>2才有有限變異ν/(ν−2)。這提醒我們「所有分配都可列有限平均SD」並不正確。\n\n## 查機率與切點 {#5-5-2}\n\n左尾P(T≤t)用t.cdf(t,ν)，右尾用sf，雙尾對對稱零假設用2sf(|t|,ν)。95%中央界值是ppf(.975,ν)，而不是ppf(.95,ν)。查傳統表時先確認表頭寫左尾累積還是上尾面積。\n\n## 數值核對\n\nν=9的.975分位約2.2622，比常態1.960大；ν增加時差距縮小。第10例同時計算t、卡方與F切點，並用CDF(PPF(.975))≈.975核對尾向。反函數檢查可抓出把α與1−α弄反的常見錯誤。\n\n## 樣本數不是唯一分界\n\n原目錄的「大樣本／小樣本」仍保留在估計與檢定頁，但本課不把30當自動切換Z的開關。σ未知時通常可持續採t；σ是否已知、設計、分布與估計條件，比單看n更基本。兩樣本Welch的自由度也可能非整數，不需硬取整才能由軟體計算。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：t=2、ν=9的雙尾p是否等於常態雙尾p？不是，t厚尾使p較大。問：95%雙側區間為何用.975？因為剩餘5%分到兩尾各2.5%，上界左側累積97.5%。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/10_sampling_pivots.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 10_sampling_pivots.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result={'t_975_df9':stats.t.ppf(.975,9),'chi2_025_df9':stats.chi2.ppf(.025,9),'F_95_df4_10':stats.f.ppf(.95,4,10),'t_two_sided_tail_at_2':2*stats.t.sf(2,9),'inverse_check':stats.t.cdf(stats.t.ppf(.975,9),9)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [NIST平均數信賴區間](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-5-t", "name": "t分配的特性與機率計算", "html": "t分配的特性與機率計算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "5-5-1-t", "name": "t統計量從何而來", "html": "t統計量從何而來", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "對稱與自由度", "html": "對稱與自由度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "5-5-2", "name": "查機率與切點", "html": "查機率與切點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "數值核對", "html": "數值核對", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "樣本數不是唯一分界", "html": "樣本數不是唯一分界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "25-proportion-sampling", "group": "sampling", "title": "樣本比例的抽樣分配", "summary": "從成功次數到比例，明確區分p與p̂。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "proportion sampling"], "html": "<h1 id=\"5-6\">樣本比例的抽樣分配</h1>\n<p>從成功次數到比例，明確區分p與p̂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">記號與機制</h2>\n<p>母體成功率p，樣本成功次數K，樣本比例p̂=K/n。部分課本以大寫P表示樣本比例，本課用p̂避免與機率運算P(事件)混淆。iid Bernoulli機制下K∼Binomial(n,p)，因此p̂取0、1/n、2/n等離散值，不是任何0到1連續數都可取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">抽樣平均與標準誤</h2>\n<p>E(p̂)=p，Var(p̂)=p(1−p)/n。p接近.5時在相同n下變異最大；靠近0或1雖理論變異小，分布也更不對稱，常態近似可能差。估SE時用p̂或假設值p0，取決於是估計還是檢定，不能一個分母走全部程序。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{SE}(\\hat p)=\\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}n}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">常態近似條件</h2>\n<p>常見np與n(1−p)足夠大有助中央區域近似；估計時未知p需依方法處理。n=1000但成功只有1，也不能只說樣本大便用簡單Wald區間。二項精確檢定、Wilson區間與其他方法可以更適合邊界情況。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">不放回與設計</h2>\n<p>有限二元母體不放回SRS時，變異另有(N−n)/(N−1)修正。分層、群集、不同權重或重複事件的比例，有另外的設計變異。即使成功／失敗欄位看起來一樣，也不能把所有情況都當獨立二項試驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">一組數字</h2>\n<p>p=.4、n=100，理論SE=√(.24/100)≈.0490。若n增400，SE約.0245。實際一次看到45/100，不表示p固定等於.45；那是估計值，需區間呈現不確定。若把比例百分比乘100，SE也乘100成百分點，別把4.9百分點說成相對增加4.9%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>0/10的plug-in SE為0，是否表示母體p已精確知道為0？答：不是，這正是簡單Wald方法在邊界失效的例子。第6章用Wilson與Clopper–Pearson展示非零上界，讓沒有觀察到事件與證明不會發生分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 樣本比例的抽樣分配 {#5-6}\n\n從成功次數到比例，明確區分p與p̂。\n\n## 記號與機制\n\n母體成功率p，樣本成功次數K，樣本比例p̂=K/n。部分課本以大寫P表示樣本比例，本課用p̂避免與機率運算P(事件)混淆。iid Bernoulli機制下K∼Binomial(n,p)，因此p̂取0、1/n、2/n等離散值，不是任何0到1連續數都可取。\n\n## 抽樣平均與標準誤\n\nE(p̂)=p，Var(p̂)=p(1−p)/n。p接近.5時在相同n下變異最大；靠近0或1雖理論變異小，分布也更不對稱，常態近似可能差。估SE時用p̂或假設值p0，取決於是估計還是檢定，不能一個分母走全部程序。\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{SE}(\\hat p)=\\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}n}\n$$\n\n## 常態近似條件\n\n常見np與n(1−p)足夠大有助中央區域近似；估計時未知p需依方法處理。n=1000但成功只有1，也不能只說樣本大便用簡單Wald區間。二項精確檢定、Wilson區間與其他方法可以更適合邊界情況。\n\n## 不放回與設計\n\n有限二元母體不放回SRS時，變異另有(N−n)/(N−1)修正。分層、群集、不同權重或重複事件的比例，有另外的設計變異。即使成功／失敗欄位看起來一樣，也不能把所有情況都當獨立二項試驗。\n\n## 一組數字\n\np=.4、n=100，理論SE=√(.24/100)≈.0490。若n增400，SE約.0245。實際一次看到45/100，不表示p固定等於.45；那是估計值，需區間呈現不確定。若把比例百分比乘100，SE也乘100成百分點，別把4.9百分點說成相對增加4.9%。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n0/10的plug-in SE為0，是否表示母體p已精確知道為0？答：不是，這正是簡單Wald方法在邊界失效的例子。第6章用Wilson與Clopper–Pearson展示非零上界，讓沒有觀察到事件與證明不會發生分開。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-6", "name": "樣本比例的抽樣分配", "html": "樣本比例的抽樣分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "記號與機制", "html": "記號與機制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "抽樣平均與標準誤", "html": "抽樣平均與標準誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "常態近似條件", "html": "常態近似條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "不放回與設計", "html": "不放回與設計", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "一組數字", "html": "一組數字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "26-chi-square-sampling", "group": "sampling", "title": "樣本變異數與卡方抽樣分配", "summary": "理解正常性對變異數精確推論特別重要。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "chi square sampling"], "html": "<h1 id=\"5-7\">樣本變異數與卡方抽樣分配</h1>\n<p>理解正常性對變異數精確推論特別重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">從標準常態平方和開始</h2>\n<p>ν個獨立標準常態平方加總服從χ²_ν。它只取非負值，右偏，均值ν、變異數2ν；ν增加相對形狀較對稱。這個構造與後面交叉表的Pearson卡方近似不同，雖然都會使用卡方分布作參照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">樣本變異數的精確樞紐</h2>\n<p>對iid常態母體，(n−1)S²/σ²∼χ²_(n−1)，且X̄與S²獨立。不是任何母體都精確成立，尤其變異數推論對非正態可能很敏感。樣本數大時也需另外考慮近似品質，不把平均數CLT直接搬到S²。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nQ=\\frac{(n-1)S^2}{\\sigma^2}\\sim\\chi^2_{n-1}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">為何區間不對稱</h2>\n<p>卡方分布不對稱，將左右分位數倒數後形成σ²區間，通常不是估計值±固定距離。區間下界用較大的卡方分位數，上界用較小的分位數。這個反向是代數移項的結果，不能只背「左尾配左界」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">查表與量綱</h2>\n<p>chi2.ppf(q,ν)回切點；cdf回左面積，sf回右面積。S²若為平方公分，推論σ²也為平方公分；想報SD區間時對兩界各取平方根，不是直接把整個區間除以某個SD。自由度通常n−1，不是n。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">一組手算條件</h2>\n<p>樣本n=10、s²=4，若假設σ0²=9，Q=9×4/9=4。接著看χ²_9下4落在哪個尾端，而非把4與1.96直接比較。統計量的參照分布、自由度與尾向是一套完整資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：資料強烈右偏時，平均的t近似看來尚可，能否因此認定卡方變異數區間也精確？答：不能，兩種程序的敏感程度與成立理由不同。可做分布診斷、變換或適當bootstrap／穩健尺度分析，並清楚說明改變的估計目標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">用極端樣本理解敏感度</h2>\n<p>同樣n=10，九個值接近0、一個非常大，S²會被最後一筆主導。若它是真實重尾事件，刪除後再套正常卡方區間改變了研究；若是輸入單位錯誤，則需有來源證據修正。正常性前提不是只用一句「n夠大」就能抹掉的技術細節。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 樣本變異數與卡方抽樣分配 {#5-7}\n\n理解正常性對變異數精確推論特別重要。\n\n## 從標準常態平方和開始\n\nν個獨立標準常態平方加總服從χ²_ν。它只取非負值，右偏，均值ν、變異數2ν；ν增加相對形狀較對稱。這個構造與後面交叉表的Pearson卡方近似不同，雖然都會使用卡方分布作參照。\n\n## 樣本變異數的精確樞紐\n\n對iid常態母體，(n−1)S²/σ²∼χ²_(n−1)，且X̄與S²獨立。不是任何母體都精確成立，尤其變異數推論對非正態可能很敏感。樣本數大時也需另外考慮近似品質，不把平均數CLT直接搬到S²。\n\n$$\nQ=\\frac{(n-1)S^2}{\\sigma^2}\\sim\\chi^2_{n-1}\n$$\n\n## 為何區間不對稱\n\n卡方分布不對稱，將左右分位數倒數後形成σ²區間，通常不是估計值±固定距離。區間下界用較大的卡方分位數，上界用較小的分位數。這個反向是代數移項的結果，不能只背「左尾配左界」。\n\n## 查表與量綱\n\nchi2.ppf(q,ν)回切點；cdf回左面積，sf回右面積。S²若為平方公分，推論σ²也為平方公分；想報SD區間時對兩界各取平方根，不是直接把整個區間除以某個SD。自由度通常n−1，不是n。\n\n## 一組手算條件\n\n樣本n=10、s²=4，若假設σ0²=9，Q=9×4/9=4。接著看χ²_9下4落在哪個尾端，而非把4與1.96直接比較。統計量的參照分布、自由度與尾向是一套完整資訊。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：資料強烈右偏時，平均的t近似看來尚可，能否因此認定卡方變異數區間也精確？答：不能，兩種程序的敏感程度與成立理由不同。可做分布診斷、變換或適當bootstrap／穩健尺度分析，並清楚說明改變的估計目標。\n\n## 用極端樣本理解敏感度\n\n同樣n=10，九個值接近0、一個非常大，S²會被最後一筆主導。若它是真實重尾事件，刪除後再套正常卡方區間改變了研究；若是輸入單位錯誤，則需有來源證據修正。正常性前提不是只用一句「n夠大」就能抹掉的技術細節。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-7", "name": "樣本變異數與卡方抽樣分配", "html": "樣本變異數與卡方抽樣分配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "從標準常態平方和開始", "html": "從標準常態平方和開始", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "樣本變異數的精確樞紐", "html": "樣本變異數的精確樞紐", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "為何區間不對稱", "html": "為何區間不對稱", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "查表與量綱", "html": "查表與量綱", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "一組手算條件", "html": "一組手算條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "用極端樣本理解敏感度", "html": "用極端樣本理解敏感度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "27-f-distribution", "group": "sampling", "title": "F分配：兩個獨立變異估計的比例", "summary": "追蹤分子分母自由度，建立變異比與ANOVA的共同語言。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "f distribution"], "html": "<h1 id=\"5-8-f\">F分配：兩個獨立變異估計的比例</h1>\n<p>追蹤分子分母自由度，建立變異比與ANOVA的共同語言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"f\">F的構造</h2>\n<p>若U∼χ²_ν1、V∼χ²_ν2且獨立，(U/ν1)/(V/ν2)服從F_(ν1,ν2)。它非負且通常右偏，兩個自由度依分子與分母排列，順序不同結果不同。F不是把任意兩個平方數相除就會得到的分布。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nF=\\frac{U/\\nu_1}{V/\\nu_2}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">與兩個樣本變異數</h2>\n<p>兩個獨立常態母體樣本，(S1²/σ1²)/(S2²/σ2²)服從F_(n1−1,n2−1)。在σ1²=σ2²下，直接以S1²/S2²為統計量。若交換樣本，不只統計量取倒數，自由度也要交換。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">倒數關係與尾向</h2>\n<p>若F∼F_(a,b)，1/F∼F_(b,a)。兩側檢定需處理兩尾，不能只用上尾p；把較大樣本變異數放分子也要同步調自由度與定義。程式保留A/B方向，採雙倍較小尾的等尾程序並限制p≤1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tanova\">與t及ANOVA的關係</h2>\n<p>T∼t_ν時T²∼F_(1,ν)。兩組等變異單因子ANOVA與對應雙側pooled t檢定有F=t²關係。多組ANOVA的F則比較組間與組內均方；它沒有告訴你哪兩組不同，需要另外比較程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">查表與常見錯誤</h2>\n<p>求上尾α切點用f.ppf(1−α,ν1,ν2)。有些表以分子自由度為欄、有些相反，先查說明。把F分布當對稱而取±F是錯的；負值也不可能是標準變異比統計量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>A的n=6、s²=8，B的n=9、s²=2，F_A/B=4，df=(5,8)。交換後為.25、df=(8,5)。若觀察有群內相關或非正常，這個精確F參照就需重新評估，不能只在軟體輸入相同兩列數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"0\">為什麼比值不以0為中心</h2>\n<p>H0下兩個variance估計的比例通常在1附近，但F分布的期望不是總等1；在分母df&gt;2時為ν2/(ν2−2)，這來自分母的隨機性。不能把E(U/V)寫成E(U)/E(V)而忽略非線性。這與第4章期望的非線性提醒一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# F分配：兩個獨立變異估計的比例 {#5-8-f}\n\n追蹤分子分母自由度，建立變異比與ANOVA的共同語言。\n\n## F的構造\n\n若U∼χ²_ν1、V∼χ²_ν2且獨立，(U/ν1)/(V/ν2)服從F_(ν1,ν2)。它非負且通常右偏，兩個自由度依分子與分母排列，順序不同結果不同。F不是把任意兩個平方數相除就會得到的分布。\n\n$$\nF=\\frac{U/\\nu_1}{V/\\nu_2}\n$$\n\n## 與兩個樣本變異數\n\n兩個獨立常態母體樣本，(S1²/σ1²)/(S2²/σ2²)服從F_(n1−1,n2−1)。在σ1²=σ2²下，直接以S1²/S2²為統計量。若交換樣本，不只統計量取倒數，自由度也要交換。\n\n## 倒數關係與尾向\n\n若F∼F_(a,b)，1/F∼F_(b,a)。兩側檢定需處理兩尾，不能只用上尾p；把較大樣本變異數放分子也要同步調自由度與定義。程式保留A/B方向，採雙倍較小尾的等尾程序並限制p≤1。\n\n## 與t及ANOVA的關係\n\nT∼t_ν時T²∼F_(1,ν)。兩組等變異單因子ANOVA與對應雙側pooled t檢定有F=t²關係。多組ANOVA的F則比較組間與組內均方；它沒有告訴你哪兩組不同，需要另外比較程序。\n\n## 查表與常見錯誤\n\n求上尾α切點用f.ppf(1−α,ν1,ν2)。有些表以分子自由度為欄、有些相反，先查說明。把F分布當對稱而取±F是錯的；負值也不可能是標準變異比統計量。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nA的n=6、s²=8，B的n=9、s²=2，F_A/B=4，df=(5,8)。交換後為.25、df=(8,5)。若觀察有群內相關或非正常，這個精確F參照就需重新評估，不能只在軟體輸入相同兩列數字。\n\n## 為什麼比值不以0為中心\n\nH0下兩個variance估計的比例通常在1附近，但F分布的期望不是總等1；在分母df>2時為ν2/(ν2−2)，這來自分母的隨機性。不能把E(U/V)寫成E(U)/E(V)而忽略非線性。這與第4章期望的非線性提醒一致。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "5-8-f", "name": "F分配：兩個獨立變異估計的比例", "html": "F分配：兩個獨立變異估計的比例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "f", "name": "F的構造", "html": "F的構造", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "與兩個樣本變異數", "html": "與兩個樣本變異數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "倒數關係與尾向", "html": "倒數關係與尾向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "tanova", "name": "與t及ANOVA的關係", "html": "與t及ANOVA的關係", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "查表與常見錯誤", "html": "查表與常見錯誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "0", "name": "為什麼比值不以0為中心", "html": "為什麼比值不以0為中心", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "28-exercises-sampling", "group": "sampling", "title": "抽樣與抽樣分配習題詳解", "summary": "將設計、統計量、SE與參照分布連成完整答案。", "tags": ["抽樣及抽樣分配", "exercises sampling"], "html": "<h1 id=\"05\">抽樣與抽樣分配習題詳解</h1>\n<p>將設計、統計量、SE與參照分布連成完整答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：分層或群集</h2>\n<p>每個年級各抽20人是分層；抽3個班、對全班調查是群集。解答需再說每年級母體大小是否相同、是否需權重，以及同班相關如何估SE。只用樣本總人數套SRS公式可能低估誤差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"se\">題二：平均SE</h2>\n<p>iid母體μ=100、σ=15，n=25時平均的期望100、SE3。若原母體常態，平均精確N(100,9)；若非正常，不能直接說n=25就已精確常態。這裡分布記號第二參數為variance，9不是SD。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題三：有限母體</h2>\n<p>N=100、n=25、σ_N=15，不放回SRS時SE=15/5×√(75/99)≈2.611。未修正SE3較大，兩者的差來自抽樣比例。若n=N，抽樣SE為0；量測偏差不因此為0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題四：比例</h2>\n<p>p=.2、n=100，理論平均.2、SE=.04。看到樣本18成功，p̂=.18，是一次實現。若改n=400，SE=.02。若400次其實來自只有20個高度相關群集，不能直接用獨立400次的.02。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tf\">題五：t、卡方、F</h2>\n<p>常態母體n=12，平均t的df11，變異數χ²的df11。兩獨立常態樣本n1=12、n2=8，變異比F的df=(11,7)。這三項都要附成立條件，不能只列自由度數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題六：重複模擬</h2>\n<p>4000次模擬每次n=30，總共生成120000個值，推論一次樣本平均的n仍是30。增加模擬次數能穩定模擬結果，不等同增加實際研究樣本。這是讀CLT模擬最常見的兩種規模混淆，應在圖上同時標n與B。</p>\n<h2 id=\"se_1\">延伸題：偏差和SE</h2>\n<p>某程序每次估計都比目標平均高5，但重抽SE只有.2。它非常集中卻有偏，不可因CI很窄就稱準確。解答要分辨偏差來源、觀察一次誤差與重抽變動；若樣本來自錯母體，再多樣本主要讓錯目標估得更精密。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">延伸題：共同乘數</h2>\n<p>把每筆金額乘100轉成分，X̄與其SE也乘100，但標準化(X̄−μ)/(σ/√n)保持不變。若只改μ或某一欄的單位，結果將不同。完整解答應先核對量綱，再解釋參照分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 抽樣與抽樣分配習題詳解 {#05}\n\n將設計、統計量、SE與參照分布連成完整答案。\n\n## 題一：分層或群集\n\n每個年級各抽20人是分層；抽3個班、對全班調查是群集。解答需再說每年級母體大小是否相同、是否需權重，以及同班相關如何估SE。只用樣本總人數套SRS公式可能低估誤差。\n\n## 題二：平均SE\n\niid母體μ=100、σ=15，n=25時平均的期望100、SE3。若原母體常態，平均精確N(100,9)；若非正常，不能直接說n=25就已精確常態。這裡分布記號第二參數為variance，9不是SD。\n\n## 題三：有限母體\n\nN=100、n=25、σ_N=15，不放回SRS時SE=15/5×√(75/99)≈2.611。未修正SE3較大，兩者的差來自抽樣比例。若n=N，抽樣SE為0；量測偏差不因此為0。\n\n## 題四：比例\n\np=.2、n=100，理論平均.2、SE=.04。看到樣本18成功，p̂=.18，是一次實現。若改n=400，SE=.02。若400次其實來自只有20個高度相關群集，不能直接用獨立400次的.02。\n\n## 題五：t、卡方、F\n\n常態母體n=12，平均t的df11，變異數χ²的df11。兩獨立常態樣本n1=12、n2=8，變異比F的df=(11,7)。這三項都要附成立條件，不能只列自由度數字。\n\n## 題六：重複模擬\n\n4000次模擬每次n=30，總共生成120000個值，推論一次樣本平均的n仍是30。增加模擬次數能穩定模擬結果，不等同增加實際研究樣本。這是讀CLT模擬最常見的兩種規模混淆，應在圖上同時標n與B。\n\n## 延伸題：偏差和SE\n\n某程序每次估計都比目標平均高5，但重抽SE只有.2。它非常集中卻有偏，不可因CI很窄就稱準確。解答要分辨偏差來源、觀察一次誤差與重抽變動；若樣本來自錯母體，再多樣本主要讓錯目標估得更精密。\n\n## 延伸題：共同乘數\n\n把每筆金額乘100轉成分，X̄與其SE也乘100，但標準化(X̄−μ)/(σ/√n)保持不變。若只改μ或某一欄的單位，結果將不同。完整解答應先核對量綱，再解釋參照分布。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "05", "name": "抽樣與抽樣分配習題詳解", "html": "抽樣與抽樣分配習題詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：分層或群集", "html": "題一：分層或群集", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "se", "name": "題二：平均SE", "html": "題二：平均SE", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題三：有限母體", "html": "題三：有限母體", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題四：比例", "html": "題四：比例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "tf", "name": "題五：t、卡方、F", "html": "題五：t、卡方、F", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題六：重複模擬", "html": "題六：重複模擬", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "se_1", "name": "延伸題：偏差和SE", "html": "延伸題：偏差和SE", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "延伸題：共同乘數", "html": "延伸題：共同乘數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "29-mean-confidence", "group": "intervals", "title": "母體平均數區間估計：已知σ、未知σ與流程", "summary": "用假設選公式，完整理解95%信賴的長期涵義。", "tags": ["區間估計", "mean confidence"], "example": "11_mean_intervals.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"6-1\">母體平均數區間估計：已知σ、未知σ與流程</h1>\n<p>用假設選公式，完整理解95%信賴的長期涵義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"6-1-1\">大樣本與已知σ</h2>\n<p>若iid常態且σ已知，X̄±z_(1−α/2)σ/√n是精確區間；非正常但合適大樣本可近似。已知σ需有外部可靠依據，不可用同一樣本s代入後仍聲稱σ已知。大樣本不自動讓母體SD變成已知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"6-1-2\">小樣本與未知σ</h2>\n<p>σ未知時，常態iid下用X̄±t_(1−α/2,n−1)S/√n。大n時也可持續用t；小n則要特別注意偏態、極端值和獨立性。paired資料應先取差再估差的平均，不把兩次量測視為兩組獨立樣本。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\bar x\\pm t_{1-\\alpha/2,n-1}\\frac{s}{\\sqrt n}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"6-1-3\">母體平均數區間估計流程圖</h2>\n<p>先定平均的母體與觀察單位，再查設計是否支持獨立或需群集／配對處理；確認σ是否真已知；檢查分布和有效n；計算SE與切點；最後報估計、區間、單位、條件與限制。這是流程，不是只憑n≥30走Z、否則走t的兩格判斷。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"先確認設計，再依母體標準差是否已知選擇Z或t區間的流程圖\" src=\"assets/mean-interval-flow.svg\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"assets/mean-interval-flow.svg\">另開完整流程圖放大閱讀</a>。這張圖列出主線選擇；配對、群集及時間依賴需回到各自適合的估計程序，不能不經檢查就套獨立模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">信賴是程序的性質</h2>\n<p>固定母體參數，反覆按同設計抽樣建95%區間，長期約95%區間包含真值。此次區間與固定μ的包含關係已確定；不能直接改寫為μ有95%機率在裡面，也不是95%個別觀察值的範圍。首頁以重複區間視覺化此區別。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">數值與報告</h2>\n<p>n=25、x̄=50、s=10，SE2、t24約2.0639，95%區間約[45.872,54.128]。若有真正已知σ=10，Z區間為[46.080,53.920]，差來自分母估計的不確定性。第11例用相同原始資料比對兩種前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>提高信賴水準會使區間較寬；提高n在同設計下通常變窄。區間窄不保證無偏，方便樣本可能得到精確但偏離母體的結果。報告可說「依所列條件估母體平均為…，95%信賴區間…」，並寫明樣本來源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/11_mean_intervals.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 11_mean_intervals.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">48</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">51</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">49</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">52</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">47</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">53</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">49</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">51</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;unknown_sigma_t&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;known_sigma_z&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sigma</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;same_data_different_assumptions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm\">NIST平均數信賴區間</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 母體平均數區間估計：已知σ、未知σ與流程 {#6-1}\n\n用假設選公式，完整理解95%信賴的長期涵義。\n\n## 大樣本與已知σ {#6-1-1}\n\n若iid常態且σ已知，X̄±z_(1−α/2)σ/√n是精確區間；非正常但合適大樣本可近似。已知σ需有外部可靠依據，不可用同一樣本s代入後仍聲稱σ已知。大樣本不自動讓母體SD變成已知。\n\n## 小樣本與未知σ {#6-1-2}\n\nσ未知時，常態iid下用X̄±t_(1−α/2,n−1)S/√n。大n時也可持續用t；小n則要特別注意偏態、極端值和獨立性。paired資料應先取差再估差的平均，不把兩次量測視為兩組獨立樣本。\n\n$$\n\\bar x\\pm t_{1-\\alpha/2,n-1}\\frac{s}{\\sqrt n}\n$$\n\n## 母體平均數區間估計流程圖 {#6-1-3}\n\n先定平均的母體與觀察單位，再查設計是否支持獨立或需群集／配對處理；確認σ是否真已知；檢查分布和有效n；計算SE與切點；最後報估計、區間、單位、條件與限制。這是流程，不是只憑n≥30走Z、否則走t的兩格判斷。\n\n![先確認設計，再依母體標準差是否已知選擇Z或t區間的流程圖](assets/mean-interval-flow.svg)\n\n[另開完整流程圖放大閱讀](assets/mean-interval-flow.svg)。這張圖列出主線選擇；配對、群集及時間依賴需回到各自適合的估計程序，不能不經檢查就套獨立模型。\n\n## 信賴是程序的性質\n\n固定母體參數，反覆按同設計抽樣建95%區間，長期約95%區間包含真值。此次區間與固定μ的包含關係已確定；不能直接改寫為μ有95%機率在裡面，也不是95%個別觀察值的範圍。首頁以重複區間視覺化此區別。\n\n## 數值與報告\n\nn=25、x̄=50、s=10，SE2、t24約2.0639，95%區間約[45.872,54.128]。若有真正已知σ=10，Z區間為[46.080,53.920]，差來自分母估計的不確定性。第11例用相同原始資料比對兩種前提。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n提高信賴水準會使區間較寬；提高n在同設計下通常變窄。區間窄不保證無偏，方便樣本可能得到精確但偏離母體的結果。報告可說「依所列條件估母體平均為…，95%信賴區間…」，並寫明樣本來源。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/11_mean_intervals.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 11_mean_intervals.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    x=[48,51,49,52,50,47,53,50,49,51]\n    result={'unknown_sigma_t':mean_ci(x),'known_sigma_z':mean_ci(x,sigma=3),'same_data_different_assumptions':True}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST平均數信賴區間](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "6-1", "name": "母體平均數區間估計：已知σ、未知σ與流程", "html": "母體平均數區間估計：已知σ、未知σ與流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "6-1-1", "name": "大樣本與已知σ", "html": "大樣本與已知σ", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "6-1-2", "name": "小樣本與未知σ", "html": "小樣本與未知σ", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "6-1-3", "name": "母體平均數區間估計流程圖", "html": "母體平均數區間估計流程圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "信賴是程序的性質", "html": "信賴是程序的性質", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "數值與報告", "html": "數值與報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "30-proportion-confidence", "group": "intervals", "title": "母體比例區間：Wald、Wilson與精確法", "summary": "邊界、小樣本與覆蓋率問題，比只背一個±公式更重要。", "tags": ["區間估計", "proportion confidence"], "example": "12_proportion_intervals.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"6-2-waldwilson\">母體比例區間：Wald、Wilson與精確法</h1>\n<p>邊界、小樣本與覆蓋率問題，比只背一個±公式更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wald\">最簡單的Wald近似</h2>\n<p>p̂±z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n)易手算，但小樣本、p靠0或1時覆蓋可能差，也可能超出[0,1]。把端點硬截回0到1並不自動修正覆蓋。0/10會得到零寬區間，明顯不能表示已排除所有正成功率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wilson-score\">Wilson score區間</h2>\n<p>由二項score檢定反解，通常有較佳有限樣本表現；中心不是單純p̂。令z為標準常態切點，其公式如下，兩界保持合理範圍。這裡是獨立二項比例，不直接套群集與加權調查比例。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\frac{\\hat p+z^2/(2n)\\ \\pm\\ z\\sqrt{\\hat p(1-\\hat p)/n+z^2/(4n^2)}}{1+z^2/n}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"clopperpearson\">Clopper–Pearson精確區間</h2>\n<p>透過二項尾端反解，常稱exact；離散性讓覆蓋通常保守，並非每個p都剛好95%。它與Wilson不是同一方法。SciPy binomtest(...).proportion_ci(method='exact')或'wilson'可直接核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">實際比較</h2>\n<p>8/10的點估計.8，區間會相當寬；0/10的Wilson上界約.2775，exact上界約.3085。這表示沒觀察到成功仍有不確定，不能說母體成功率已證明為0。報數字時附成功數與n，比例小數不足以揭露精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">方法與檢定的一致性</h2>\n<p>同一個假設檢定與其反解區間有特定對偶關係；exact二項檢定與Wilson區間不是嚴格反解配對，邊界判斷有時可不同。不要見p與區間似乎矛盾就先改數字，應先查方法、尾向、α與離散定義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>100人中20人同意與10人中2人同意，點估計皆.2，但區間不同。原因是樣本資訊不同，不是軟體不一致。若回覆為自願樣本，這些區間只在指定模型下反映抽樣變動，不包括所有選擇偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/12_proportion_intervals.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 12_proportion_intervals.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;wilson_0_of_10&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;wilson_8_of_10&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;exact_8_of_10&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;exact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 母體比例區間：Wald、Wilson與精確法 {#6-2-waldwilson}\n\n邊界、小樣本與覆蓋率問題，比只背一個±公式更重要。\n\n## 最簡單的Wald近似\n\np̂±z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n)易手算，但小樣本、p靠0或1時覆蓋可能差，也可能超出[0,1]。把端點硬截回0到1並不自動修正覆蓋。0/10會得到零寬區間，明顯不能表示已排除所有正成功率。\n\n## Wilson score區間\n\n由二項score檢定反解，通常有較佳有限樣本表現；中心不是單純p̂。令z為標準常態切點，其公式如下，兩界保持合理範圍。這裡是獨立二項比例，不直接套群集與加權調查比例。\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\hat p+z^2/(2n)\\ \\pm\\ z\\sqrt{\\hat p(1-\\hat p)/n+z^2/(4n^2)}}{1+z^2/n}\n$$\n\n## Clopper–Pearson精確區間\n\n透過二項尾端反解，常稱exact；離散性讓覆蓋通常保守，並非每個p都剛好95%。它與Wilson不是同一方法。SciPy binomtest(...).proportion_ci(method='exact')或'wilson'可直接核對。\n\n## 實際比較\n\n8/10的點估計.8，區間會相當寬；0/10的Wilson上界約.2775，exact上界約.3085。這表示沒觀察到成功仍有不確定，不能說母體成功率已證明為0。報數字時附成功數與n，比例小數不足以揭露精度。\n\n## 方法與檢定的一致性\n\n同一個假設檢定與其反解區間有特定對偶關係；exact二項檢定與Wilson區間不是嚴格反解配對，邊界判斷有時可不同。不要見p與區間似乎矛盾就先改數字，應先查方法、尾向、α與離散定義。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n100人中20人同意與10人中2人同意，點估計皆.2，但區間不同。原因是樣本資訊不同，不是軟體不一致。若回覆為自願樣本，這些區間只在指定模型下反映抽樣變動，不包括所有選擇偏差。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/12_proportion_intervals.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 12_proportion_intervals.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result={'wilson_0_of_10':proportion_ci(0,10),'wilson_8_of_10':proportion_ci(8,10),'exact_8_of_10':proportion_ci(8,10,method='exact')}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "6-2-waldwilson", "name": "母體比例區間：Wald、Wilson與精確法", "html": "母體比例區間：Wald、Wilson與精確法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "wald", "name": "最簡單的Wald近似", "html": "最簡單的Wald近似", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "wilson-score", "name": "Wilson score區間", "html": "Wilson score區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "clopperpearson", "name": "Clopper–Pearson精確區間", "html": "Clopper–Pearson精確區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "實際比較", "html": "實際比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "方法與檢定的一致性", "html": "方法與檢定的一致性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "31-planning-sample-size", "group": "intervals", "title": "樣本大小的決定：誤差、信賴與可行性", "summary": "估計精確度的樣本數規劃，與檢定力規劃分開處理。", "tags": ["區間估計", "planning sample size"], "example": "13_sample_size.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"6-3\">樣本大小的決定：誤差、信賴與可行性</h1>\n<p>估計精確度的樣本數規劃，與檢定力規劃分開處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">平均數的誤差規劃</h2>\n<p>在獨立常態近似、σ可合理預估時，要求半寬E，n≥(zσ/E)²，再向上取整。σ可來自先導研究或可信既有資料，但規劃值有不確定性，應做敏感度分析。未知σ且n小時可迭代使用t與預估SD，不把Z規劃式稱精確保證。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nn=\\left\\lceil\\left(\\frac{z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\sigma}{E}\\right)^2\\right\\rceil\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">比例的誤差規劃</h2>\n<p>常態近似n≈z²p<em>(1−p</em>)/E²，p*為規劃值。未知時用.5使此式所需n最大，是此近似框架的保守選擇，不是對所有抽樣與精確區間的通用最壞情況定理。95%、E=.05給約384.15，向上取385。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">未回應與設計效應</h2>\n<p>需完成n份且預估回應率r，可規劃邀請約n/r人，但回應率變動與選擇偏差仍需處理。群集設計可能需乘設計效應，有限母體還可能修正；權重與多階段程序不能一律用一個隨意係數代替設計計算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">精確度與檢定力不同</h2>\n<p>估平均±2單位，與想偵測平均差2單位的80%power，是不同目標。檢定力還需指定α、真實差異、變異、單雙側、組別分配及檢定程序。不要將「385份」當所有問卷研究通用標準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">一組數字</h2>\n<p>σ=10、95%信賴、E=2，用z=1.95996，得n=97。若E改1，需約385；半寬減半約需四倍樣本。第13例列平均與比例規劃，並標示沒有包含群集、未回應或其他設計調整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若需完成100份、預期回應率.4，邀請至少250只是期望上的起點，不保證一定收到100。若真正σ比規劃大一倍，所需n約四倍。合格規劃報告需說出假設、敏感度與成本，而非僅給一個整數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/13_sample_size.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 13_sample_size.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">margin</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.05</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mean_sigma_10_margin_2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;proportion_worst_case_margin_05&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">math</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ceil</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">margin</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;planning&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;normal approximation; independent sampling; no nonresponse or design-effect adjustment&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm\">NIST平均數信賴區間</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 樣本大小的決定：誤差、信賴與可行性 {#6-3}\n\n估計精確度的樣本數規劃，與檢定力規劃分開處理。\n\n## 平均數的誤差規劃\n\n在獨立常態近似、σ可合理預估時，要求半寬E，n≥(zσ/E)²，再向上取整。σ可來自先導研究或可信既有資料，但規劃值有不確定性，應做敏感度分析。未知σ且n小時可迭代使用t與預估SD，不把Z規劃式稱精確保證。\n\n$$\nn=\\left\\lceil\\left(\\frac{z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\sigma}{E}\\right)^2\\right\\rceil\n$$\n\n## 比例的誤差規劃\n\n常態近似n≈z²p*(1−p*)/E²，p*為規劃值。未知時用.5使此式所需n最大，是此近似框架的保守選擇，不是對所有抽樣與精確區間的通用最壞情況定理。95%、E=.05給約384.15，向上取385。\n\n## 未回應與設計效應\n\n需完成n份且預估回應率r，可規劃邀請約n/r人，但回應率變動與選擇偏差仍需處理。群集設計可能需乘設計效應，有限母體還可能修正；權重與多階段程序不能一律用一個隨意係數代替設計計算。\n\n## 精確度與檢定力不同\n\n估平均±2單位，與想偵測平均差2單位的80%power，是不同目標。檢定力還需指定α、真實差異、變異、單雙側、組別分配及檢定程序。不要將「385份」當所有問卷研究通用標準。\n\n## 一組數字\n\nσ=10、95%信賴、E=2，用z=1.95996，得n=97。若E改1，需約385；半寬減半約需四倍樣本。第13例列平均與比例規劃，並標示沒有包含群集、未回應或其他設計調整。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若需完成100份、預期回應率.4，邀請至少250只是期望上的起點，不保證一定收到100。若真正σ比規劃大一倍，所需n約四倍。合格規劃報告需說出假設、敏感度與成本，而非僅給一個整數。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/13_sample_size.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 13_sample_size.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    z=stats.norm.ppf(.975);margin=.05;p=.5\n    result={'mean_sigma_10_margin_2':sample_size_mean(10,2),'proportion_worst_case_margin_05':math.ceil(z*z*p*(1-p)/margin**2),'planning':'normal approximation; independent sampling; no nonresponse or design-effect adjustment'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST平均數信賴區間](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "6-3", "name": "樣本大小的決定：誤差、信賴與可行性", "html": "樣本大小的決定：誤差、信賴與可行性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "平均數的誤差規劃", "html": "平均數的誤差規劃", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "比例的誤差規劃", "html": "比例的誤差規劃", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "未回應與設計效應", "html": "未回應與設計效應", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "精確度與檢定力不同", "html": "精確度與檢定力不同", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "一組數字", "html": "一組數字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "32-variance-confidence", "group": "intervals", "title": "母體變異數與標準差的區間", "summary": "由卡方樞紐反解不對稱區間，清楚標示正常性條件。", "tags": ["區間估計", "variance confidence"], "example": "14_variance_interval.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"6-4\">母體變異數與標準差的區間</h1>\n<p>由卡方樞紐反解不對稱區間，清楚標示正常性條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">適用問題</h2>\n<p>估製程變動、量測誤差或其他母體分散時，平均區間不能替代變異數區間。本節精確程序以iid常態母體為前提；變異數對尾端敏感，非正常時尤其需謹慎。若只想描述當批樣本，不必假裝一定在推論更大母體。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">從樞紐移項</h2>\n<p>卡方上下切點夾住(n−1)S²/σ²，再反解σ²。因倒數，上界分母使用較小切點。α/2與1−α/2是左尾累積機率，不是都用上尾查表。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\left[\\frac{(n-1)s^2}{\\chi^2_{1-\\alpha/2,n-1}},\n\\frac{(n-1)s^2}{\\chi^2_{\\alpha/2,n-1}}\\right]\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">標準差區間</h2>\n<p>平方根在正數單調增加，所以對兩端各取根號得到σ區間，保留原單位。不是對區間半寬開根號後再加到s上，也不必強迫對稱。variance與SD區間都需標信賴水準與自由度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">範例驗算</h2>\n<p>第14例由十筆原始資料估s²，用χ²_9分位求區間，再報SD區間。測試另用n=3的資料[1,2,3]，s²=1，χ²_2的CDF有簡單指數形式，可手算驗證兩界，避免只用同一函式重算一次當測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">失效與替代思考</h2>\n<p>若樣本全相同，實際估計s²=0，程式拒絕此退化的正變異推論；不把沒有變化直接寫成母體完全無變動。若資料有明顯重尾，評估穩健尺度或適當重抽方法，並說明估計目標是否仍是variance。小樣本bootstrap也有自身限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：將時間由小時換分鐘，變異數兩界乘多少？答：3600，因數值乘60後variance乘60²；SD區間乘60。若報告數字只乘60卻仍標variance，單位和推論都錯位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/14_variance_interval.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 14_variance_interval.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sd_ci&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sqrt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;ci&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 母體變異數與標準差的區間 {#6-4}\n\n由卡方樞紐反解不對稱區間，清楚標示正常性條件。\n\n## 適用問題\n\n估製程變動、量測誤差或其他母體分散時，平均區間不能替代變異數區間。本節精確程序以iid常態母體為前提；變異數對尾端敏感，非正常時尤其需謹慎。若只想描述當批樣本，不必假裝一定在推論更大母體。\n\n## 從樞紐移項\n\n卡方上下切點夾住(n−1)S²/σ²，再反解σ²。因倒數，上界分母使用較小切點。α/2與1−α/2是左尾累積機率，不是都用上尾查表。\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{(n-1)s^2}{\\chi^2_{1-\\alpha/2,n-1}},\n\\frac{(n-1)s^2}{\\chi^2_{\\alpha/2,n-1}}\\right]\n$$\n\n## 標準差區間\n\n平方根在正數單調增加，所以對兩端各取根號得到σ區間，保留原單位。不是對區間半寬開根號後再加到s上，也不必強迫對稱。variance與SD區間都需標信賴水準與自由度。\n\n## 範例驗算\n\n第14例由十筆原始資料估s²，用χ²_9分位求區間，再報SD區間。測試另用n=3的資料[1,2,3]，s²=1，χ²_2的CDF有簡單指數形式，可手算驗證兩界，避免只用同一函式重算一次當測試。\n\n## 失效與替代思考\n\n若樣本全相同，實際估計s²=0，程式拒絕此退化的正變異推論；不把沒有變化直接寫成母體完全無變動。若資料有明顯重尾，評估穩健尺度或適當重抽方法，並說明估計目標是否仍是variance。小樣本bootstrap也有自身限制。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：將時間由小時換分鐘，變異數兩界乘多少？答：3600，因數值乘60後variance乘60²；SD區間乘60。若報告數字只乘60卻仍標variance，單位和推論都錯位。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/14_variance_interval.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 14_variance_interval.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=variance_ci([8,9,10,11,12,9,10,11,8,12]);result['sd_ci']=np.sqrt(result['ci'])\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "6-4", "name": "母體變異數與標準差的區間", "html": "母體變異數與標準差的區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "適用問題", "html": "適用問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "從樞紐移項", "html": "從樞紐移項", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "標準差區間", "html": "標準差區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "範例驗算", "html": "範例驗算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "失效與替代思考", "html": "失效與替代思考", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "33-exercises-intervals", "group": "intervals", "title": "區間估計習題詳解", "summary": "將估計值、SE、切點、端點與語意完整寫出。", "tags": ["區間估計", "exercises intervals"], "html": "<h1 id=\"06\">區間估計習題詳解</h1>\n<p>將估計值、SE、切點、端點與語意完整寫出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：已知σ平均區間</h2>\n<p>n=100、x̄=40、已知σ=10，95%區間為40±1.95996×1，即約[38.04,41.96]。需寫明獨立樣本與正常或合適近似條件。若10其實是同一樣本SD，應改用t99，不能直接聲稱σ已知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：未知σ的小樣本</h2>\n<p>n=9、x̄=20、s=3，SE=1，t_(.975,8)≈2.306，95%區間[17.694,22.306]。這是μ的區間，不是說95%個別資料在裡面。個別預測包含更多變動，第9章會看到預測區間較寬。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：比例的邊界</h2>\n<p>0/10的Wald區間[0,0]，有何問題？答案：邊界plug-in SE為零，有限樣本覆蓋失效。Wilson及exact給正上界；兩者不是誰小數較多就比較精確，應明說方法與覆蓋性質。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：樣本大小</h2>\n<p>規劃σ=8、95%、半寬E=1.5，n=ceil((1.95996×8/1.5)²)=110。若E降成.75，樣本數約四倍，向上取整可能不是剛好440。任何數字都需附σ規劃來源與設計假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題五：變異數區間方向</h2>\n<p>χ²的.975切點比.025大，因此variance下界除.975、上界除.025。反過來會出現下界大於上界。SD區間再對兩端開根號。解答除公式，也應說明原始資料正常性對此程序的重要性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">題六：覆蓋解讀</h2>\n<p>「已計算的95%區間表示真μ有95%機率在內」不是本課頻率學派的直接解釋。合格答案說：同程序反覆抽樣，約95%區間覆蓋固定μ；此次是否包含已是固定關係。這並非降低區間價值，而是把不確定性放在抽樣程序的正確位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">延伸題：同時區間</h2>\n<p>一次對20個平均各建95%區間，能否說全部一起覆蓋的機率也是95%？不行，個別與同時覆蓋不同；即使在獨立理想情況，全覆蓋率也是.95的20次方。需要同時推論時應另規劃家族與調整，不把個別信賴水準當整體承諾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm\">NIST平均數信賴區間</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 區間估計習題詳解 {#06}\n\n將估計值、SE、切點、端點與語意完整寫出。\n\n## 題一：已知σ平均區間\n\nn=100、x̄=40、已知σ=10，95%區間為40±1.95996×1，即約[38.04,41.96]。需寫明獨立樣本與正常或合適近似條件。若10其實是同一樣本SD，應改用t99，不能直接聲稱σ已知。\n\n## 題二：未知σ的小樣本\n\nn=9、x̄=20、s=3，SE=1，t_(.975,8)≈2.306，95%區間[17.694,22.306]。這是μ的區間，不是說95%個別資料在裡面。個別預測包含更多變動，第9章會看到預測區間較寬。\n\n## 題三：比例的邊界\n\n0/10的Wald區間[0,0]，有何問題？答案：邊界plug-in SE為零，有限樣本覆蓋失效。Wilson及exact給正上界；兩者不是誰小數較多就比較精確，應明說方法與覆蓋性質。\n\n## 題四：樣本大小\n\n規劃σ=8、95%、半寬E=1.5，n=ceil((1.95996×8/1.5)²)=110。若E降成.75，樣本數約四倍，向上取整可能不是剛好440。任何數字都需附σ規劃來源與設計假設。\n\n## 題五：變異數區間方向\n\nχ²的.975切點比.025大，因此variance下界除.975、上界除.025。反過來會出現下界大於上界。SD區間再對兩端開根號。解答除公式，也應說明原始資料正常性對此程序的重要性。\n\n## 題六：覆蓋解讀\n\n「已計算的95%區間表示真μ有95%機率在內」不是本課頻率學派的直接解釋。合格答案說：同程序反覆抽樣，約95%區間覆蓋固定μ；此次是否包含已是固定關係。這並非降低區間價值，而是把不確定性放在抽樣程序的正確位置。\n\n## 延伸題：同時區間\n\n一次對20個平均各建95%區間，能否說全部一起覆蓋的機率也是95%？不行，個別與同時覆蓋不同；即使在獨立理想情況，全覆蓋率也是.95的20次方。需要同時推論時應另規劃家族與調整，不把個別信賴水準當整體承諾。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST平均數信賴區間](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda352.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "06", "name": "區間估計習題詳解", "html": "區間估計習題詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：已知σ平均區間", "html": "題一：已知σ平均區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：未知σ的小樣本", "html": "題二：未知σ的小樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：比例的邊界", "html": "題三：比例的邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：樣本大小", "html": "題四：樣本大小", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題五：變異數區間方向", "html": "題五：變異數區間方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "題六：覆蓋解讀", "html": "題六：覆蓋解讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "延伸題：同時區間", "html": "延伸題：同時區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "34-testing-foundations", "group": "testing", "title": "假設檢定、誤差、拒絕區與檢定力", "summary": "先定研究問題與決策規則，再計算p值。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "testing foundations"], "example": "15_testing_power.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-1\">假設檢定、誤差、拒絕區與檢定力</h1>\n<p>先定研究問題與決策規則，再計算p值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-1-17-1-2\">假設檢定與虛無、對立假設</h2>\n<p>H0描述基準或限制，例如μ=μ0；H1可為≠、&gt;或&lt;，方向由研究問題事前決定。p值是在H0及模型假設下，觀察到同樣或更極端資料的機率；不是H0為真的機率，也不是觀察結果純屬偶然的後驗機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-1-3-iii\">型I與型II誤差</h2>\n<p>H0真卻拒絕為型I，程序控制其機率α；在某指定替代真值下不拒絕為型II，機率β。power=1−β依真差異、變異、n、α及檢定方法而變，不能只報一個與差異無關的「檢定力」。未拒絕不等於接受H0或證明等效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-1-4\">拒絕區</h2>\n<p>例如雙側已知σ的Z檢定，|Z|&gt;z_(1−α/2)時拒絕。p≤α與落入拒絕區是同一程序的兩種表達。不可看結果後將雙側改單側、改α或反覆查看直到顯著；那會改變原先錯誤率。多個檢定也要定義比較家族與調整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">檢定力的具體例子</h2>\n<p>第15例採獨立常態、σ=1已知的雙側Z模型。真差異δ時，Z均值偏移δ√n/σ，power是兩個拒絕尾部的機率和。δ=0時應回到α，n或固定非零差異增加通常提高power。這不是未知SD的t檢定power，不能互相冒名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">結果如何寫</h2>\n<p>同時報差異估計、區間、n、檢定與假設，p保留合理有效位數；極小值寫p&lt;.001或科學記號，不寫p=0。實質重要性由領域標準與成本判斷，統計顯著只回答指定模型下的相容程度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>p=.08不能說有92%機率H0為真；p=.001也不代表差異一定很大。若目標是證明兩組差異小到可忽略，需事前等效界值及等效檢定，不可把不顯著直接改寫為相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/15_testing_power.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 15_testing_power.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;p_two_sided_z_2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;null_rejection_probability&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;power_delta_half&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;power_n_100&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;assumptions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;two-sided z test, known sigma=1, independent normal observations&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf\">ASA的p值聲明</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 假設檢定、誤差、拒絕區與檢定力 {#7-1}\n\n先定研究問題與決策規則，再計算p值。\n\n## 假設檢定與虛無、對立假設 {#7-1-17-1-2}\n\nH0描述基準或限制，例如μ=μ0；H1可為≠、>或<，方向由研究問題事前決定。p值是在H0及模型假設下，觀察到同樣或更極端資料的機率；不是H0為真的機率，也不是觀察結果純屬偶然的後驗機率。\n\n## 型I與型II誤差 {#7-1-3-iii}\n\nH0真卻拒絕為型I，程序控制其機率α；在某指定替代真值下不拒絕為型II，機率β。power=1−β依真差異、變異、n、α及檢定方法而變，不能只報一個與差異無關的「檢定力」。未拒絕不等於接受H0或證明等效。\n\n## 拒絕區 {#7-1-4}\n\n例如雙側已知σ的Z檢定，|Z|>z_(1−α/2)時拒絕。p≤α與落入拒絕區是同一程序的兩種表達。不可看結果後將雙側改單側、改α或反覆查看直到顯著；那會改變原先錯誤率。多個檢定也要定義比較家族與調整。\n\n## 檢定力的具體例子\n\n第15例採獨立常態、σ=1已知的雙側Z模型。真差異δ時，Z均值偏移δ√n/σ，power是兩個拒絕尾部的機率和。δ=0時應回到α，n或固定非零差異增加通常提高power。這不是未知SD的t檢定power，不能互相冒名。\n\n## 結果如何寫\n\n同時報差異估計、區間、n、檢定與假設，p保留合理有效位數；極小值寫p<.001或科學記號，不寫p=0。實質重要性由領域標準與成本判斷，統計顯著只回答指定模型下的相容程度。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\np=.08不能說有92%機率H0為真；p=.001也不代表差異一定很大。若目標是證明兩組差異小到可忽略，需事前等效界值及等效檢定，不可把不顯著直接改寫為相同。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/15_testing_power.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 15_testing_power.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result={'p_two_sided_z_2':2*stats.norm.sf(2),'null_rejection_probability':z_power(30,0),'power_delta_half':z_power(30,.5),'power_n_100':z_power(100,.5),'assumptions':'two-sided z test, known sigma=1, independent normal observations'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [ASA的p值聲明](https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-1", "name": "假設檢定、誤差、拒絕區與檢定力", "html": "假設檢定、誤差、拒絕區與檢定力", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "7-1-17-1-2", "name": "假設檢定與虛無、對立假設", "html": "假設檢定與虛無、對立假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-1-3-iii", "name": "型I與型II誤差", "html": "型I與型II誤差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-1-4", "name": "拒絕區", "html": "拒絕區", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "檢定力的具體例子", "html": "檢定力的具體例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "結果如何寫", "html": "結果如何寫", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "35-one-mean-test", "group": "testing", "title": "母體平均數檢定：大樣本與小樣本", "summary": "以σ資訊與設計決定Z或t，並連結差異與信賴區間。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "one mean test"], "example": "16_one_sample_t.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-2\">母體平均數檢定：大樣本與小樣本</h1>\n<p>以σ資訊與設計決定Z或t，並連結差異與信賴區間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-2-1\">大樣本情況</h2>\n<p>已知σ可用Z=(x̄−μ0)/(σ/√n)，在正常或合適近似條件下參照N(0,1)。若σ未知，大n可近似以s替代，但通常直接使用t也合理。不要因為n≥30就把未知母體SD當已知，或忽略嚴重依賴與偏態尾端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-2-2\">小樣本情況</h2>\n<p>iid常態、σ未知時用t=(x̄−μ0)/(s/√n)，df=n−1。小樣本需要更仔細看原始點、極端值與來源；常態性檢定不顯著也不能保證正常，尤其n小時辨識力有限。若是前後資料，應檢查差值而不是各自一套單樣本檢定。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nt=\\frac{\\bar x-\\mu_0}{s/\\sqrt n},\\qquad\np_{\\rm two}=2P(T_{n-1}\\geq|t|)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">步驟與符號</h2>\n<p>先寫H0、H1、α、有效n與單位；算平均、SD、SE、t；由對應尾端得p；最後報差異與區間。右側假設μ&gt;μ0用sf(t)，左側用cdf(t)，不是把雙側p一律除2而忽略觀察方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">數值與程式</h2>\n<p>第16例八筆[9,10,12,11,10,13,9,12]對μ0=10，程式回估計、CI、差異、SE、t與p。共同函式不會靜默刪缺失；使用者需先做明確政策並報有效n。CI本身針對μ，difference欄再相對於μ0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">區間與檢定的連結</h2>\n<p>同一雙側t程序、同一α下，μ0不在1−α區間即對應拒絕。若用不同信賴水準、單側或其他區間，不能直接套這個關係。也別因未拒絕就宣稱服務符合規格，符合／等效可能需要不同問題設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>x̄=12、μ0=10、s=4、n=16，t=2、df15。用t15計雙尾，而不是Z表。若把所有值及μ0都乘100，t與p不變，差異與CI乘100；這可作單位變換的自我檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/16_one_sample_t.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 16_one_sample_t.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">13</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">mu</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc22.htm\">NIST單樣本平均數檢定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 母體平均數檢定：大樣本與小樣本 {#7-2}\n\n以σ資訊與設計決定Z或t，並連結差異與信賴區間。\n\n## 大樣本情況 {#7-2-1}\n\n已知σ可用Z=(x̄−μ0)/(σ/√n)，在正常或合適近似條件下參照N(0,1)。若σ未知，大n可近似以s替代，但通常直接使用t也合理。不要因為n≥30就把未知母體SD當已知，或忽略嚴重依賴與偏態尾端。\n\n## 小樣本情況 {#7-2-2}\n\niid常態、σ未知時用t=(x̄−μ0)/(s/√n)，df=n−1。小樣本需要更仔細看原始點、極端值與來源；常態性檢定不顯著也不能保證正常，尤其n小時辨識力有限。若是前後資料，應檢查差值而不是各自一套單樣本檢定。\n\n$$\nt=\\frac{\\bar x-\\mu_0}{s/\\sqrt n},\\qquad\np_{\\rm two}=2P(T_{n-1}\\geq|t|)\n$$\n\n## 步驟與符號\n\n先寫H0、H1、α、有效n與單位；算平均、SD、SE、t；由對應尾端得p；最後報差異與區間。右側假設μ>μ0用sf(t)，左側用cdf(t)，不是把雙側p一律除2而忽略觀察方向。\n\n## 數值與程式\n\n第16例八筆[9,10,12,11,10,13,9,12]對μ0=10，程式回估計、CI、差異、SE、t與p。共同函式不會靜默刪缺失；使用者需先做明確政策並報有效n。CI本身針對μ，difference欄再相對於μ0。\n\n## 區間與檢定的連結\n\n同一雙側t程序、同一α下，μ0不在1−α區間即對應拒絕。若用不同信賴水準、單側或其他區間，不能直接套這個關係。也別因未拒絕就宣稱服務符合規格，符合／等效可能需要不同問題設定。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nx̄=12、μ0=10、s=4、n=16，t=2、df15。用t15計雙尾，而不是Z表。若把所有值及μ0都乘100，t與p不變，差異與CI乘100；這可作單位變換的自我檢查。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/16_one_sample_t.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 16_one_sample_t.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=one_t([9,10,12,11,10,13,9,12],mu=10)\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST單樣本平均數檢定](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc22.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-2", "name": "母體平均數檢定：大樣本與小樣本", "html": "母體平均數檢定：大樣本與小樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "7-2-1", "name": "大樣本情況", "html": "大樣本情況", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-2-2", "name": "小樣本情況", "html": "小樣本情況", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "步驟與符號", "html": "步驟與符號", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "數值與程式", "html": "數值與程式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "區間與檢定的連結", "html": "區間與檢定的連結", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "36-one-proportion-test", "group": "testing", "title": "母體比例檢定：二項精確與常態近似", "summary": "用H0下的變異建立檢定，讓小樣本與邊界另有處理。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "one proportion test"], "example": "17_one_proportion.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-3\">母體比例檢定：二項精確與常態近似</h1>\n<p>用H0下的變異建立檢定，讓小樣本與邊界另有處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">虛無假設的機制</h2>\n<p>固定n個獨立同成功率試驗，H0:p=p0。若p0=0或1為退化邊界，普通Z公式分母為零，不能照算。也需區分成功「人數」與事件「次數」，同一人多次事件未必獨立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"z\">常態近似Z</h2>\n<p>檢定用p0建立H0下SE，Z=(p̂−p0)/√(p0(1−p0)/n)。這與Wald估計使用p̂的分母不同。查np0與n(1−p0)是否足夠，必要時直接採精確二項。連續性修正與否也要標示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">精確二項檢定</h2>\n<p>SciPy binomtest提供明確alternative。離散雙側「更極端」有不同慣例，軟體的雙側p不是所有情況都等於兩倍單側尾。使用固定API並說明，不自行挑一個較小的版本。8/10對p0=.5的雙側exact p為.109375。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">區間與效果</h2>\n<p>點估計.8、對.5差.3，但n=10資訊少；報Wilson或exact CI並註明方法。exact檢定和Wilson區間不是同一反解配對，若臨界判斷不同先查方法。顯著與否不能代替成功率差異的大小及不確定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">程式與資料品質</h2>\n<p>第17例以整數成功數與n呼叫binomtest，函式驗證0≤k≤n。不能將「80%」直接輸入k=80而實際n=10；百分比先還原原始計數。四捨五入比例有時無法唯一還原，應取得原始分子與分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若同樣80%，8/10與800/1000的p值會相同嗎？不會，n改變SE與抽樣資訊。若測20項功能各做一次檢定，也不應把每個未調整p&lt;.05都當整體5%錯誤率；多重比較需事前處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/17_one_proportion.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 17_one_proportion.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binomtest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alternative</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;two-sided&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;successes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;n&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;null&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;exact_p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pvalue</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;wilson_interval&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;exact test and Wilson interval are not an inversion pair&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf\">ASA的p值聲明</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 母體比例檢定：二項精確與常態近似 {#7-3}\n\n用H0下的變異建立檢定，讓小樣本與邊界另有處理。\n\n## 虛無假設的機制\n\n固定n個獨立同成功率試驗，H0:p=p0。若p0=0或1為退化邊界，普通Z公式分母為零，不能照算。也需區分成功「人數」與事件「次數」，同一人多次事件未必獨立。\n\n## 常態近似Z\n\n檢定用p0建立H0下SE，Z=(p̂−p0)/√(p0(1−p0)/n)。這與Wald估計使用p̂的分母不同。查np0與n(1−p0)是否足夠，必要時直接採精確二項。連續性修正與否也要標示。\n\n## 精確二項檢定\n\nSciPy binomtest提供明確alternative。離散雙側「更極端」有不同慣例，軟體的雙側p不是所有情況都等於兩倍單側尾。使用固定API並說明，不自行挑一個較小的版本。8/10對p0=.5的雙側exact p為.109375。\n\n## 區間與效果\n\n點估計.8、對.5差.3，但n=10資訊少；報Wilson或exact CI並註明方法。exact檢定和Wilson區間不是同一反解配對，若臨界判斷不同先查方法。顯著與否不能代替成功率差異的大小及不確定性。\n\n## 程式與資料品質\n\n第17例以整數成功數與n呼叫binomtest，函式驗證0≤k≤n。不能將「80%」直接輸入k=80而實際n=10；百分比先還原原始計數。四捨五入比例有時無法唯一還原，應取得原始分子與分母。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若同樣80%，8/10與800/1000的p值會相同嗎？不會，n改變SE與抽樣資訊。若測20項功能各做一次檢定，也不應把每個未調整p<.05都當整體5%錯誤率；多重比較需事前處理。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/17_one_proportion.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 17_one_proportion.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    test=stats.binomtest(8,10,p=.5,alternative='two-sided')\n    result={'successes':8,'n':10,'null':.5,'exact_p':test.pvalue,'wilson_interval':proportion_ci(8,10),'note':'exact test and Wilson interval are not an inversion pair'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [ASA的p值聲明](https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-3", "name": "母體比例檢定：二項精確與常態近似", "html": "母體比例檢定：二項精確與常態近似", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "虛無假設的機制", "html": "虛無假設的機制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "z", "name": "常態近似Z", "html": "常態近似Z", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "精確二項檢定", "html": "精確二項檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "區間與效果", "html": "區間與效果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "程式與資料品質", "html": "程式與資料品質", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "37-one-variance-test", "group": "testing", "title": "母體變異數檢定：卡方參照與敏感度", "summary": "針對分散提出假設，避免把平均檢定當成變動檢定。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "one variance test"], "example": "18_one_variance.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-4\">母體變異數檢定：卡方參照與敏感度</h1>\n<p>針對分散提出假設，避免把平均檢定當成變動檢定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">假設與前提</h2>\n<p>H0:σ²=σ0²，H1可為雙側或較大／較小變動。精確卡方程序需要iid常態觀察，對偏態與重尾很敏感。若資料來自不同時間群集，先處理機制，不只看直方圖大概像鐘形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">統計量</h2>\n<p>Q=(n−1)s²/σ0²，H0下參照χ²_(n−1)。σ0²必須為正，若原需求給SD0，先平方。統計量非負，沒有「負卡方表示比較小」的解釋；較小s²反映Q落左尾。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nQ=\\frac{(n-1)s^2}{\\sigma_0^2}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">單雙側尾向</h2>\n<p>H1:σ²&gt;σ0²用sf(Q)，較小用cdf(Q)。本課雙側採等尾程序，p=min(1,2min(cdf,sf))；拒絕區為兩個α/2尾端。其他最短接受域慣例可能不同，所以要說清楚程序，不能從不對稱分布直接照搬±Z。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">差異與區間</h2>\n<p>除p值，同時報s²、單位、n、卡方df與variance CI。若管理目標只允許變動低於上限，單側界限或非劣性式規格問題可能比雙側「是否不同」更貼切，需在看結果前決定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">程式驗算</h2>\n<p>第18例使用十筆資料對σ0²=4。測試另用[1,2,3]、σ0²=1，Q=2、df2，雙側p=2/e約.73576，可用卡方df2的指數CDF獨立驗算。這種已知值檢查比只重複同一API更能抓尾向錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：將資料乘3、σ0²也乘3是否保持統計量？答：不對，variance基準需乘9才保持Q。若只換資料單位而沒有換基準，檢定問題已不同。平均值平移不改variance，所以所有觀察加10不應改Q與p。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/18_one_variance.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 18_one_variance.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">sigma2</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 母體變異數檢定：卡方參照與敏感度 {#7-4}\n\n針對分散提出假設，避免把平均檢定當成變動檢定。\n\n## 假設與前提\n\nH0:σ²=σ0²，H1可為雙側或較大／較小變動。精確卡方程序需要iid常態觀察，對偏態與重尾很敏感。若資料來自不同時間群集，先處理機制，不只看直方圖大概像鐘形。\n\n## 統計量\n\nQ=(n−1)s²/σ0²，H0下參照χ²_(n−1)。σ0²必須為正，若原需求給SD0，先平方。統計量非負，沒有「負卡方表示比較小」的解釋；較小s²反映Q落左尾。\n\n$$\nQ=\\frac{(n-1)s^2}{\\sigma_0^2}\n$$\n\n## 單雙側尾向\n\nH1:σ²>σ0²用sf(Q)，較小用cdf(Q)。本課雙側採等尾程序，p=min(1,2min(cdf,sf))；拒絕區為兩個α/2尾端。其他最短接受域慣例可能不同，所以要說清楚程序，不能從不對稱分布直接照搬±Z。\n\n## 差異與區間\n\n除p值，同時報s²、單位、n、卡方df與variance CI。若管理目標只允許變動低於上限，單側界限或非劣性式規格問題可能比雙側「是否不同」更貼切，需在看結果前決定。\n\n## 程式驗算\n\n第18例使用十筆資料對σ0²=4。測試另用[1,2,3]、σ0²=1，Q=2、df2，雙側p=2/e約.73576，可用卡方df2的指數CDF獨立驗算。這種已知值檢查比只重複同一API更能抓尾向錯誤。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：將資料乘3、σ0²也乘3是否保持統計量？答：不對，variance基準需乘9才保持Q。若只換資料單位而沒有換基準，檢定問題已不同。平均值平移不改variance，所以所有觀察加10不應改Q與p。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/18_one_variance.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 18_one_variance.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=variance_test([8,9,10,11,12,9,10,11,8,12],sigma2=4)\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-4", "name": "母體變異數檢定：卡方參照與敏感度", "html": "母體變異數檢定：卡方參照與敏感度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "假設與前提", "html": "假設與前提", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "統計量", "html": "統計量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "單雙側尾向", "html": "單雙側尾向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "差異與區間", "html": "差異與區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "程式驗算", "html": "程式驗算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "38-two-means", "group": "testing", "title": "兩母體平均數：大樣本、Welch、pooled與成對", "summary": "先辨認資料關係，再決定標準誤，而非先跑等變異檢定分流。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "two means"], "example": "19_welch_test.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-5-welchpooled\">兩母體平均數：大樣本、Welch、pooled與成對</h1>\n<p>先辨認資料關係，再決定標準誤，而非先跑等變異檢定分流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-5-1\">大樣本與已知變異</h2>\n<p>獨立兩組平均差估μA−μB。若σA、σB真已知，SE=√(σA²/nA+σB²/nB)，可用Z；未知時大樣本近似或t程序需相應條件。兩組樣本數可以不同，關鍵是觀察是否獨立及目標是否相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-5-2-welch\">小樣本與Welch</h2>\n<p>Welch不假設兩母體變異相等，分母用sA²/nA+sB²/nB，df採Satterthwaite近似，常是合理的預設獨立組比較。不要機械地先用Levene p決定pooled或Welch，兩階段選擇會改整體程序特性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nt=\\frac{\\bar x_A-\\bar x_B-\\Delta_0}{\\sqrt{s_A^2/n_A+s_B^2/n_B}},\\quad\n\\nu=\\frac{(s_A^2/n_A+s_B^2/n_B)^2}{(s_A^2/n_A)^2/(n_A-1)+(s_B^2/n_B)^2/(n_B-1)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"pooled-t\">Pooled t的額外假設</h2>\n<p>若有合理等變異常態模型，合併variance為((nA−1)sA²+(nB−1)sB²)/(nA+nB−2)，df=nA+nB−2。它不是因樣本SD碰巧相近就精確成立。獨立、模型與樣本量不平衡都影響使用判斷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-5-3\">成對樣本</h2>\n<p>同人前後或合理配對，以dᵢ=after−before做單樣本t，SE=s_d/√n。兩次SD各自很大並不代表差值SE大，因配對共變異可能抵銷。配對依ID與設計，不是因兩列剛好同長。第7章習題和第10章都有實際配對入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">效果與報告</h2>\n<p>第19例固定方向A−B，回兩組n、差異、SE、df、p與CI。若用標準化效果量，也需說明分母是pooled SD或其他定義，不能把t統計量當效果大小。原始單位差異通常最容易回到實際重要性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>[1,2,3]對[3,5,7]，均差−3，SE=√(5/3)、Welch df=50/17。若資料其實三個人的前後，就應看差[2,3,4]，分析目標與SE會不同。沒有辨認設計前，不能只靠兩組數字決定檢定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/19_welch_test.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 19_welch_test.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">13</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm\">NIST兩樣本t檢定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 兩母體平均數：大樣本、Welch、pooled與成對 {#7-5-welchpooled}\n\n先辨認資料關係，再決定標準誤，而非先跑等變異檢定分流。\n\n## 大樣本與已知變異 {#7-5-1}\n\n獨立兩組平均差估μA−μB。若σA、σB真已知，SE=√(σA²/nA+σB²/nB)，可用Z；未知時大樣本近似或t程序需相應條件。兩組樣本數可以不同，關鍵是觀察是否獨立及目標是否相同。\n\n## 小樣本與Welch {#7-5-2-welch}\n\nWelch不假設兩母體變異相等，分母用sA²/nA+sB²/nB，df採Satterthwaite近似，常是合理的預設獨立組比較。不要機械地先用Levene p決定pooled或Welch，兩階段選擇會改整體程序特性。\n\n$$\nt=\\frac{\\bar x_A-\\bar x_B-\\Delta_0}{\\sqrt{s_A^2/n_A+s_B^2/n_B}},\\quad\n\\nu=\\frac{(s_A^2/n_A+s_B^2/n_B)^2}{(s_A^2/n_A)^2/(n_A-1)+(s_B^2/n_B)^2/(n_B-1)}\n$$\n\n## Pooled t的額外假設\n\n若有合理等變異常態模型，合併variance為((nA−1)sA²+(nB−1)sB²)/(nA+nB−2)，df=nA+nB−2。它不是因樣本SD碰巧相近就精確成立。獨立、模型與樣本量不平衡都影響使用判斷。\n\n## 成對樣本 {#7-5-3}\n\n同人前後或合理配對，以dᵢ=after−before做單樣本t，SE=s_d/√n。兩次SD各自很大並不代表差值SE大，因配對共變異可能抵銷。配對依ID與設計，不是因兩列剛好同長。第7章習題和第10章都有實際配對入口。\n\n## 效果與報告\n\n第19例固定方向A−B，回兩組n、差異、SE、df、p與CI。若用標準化效果量，也需說明分母是pooled SD或其他定義，不能把t統計量當效果大小。原始單位差異通常最容易回到實際重要性。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n[1,2,3]對[3,5,7]，均差−3，SE=√(5/3)、Welch df=50/17。若資料其實三個人的前後，就應看差[2,3,4]，分析目標與SE會不同。沒有辨認設計前，不能只靠兩組數字決定檢定。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/19_welch_test.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 19_welch_test.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=welch([10,11,12,10,13,12],[8,7,10,6,9,11,7,8])\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST兩樣本t檢定](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-5-welchpooled", "name": "兩母體平均數：大樣本、Welch、pooled與成對", "html": "兩母體平均數：大樣本、Welch、pooled與成對", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "7-5-1", "name": "大樣本與已知變異", "html": "大樣本與已知變異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-5-2-welch", "name": "小樣本與Welch", "html": "小樣本與Welch", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pooled-t", "name": "Pooled t的額外假設", "html": "Pooled t的額外假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-5-3", "name": "成對樣本", "html": "成對樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "效果與報告", "html": "效果與報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "39-two-proportions", "group": "testing", "title": "兩母體比例檢定與差異區間", "summary": "區分H0下的合併比例、區間估計及配對二元資料。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "two proportions"], "example": "21_two_proportions.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-6\">兩母體比例檢定與差異區間</h1>\n<p>區分H0下的合併比例、區間估計及配對二元資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">獨立兩組的問題</h2>\n<p>A組kA/nA、B組kB/nB，估計pA−pB。H0相等時以合併p_pool=(kA+kB)/(nA+nB)估共同率，Z分母√(p_pool(1−p_pool)(1/nA+1/nB))。這個合併率用於H0檢定，不代表報告兩組點估計要被改成同一值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nZ=\\frac{\\hat p_A-\\hat p_B}{\\sqrt{\\hat p_{\\rm pool}(1-\\hat p_{\\rm pool})(1/n_A+1/n_B)}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">資料與近似條件</h2>\n<p>需獨立觀察、有效二元定義及足夠期望計數。稀疏2×2表可考慮Fisher等程序，但其條件化與假設有不同細節。零事件也可能使簡單近似不穩定，不能只因總人數大便忽略稀有性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">差異區間</h2>\n<p>Wald差異區間與pooled檢定分母不同；本課實作使用Newcombe差異區間，改善一些有限樣本情況。它不是同pooled Z檢定的嚴格反解，因此邊界判斷不必強迫完全一致。報告需列方法，避免只寫「95%」讓人猜公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">不能直接套配對資料</h2>\n<p>同一人前後是否同意，兩個比例彼此相關，通常需分析配對2×2的不一致對，如McNemar問題。將前後都當100名獨立人會錯估SE。兩組「同樣n」不足以辨認設計，仍要回到ID與抽樣流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">手算與程式</h2>\n<p>45/100對30/100，差.15、合併率.375。第21例以statsmodels proportions_ztest和confint_proportions_2indep計算p及Newcombe CI。輸入是原始成功數與分母，不能用四捨五入百分比再當作100人資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>差15百分點與相對增加50%是不同表達：.45−.30=.15，(.45−.30)/.30=.5。基準比例較低時相對數可很大，報告最好附兩組原始率、分母與差異區間，不以某個較驚人的百分比取代完整資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/21_two_proportions.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 21_two_proportions.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.proportion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">proportions_ztest</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">confint_proportions_2indep</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">proportions_ztest</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">45</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">alternative</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;two-sided&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ci</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">confint_proportions_2indep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">45</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;newcomb&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compare</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;diff&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;difference_A_minus_B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mf\">.15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pooled_null_z&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;newcombe_difference_ci&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;independent groups; interval uses a different approximation than the pooled z test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 兩母體比例檢定與差異區間 {#7-6}\n\n區分H0下的合併比例、區間估計及配對二元資料。\n\n## 獨立兩組的問題\n\nA組kA/nA、B組kB/nB，估計pA−pB。H0相等時以合併p_pool=(kA+kB)/(nA+nB)估共同率，Z分母√(p_pool(1−p_pool)(1/nA+1/nB))。這個合併率用於H0檢定，不代表報告兩組點估計要被改成同一值。\n\n$$\nZ=\\frac{\\hat p_A-\\hat p_B}{\\sqrt{\\hat p_{\\rm pool}(1-\\hat p_{\\rm pool})(1/n_A+1/n_B)}}\n$$\n\n## 資料與近似條件\n\n需獨立觀察、有效二元定義及足夠期望計數。稀疏2×2表可考慮Fisher等程序，但其條件化與假設有不同細節。零事件也可能使簡單近似不穩定，不能只因總人數大便忽略稀有性。\n\n## 差異區間\n\nWald差異區間與pooled檢定分母不同；本課實作使用Newcombe差異區間，改善一些有限樣本情況。它不是同pooled Z檢定的嚴格反解，因此邊界判斷不必強迫完全一致。報告需列方法，避免只寫「95%」讓人猜公式。\n\n## 不能直接套配對資料\n\n同一人前後是否同意，兩個比例彼此相關，通常需分析配對2×2的不一致對，如McNemar問題。將前後都當100名獨立人會錯估SE。兩組「同樣n」不足以辨認設計，仍要回到ID與抽樣流程。\n\n## 手算與程式\n\n45/100對30/100，差.15、合併率.375。第21例以statsmodels proportions_ztest和confint_proportions_2indep計算p及Newcombe CI。輸入是原始成功數與分母，不能用四捨五入百分比再當作100人資料。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n差15百分點與相對增加50%是不同表達：.45−.30=.15，(.45−.30)/.30=.5。基準比例較低時相對數可很大，報告最好附兩組原始率、分母與差異區間，不以某個較驚人的百分比取代完整資訊。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/21_two_proportions.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 21_two_proportions.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    from statsmodels.stats.proportion import proportions_ztest,confint_proportions_2indep\n    z,p=proportions_ztest([45,30],[100,100],alternative='two-sided')\n    ci=confint_proportions_2indep(45,100,30,100,method='newcomb',compare='diff')\n    result={'difference_A_minus_B':.15,'pooled_null_z':z,'p':p,'newcombe_difference_ci':ci,'note':'independent groups; interval uses a different approximation than the pooled z test'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-6", "name": "兩母體比例檢定與差異區間", "html": "兩母體比例檢定與差異區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "獨立兩組的問題", "html": "獨立兩組的問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "資料與近似條件", "html": "資料與近似條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "差異區間", "html": "差異區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "不能直接套配對資料", "html": "不能直接套配對資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "手算與程式", "html": "手算與程式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "40-two-variances", "group": "testing", "title": "兩母體變異數：F檢定與穩健替代", "summary": "保留變異比的正常性前提，不把預檢當方法選擇的唯一依據。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "two variances"], "example": "22_variance_comparison.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-7-f\">兩母體變異數：F檢定與穩健替代</h1>\n<p>保留變異比的正常性前提，不把預檢當方法選擇的唯一依據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">兩個母體的分散問題</h2>\n<p>H0:σA²=σB²，關心的是變動而非平均。兩組平均可以相同但分散不同，也可以平均不同而variance相同。先寫尺度與單位；若目標是相對變動，還需評估是否用CV或其他量數較貼合問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"f\">精確F程序</h2>\n<p>獨立常態下F=sA²/sB²，df=(nA−1,nB−1)。雙側等尾p為min(1,2min(CDF,SF))。這裡保留A/B方向，若要把較大者放分子，必須一併交換df與區間／尾向，不可以只換數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">對非正常敏感</h2>\n<p>F變異檢定對偏態與重尾敏感。Levene以觀察到中心的絕對偏差比較尺度；以中位數為中心常稱Brown–Forsythe形式，比傳統F對某些非正常情況較穩健。它們回答相關但不同程序的問題，並非一個p值的「新版」而已。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">不用預檢機械分流</h2>\n<p>若目標是兩平均比較，不能只看F或Levene未拒絕就宣稱等變異已證明，再決定pooled t。可直接用事先選定的Welch策略，並以資料與診斷支持。等變異檢定本身也有power，不顯著不等於相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">程式與驗收</h2>\n<p>第22例同時報normal-F p與median-centered Levene p，清楚保留兩種方法標籤。測試用[2,4,6]對[1,2,3]，前者恰為兩倍，variance比應為4，可獨立驗證尺度規則。共同函式拒絕零變異退化輸入，避免輸出沒有說明的無限比值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將A、B全部由公分換毫米，兩個variance各乘100，F比例不變。若只換A，則不再同單位比較，是資料錯誤。分析前的單位核對往往比多保留五位小數更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/22_variance_comparison.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 22_variance_comparison.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 兩母體變異數：F檢定與穩健替代 {#7-7-f}\n\n保留變異比的正常性前提，不把預檢當方法選擇的唯一依據。\n\n## 兩個母體的分散問題\n\nH0:σA²=σB²，關心的是變動而非平均。兩組平均可以相同但分散不同，也可以平均不同而variance相同。先寫尺度與單位；若目標是相對變動，還需評估是否用CV或其他量數較貼合問題。\n\n## 精確F程序\n\n獨立常態下F=sA²/sB²，df=(nA−1,nB−1)。雙側等尾p為min(1,2min(CDF,SF))。這裡保留A/B方向，若要把較大者放分子，必須一併交換df與區間／尾向，不可以只換數字。\n\n## 對非正常敏感\n\nF變異檢定對偏態與重尾敏感。Levene以觀察到中心的絕對偏差比較尺度；以中位數為中心常稱Brown–Forsythe形式，比傳統F對某些非正常情況較穩健。它們回答相關但不同程序的問題，並非一個p值的「新版」而已。\n\n## 不用預檢機械分流\n\n若目標是兩平均比較，不能只看F或Levene未拒絕就宣稱等變異已證明，再決定pooled t。可直接用事先選定的Welch策略，並以資料與診斷支持。等變異檢定本身也有power，不顯著不等於相等。\n\n## 程式與驗收\n\n第22例同時報normal-F p與median-centered Levene p，清楚保留兩種方法標籤。測試用[2,4,6]對[1,2,3]，前者恰為兩倍，variance比應為4，可獨立驗證尺度規則。共同函式拒絕零變異退化輸入，避免輸出沒有說明的無限比值。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將A、B全部由公分換毫米，兩個variance各乘100，F比例不變。若只換A，則不再同單位比較，是資料錯誤。分析前的單位核對往往比多保留五位小數更重要。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/22_variance_comparison.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 22_variance_comparison.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=variance_ratio([2,4,5,3,6,4],[1,7,2,8,3,9,4])\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-7-f", "name": "兩母體變異數：F檢定與穩健替代", "html": "兩母體變異數：F檢定與穩健替代", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "兩個母體的分散問題", "html": "兩個母體的分散問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "f", "name": "精確F程序", "html": "精確F程序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "對非正常敏感", "html": "對非正常敏感", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "不用預檢機械分流", "html": "不用預檢機械分流", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "程式與驗收", "html": "程式與驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "41-chi-square-tests", "group": "testing", "title": "卡方檢定：獨立性、齊一性與適合度", "summary": "相同統計量背後可能有不同抽樣設計與研究敘述。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "chi square tests"], "example": "23_chi_square.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"7-8\">卡方檢定：獨立性、齊一性與適合度</h1>\n<p>相同統計量背後可能有不同抽樣設計與研究敘述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-8-1\">獨立性檢定</h2>\n<p>同一個母體樣本對每單位觀察兩種分類，問兩分類是否獨立。r×c表H0下Eij=列和×欄和/n，χ²=Σ(O−E)²/E，df=(r−1)(c−1)。計算使用計數，不能拿列百分比直接代入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7-8-2\">齊一性檢定</h2>\n<p>從不同母體或處理組各抽獨立樣本，問類別分布是否相同。常使用同樣Pearson表格公式，但抽樣設計、固定邊際與文字解讀不同。不能因數字相同，就省略各組樣本如何取得。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nE_{ij}=\\frac{O_{i+}O_{+j}}n,\\qquad\n\\chi^2=\\sum_{i,j}\\frac{(O_{ij}-E_{ij})^2}{E_{ij}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"7-8-3\">適合度</h2>\n<p>單一類別分布與指定機率p1…pk比較，Ei=npi。若機率完全事前指定，df=k−1；若由同資料估參數，常需再扣有效估參數數目並注意適用條件。總期望需與總觀察相符，不可任意縮放到想要結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">近似、稀疏與效果</h2>\n<p>期望計數太小時卡方近似可能差，常見5的規則只是經驗檢查，不能看觀察數代替期望數。稀疏2×2可評估Fisher；其他表可用合適精確／模擬程序。Cramér V=√(χ²/(n min(r−1,c−1)))可描述關聯大小，但不表示因果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">實作細節</h2>\n<p>第23例明確<code>correction=False</code>，報Pearson原式，避免2×2預設Yates校正造成手算差異。另列Fisher稀疏例。適合度完整入口在附錄解答單元，以六類固定均勻期望示範，沒有估參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>3×2表df2。問：獨立性未拒絕是否證明完全獨立？不，樣本與power有限。問：χ²大是否說明哪格主導？可看標準化殘差等探索，但多格事後判讀要注意多重比較，不把挑中的最大格當事前假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/23_chi_square.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 23_chi_square.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fisher_sparse_2x2_p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fisher_exact</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pvalue</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section4/prc45.htm\">NIST交叉分類與獨立性</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 卡方檢定：獨立性、齊一性與適合度 {#7-8}\n\n相同統計量背後可能有不同抽樣設計與研究敘述。\n\n## 獨立性檢定 {#7-8-1}\n\n同一個母體樣本對每單位觀察兩種分類，問兩分類是否獨立。r×c表H0下Eij=列和×欄和/n，χ²=Σ(O−E)²/E，df=(r−1)(c−1)。計算使用計數，不能拿列百分比直接代入。\n\n## 齊一性檢定 {#7-8-2}\n\n從不同母體或處理組各抽獨立樣本，問類別分布是否相同。常使用同樣Pearson表格公式，但抽樣設計、固定邊際與文字解讀不同。不能因數字相同，就省略各組樣本如何取得。\n\n$$\nE_{ij}=\\frac{O_{i+}O_{+j}}n,\\qquad\n\\chi^2=\\sum_{i,j}\\frac{(O_{ij}-E_{ij})^2}{E_{ij}}\n$$\n\n## 適合度 {#7-8-3}\n\n單一類別分布與指定機率p1…pk比較，Ei=npi。若機率完全事前指定，df=k−1；若由同資料估參數，常需再扣有效估參數數目並注意適用條件。總期望需與總觀察相符，不可任意縮放到想要結果。\n\n## 近似、稀疏與效果\n\n期望計數太小時卡方近似可能差，常見5的規則只是經驗檢查，不能看觀察數代替期望數。稀疏2×2可評估Fisher；其他表可用合適精確／模擬程序。Cramér V=√(χ²/(n min(r−1,c−1)))可描述關聯大小，但不表示因果。\n\n## 實作細節\n\n第23例明確`correction=False`，報Pearson原式，避免2×2預設Yates校正造成手算差異。另列Fisher稀疏例。適合度完整入口在附錄解答單元，以六類固定均勻期望示範，沒有估參數。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n3×2表df2。問：獨立性未拒絕是否證明完全獨立？不，樣本與power有限。問：χ²大是否說明哪格主導？可看標準化殘差等探索，但多格事後判讀要注意多重比較，不把挑中的最大格當事前假設。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/23_chi_square.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 23_chi_square.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    table=[[30,20],[20,30],[25,25]]\n    result=contingency(table)\n    result['fisher_sparse_2x2_p']=stats.fisher_exact([[1,4],[6,1]]).pvalue\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST交叉分類與獨立性](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section4/prc45.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "7-8", "name": "卡方檢定：獨立性、齊一性與適合度", "html": "卡方檢定：獨立性、齊一性與適合度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "7-8-1", "name": "獨立性檢定", "html": "獨立性檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-8-2", "name": "齊一性檢定", "html": "齊一性檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "7-8-3", "name": "適合度", "html": "適合度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "近似、稀疏與效果", "html": "近似、稀疏與效果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "實作細節", "html": "實作細節", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "42-exercises-testing", "group": "testing", "title": "假設檢定習題詳解：方向、配對與結論", "summary": "練習把一句需求轉成正確程序，並保留效果與不確定性。", "tags": ["假設檢定", "exercises testing"], "example": "20_paired_test.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"07\">假設檢定習題詳解：方向、配對與結論</h1>\n<p>練習把一句需求轉成正確程序，並保留效果與不確定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"p\">題一：p值語意</h2>\n<p>p=.03、α=.05，結論是在H0與模型下資料較不相容，按此程序拒絕H0。不能說H0只有3%機率為真，也不能說結果有97%機率可重現。合理報告附估計差、CI、n與設計，避免一個閾值包辦解釋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題二：單雙側</h2>\n<p>事前問「是否不同」應雙側；看到平均上升後才改「是否較高」，已改原決策規則。若右側假設觀察t為負，右尾p應很大，不能拿雙側p除2就當有利方向的小p。解答要寫出實際拒絕區。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題三：獨立或成對</h2>\n<p>同六人前後分數，d=after−before，以差的平均和SD做單樣本t。配對能保留個人基準資訊，但若配對錯ID也會製造錯誤結果。下方第20例提供完整入口；第38例另示範打散後仍按ID合併。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題四：比例與變異</h2>\n<p>8/10對p0=.5，exact雙側p=.109375；沒有拒絕不代表p已知等於.5。兩組variation比較則需F或穩健尺度程序，不是把變異數當觀察平均再跑普通t。先確認要比較的參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題五：多重檢定</h2>\n<p>若20個獨立真H0各以.05檢定，至少一個誤拒機率1−.95²⁰≈.642。獨立只為此數值計算；Bonferroni的家族錯誤上界不需這個獨立假設。把只顯著的結果留下，會造成選擇性報告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題六：實質重要與等效</h2>\n<p>很大樣本使微小差可能顯著，仍需預設實質重要界值。未顯著的區間可能很寬，也可能涵蓋重要負面與正面差；不能因此說「效果為零」。等效／非劣性需事前界值與相應單雙側程序，原本一般差異檢定不能自動替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/20_paired_test.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 20_paired_test.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">62</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">65</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">61</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">59</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">68</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">63</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">66</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">67</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">65</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">72</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf\">ASA的p值聲明</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm\">NIST兩樣本t檢定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 假設檢定習題詳解：方向、配對與結論 {#07}\n\n練習把一句需求轉成正確程序，並保留效果與不確定性。\n\n## 題一：p值語意\n\np=.03、α=.05，結論是在H0與模型下資料較不相容，按此程序拒絕H0。不能說H0只有3%機率為真，也不能說結果有97%機率可重現。合理報告附估計差、CI、n與設計，避免一個閾值包辦解釋。\n\n## 題二：單雙側\n\n事前問「是否不同」應雙側；看到平均上升後才改「是否較高」，已改原決策規則。若右側假設觀察t為負，右尾p應很大，不能拿雙側p除2就當有利方向的小p。解答要寫出實際拒絕區。\n\n## 題三：獨立或成對\n\n同六人前後分數，d=after−before，以差的平均和SD做單樣本t。配對能保留個人基準資訊，但若配對錯ID也會製造錯誤結果。下方第20例提供完整入口；第38例另示範打散後仍按ID合併。\n\n## 題四：比例與變異\n\n8/10對p0=.5，exact雙側p=.109375；沒有拒絕不代表p已知等於.5。兩組variation比較則需F或穩健尺度程序，不是把變異數當觀察平均再跑普通t。先確認要比較的參數。\n\n## 題五：多重檢定\n\n若20個獨立真H0各以.05檢定，至少一個誤拒機率1−.95²⁰≈.642。獨立只為此數值計算；Bonferroni的家族錯誤上界不需這個獨立假設。把只顯著的結果留下，會造成選擇性報告。\n\n## 題六：實質重要與等效\n\n很大樣本使微小差可能顯著，仍需預設實質重要界值。未顯著的區間可能很寬，也可能涵蓋重要負面與正面差；不能因此說「效果為零」。等效／非劣性需事前界值與相應單雙側程序，原本一般差異檢定不能自動替代。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/20_paired_test.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 20_paired_test.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=paired([60,62,65,61,59,68],[63,66,67,65,60,72])\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [ASA的p值聲明](https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf)\n- [NIST兩樣本t檢定](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "07", "name": "假設檢定習題詳解：方向、配對與結論", "html": "假設檢定習題詳解：方向、配對與結論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "p", "name": "題一：p值語意", "html": "題一：p值語意", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題二：單雙側", "html": "題二：單雙側", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題三：獨立或成對", "html": "題三：獨立或成對", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題四：比例與變異", "html": "題四：比例與變異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題五：多重檢定", "html": "題五：多重檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題六：實質重要與等效", "html": "題六：實質重要與等效", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "43-anova-introduction", "group": "anova", "title": "變異數分析概論：用變異比較平均", "summary": "理解「分析變異」為何在檢定多組母體平均。", "tags": ["變異數分析", "anova introduction"], "html": "<h1 id=\"8-1\">變異數分析概論：用變異比較平均</h1>\n<p>理解「分析變異」為何在檢定多組母體平均。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">問題與虛無假設</h2>\n<p>比較k個母體平均，H0:μ1=…=μk，H1為至少一個不同。不是檢定所有variance相等，也不是H1要求每組都不同。以三種教學方案比較分數時，觀察單位、分組方式及分數尺度先決定推論與因果範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"t\">為何不一直跑t</h2>\n<p>k組有k(k−1)/2個兩兩比較，未調整地各以.05檢定會累積家族錯誤。ANOVA先提供整體平均相等的檢定，事後比較再使用合適校正；也可事前規劃特定contrast，不一定所有問題都需先看整體F才有意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">模型與變異拆解</h2>\n<p>單因子寫Yij=μ+αi+εij。組間平均差和組內變動共同決定F：若組間相對於組內很大，與共同平均模型較不相容。平方和再除自由度得到均方，所以不能直接拿組間SS除組內SS而稱F。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">傳統模型的前提</h2>\n<p>獨立誤差、各組常態及共同variance是傳統精確F程序的條件。獨立性主要來自設計，殘差圖不能證明。資料偏離時可比較Welch ANOVA、適合的穩健／非參數方法，但需理解估計目標和解釋是否改變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">隨機分派與隨機抽樣</h2>\n<p>隨機分派有助處理組間混淆以支持因果，隨機抽樣有助母體代表性，兩者不同。問卷中三類自選使用者的分數差，就算ANOVA顯著，也不能說類別造成差異。觀察研究仍有混淆與選擇問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>F顯著代表至少一個平均差，不代表A一定最好，也不告訴你實質差幾分。應報各組n、均值、分散、整體F／df／p、效果與區間，再做規劃的比較。把表中「Sig.」一欄截圖當整份報告，會丟掉方法判斷的重要資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">一個反例</h2>\n<p>三組平均都10，但SD為1、5、10，ANOVA的平均虛無假設仍可能成立；不等分散影響傳統F參照的適用性，卻不是同一個H0。反過來，三組SD都2、平均5、10、15，平均假設不成立但等分散可以成立。把估計目標和程序條件分開，才不會看到「變異數分析」四字就問錯問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 變異數分析概論：用變異比較平均 {#8-1}\n\n理解「分析變異」為何在檢定多組母體平均。\n\n## 問題與虛無假設\n\n比較k個母體平均，H0:μ1=…=μk，H1為至少一個不同。不是檢定所有variance相等，也不是H1要求每組都不同。以三種教學方案比較分數時，觀察單位、分組方式及分數尺度先決定推論與因果範圍。\n\n## 為何不一直跑t\n\nk組有k(k−1)/2個兩兩比較，未調整地各以.05檢定會累積家族錯誤。ANOVA先提供整體平均相等的檢定，事後比較再使用合適校正；也可事前規劃特定contrast，不一定所有問題都需先看整體F才有意義。\n\n## 模型與變異拆解\n\n單因子寫Yij=μ+αi+εij。組間平均差和組內變動共同決定F：若組間相對於組內很大，與共同平均模型較不相容。平方和再除自由度得到均方，所以不能直接拿組間SS除組內SS而稱F。\n\n## 傳統模型的前提\n\n獨立誤差、各組常態及共同variance是傳統精確F程序的條件。獨立性主要來自設計，殘差圖不能證明。資料偏離時可比較Welch ANOVA、適合的穩健／非參數方法，但需理解估計目標和解釋是否改變。\n\n## 隨機分派與隨機抽樣\n\n隨機分派有助處理組間混淆以支持因果，隨機抽樣有助母體代表性，兩者不同。問卷中三類自選使用者的分數差，就算ANOVA顯著，也不能說類別造成差異。觀察研究仍有混淆與選擇問題。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nF顯著代表至少一個平均差，不代表A一定最好，也不告訴你實質差幾分。應報各組n、均值、分散、整體F／df／p、效果與區間，再做規劃的比較。把表中「Sig.」一欄截圖當整份報告，會丟掉方法判斷的重要資訊。\n\n## 一個反例\n\n三組平均都10，但SD為1、5、10，ANOVA的平均虛無假設仍可能成立；不等分散影響傳統F參照的適用性，卻不是同一個H0。反過來，三組SD都2、平均5、10、15，平均假設不成立但等分散可以成立。把估計目標和程序條件分開，才不會看到「變異數分析」四字就問錯問題。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "8-1", "name": "變異數分析概論：用變異比較平均", "html": "變異數分析概論：用變異比較平均", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "問題與虛無假設", "html": "問題與虛無假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "t", "name": "為何不一直跑t", "html": "為何不一直跑t", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "模型與變異拆解", "html": "模型與變異拆解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "傳統模型的前提", "html": "傳統模型的前提", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "隨機分派與隨機抽樣", "html": "隨機分派與隨機抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "一個反例", "html": "一個反例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "44-one-way-anova", "group": "anova", "title": "單因子ANOVA：平方和、自由度與Welch", "summary": "以一組可手算資料核對F，再比較不同variance假設。", "tags": ["變異數分析", "one way anova"], "example": "25_anova.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"8-2-anovawelch\">單因子ANOVA：平方和、自由度與Welch</h1>\n<p>以一組可手算資料核對F，再比較不同variance假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">傳統平方和</h2>\n<p>總平方和SST=Σij(yij−總平均)²；組間SSB=Σi ni(組平均−總平均)²；組內SSW=Σij(yij−組平均)²，SST=SSB+SSW。自由度依序N−1、k−1、N−k。這個描述拆解成立不代表每種F參照都適用。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nF=\\frac{SSB/(k-1)}{SSW/(N-k)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">一組完整手算</h2>\n<p>三組[1,2,3]、[3,4,5]、[5,6,7]，組平均2、4、6，總平均4。SSB=3×4+0+3×4=24，SSW=2+2+2=6；df=(2,6)，MSB12、MSW1、F12。效果η²=24/30=.8，只描述這組資料的組間比例，不能當因果解釋80%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"welch-anova\">Welch ANOVA</h2>\n<p>不假設共同variance，依各組精度加權並調整參照自由度。SciPy1.18.1可用f_oneway(...,equal_var=False)，不能只保留預設True卻在文字說已處理不等變異。其F不是上面簡單MSB/MSW，不應把Welch F塞入傳統η²捷徑公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">效果與診斷</h2>\n<p>報各組原始單位差、分布與合適區間。η²有樣本偏差，ω²是另一種修正效果量，使用時列定義與是否截負值；本課核心明確只報描述η²。檢查殘差、離群、組內樣本數及variance關係，不以單一Levene p作唯一選擇開關。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實作邊界</h2>\n<p>第25例同時計算傳統與Welch，並保留傳統SS描述。測試使用上面的手算資料，另檢查兩組等變異ANOVA有F=t²關係。這是已知值驗算，不把某一合成例的p大小當方法在真實問題中必然較佳的證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若所有觀察加10，SS和F都不變；若乘2，所有SS乘4，F仍不變。均值與SD則相應變換。用這些關係可檢查單位是否一致。若每人都做三種方案，資料為重複量測，這裡的獨立組ANOVA就不是直接合適的程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/25_anova.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 25_anova.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;classical&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;welch&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">equal_var</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 單因子ANOVA：平方和、自由度與Welch {#8-2-anovawelch}\n\n以一組可手算資料核對F，再比較不同variance假設。\n\n## 傳統平方和\n\n總平方和SST=Σij(yij−總平均)²；組間SSB=Σi ni(組平均−總平均)²；組內SSW=Σij(yij−組平均)²，SST=SSB+SSW。自由度依序N−1、k−1、N−k。這個描述拆解成立不代表每種F參照都適用。\n\n$$\nF=\\frac{SSB/(k-1)}{SSW/(N-k)}\n$$\n\n## 一組完整手算\n\n三組[1,2,3]、[3,4,5]、[5,6,7]，組平均2、4、6，總平均4。SSB=3×4+0+3×4=24，SSW=2+2+2=6；df=(2,6)，MSB12、MSW1、F12。效果η²=24/30=.8，只描述這組資料的組間比例，不能當因果解釋80%。\n\n## Welch ANOVA\n\n不假設共同variance，依各組精度加權並調整參照自由度。SciPy1.18.1可用f_oneway(...,equal_var=False)，不能只保留預設True卻在文字說已處理不等變異。其F不是上面簡單MSB/MSW，不應把Welch F塞入傳統η²捷徑公式。\n\n## 效果與診斷\n\n報各組原始單位差、分布與合適區間。η²有樣本偏差，ω²是另一種修正效果量，使用時列定義與是否截負值；本課核心明確只報描述η²。檢查殘差、離群、組內樣本數及variance關係，不以單一Levene p作唯一選擇開關。\n\n## 實作邊界\n\n第25例同時計算傳統與Welch，並保留傳統SS描述。測試使用上面的手算資料，另檢查兩組等變異ANOVA有F=t²關係。這是已知值驗算，不把某一合成例的p大小當方法在真實問題中必然較佳的證據。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若所有觀察加10，SS和F都不變；若乘2，所有SS乘4，F仍不變。均值與SD則相應變換。用這些關係可檢查單位是否一致。若每人都做三種方案，資料為重複量測，這裡的獨立組ANOVA就不是直接合適的程序。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/25_anova.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 25_anova.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    groups=[[3,4,5,4],[5,6,7,6],[7,8,9,8]]\n    result={'classical':one_way(groups),'welch':one_way(groups,equal_var=False)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "8-2-anovawelch", "name": "單因子ANOVA：平方和、自由度與Welch", "html": "單因子ANOVA：平方和、自由度與Welch", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "傳統平方和", "html": "傳統平方和", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "一組完整手算", "html": "一組完整手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "welch-anova", "name": "Welch ANOVA", "html": "Welch ANOVA", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "效果與診斷", "html": "效果與診斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實作邊界", "html": "實作邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "45-multiple-comparisons", "group": "anova", "title": "多重比較：Tukey、Games–Howell與Holm", "summary": "先定比較家族，再選與模型相符的差異、區間及調整p。", "tags": ["變異數分析", "multiple comparisons"], "example": "26_posthoc.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"8-3-tukeygameshowellholm\">多重比較：Tukey、Games–Howell與Holm</h1>\n<p>先定比較家族，再選與模型相符的差異、區間及調整p。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">比較家族是什麼</h2>\n<p>三組全部兩兩比較有3項，四組有6項。若只關心A對控制組C，研究問題也許只需要兩項，而不是所有組合。事前contrast與事後探索應區分；不能事後只把顯著那對當成唯一研究問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tukey-hsd\">Tukey HSD</h2>\n<p>傳統共同variance模型下，Tukey以studentized range處理全部兩兩比較，提供家族層次的調整p及同時區間；不等樣本數時常稱Tukey–Kramer延伸。不能把普通t的未調整CI貼到Tukey p旁邊而不說明差別。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gameshowell\">Games–Howell</h2>\n<p>適合不同variance與樣本數的兩兩平均比較，以各對SE與近似自由度處理。statsmodels0.15提供pairwise_tukeyhsd(...,use_var='unequal')；參數名雖仍是tukeyhsd，結果方法已改，教材與報表要明確標Games–Howell。</p>\n<h2 id=\"holm\">Holm與其他控制</h2>\n<p>Holm逐步控制家族型I錯誤，不要求檢定相互獨立；Bonferroni簡單但可能保守。Benjamini–Hochberg則控制不同目標FDR，在其適用條件下使用，不能和FWER當同一承諾。本課用[.01,.03,.20]示範Holm調整為[.03,.06,.20]。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">差異方向與報告</h2>\n<p>第26例statsmodels兩兩差定義為第二組−第一組，與前面Welch的A−B方向不同，程式已標示。讀CI若全正，代表第二組較高；反向報告就需同時改差及區間符號。不要只依組名排列猜方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>三組平均4、6、8，程式依G1、G2、G3排列差為2、4、2。若整體ANOVA未顯著是否能隨意到處搜尋？不能；事前規劃contrast和事後全部比較有不同程序。任何做法都需預先定義或清楚標探索，並處理家族錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/26_posthoc.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 26_posthoc.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tukey&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;games_howell&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">use_var</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;unequal&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;holm_example&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">multipletests</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.01</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.03</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;holm&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html\">Tukey與Games–Howell介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 多重比較：Tukey、Games–Howell與Holm {#8-3-tukeygameshowellholm}\n\n先定比較家族，再選與模型相符的差異、區間及調整p。\n\n## 比較家族是什麼\n\n三組全部兩兩比較有3項，四組有6項。若只關心A對控制組C，研究問題也許只需要兩項，而不是所有組合。事前contrast與事後探索應區分；不能事後只把顯著那對當成唯一研究問題。\n\n## Tukey HSD\n\n傳統共同variance模型下，Tukey以studentized range處理全部兩兩比較，提供家族層次的調整p及同時區間；不等樣本數時常稱Tukey–Kramer延伸。不能把普通t的未調整CI貼到Tukey p旁邊而不說明差別。\n\n## Games–Howell\n\n適合不同variance與樣本數的兩兩平均比較，以各對SE與近似自由度處理。statsmodels0.15提供pairwise_tukeyhsd(...,use_var='unequal')；參數名雖仍是tukeyhsd，結果方法已改，教材與報表要明確標Games–Howell。\n\n## Holm與其他控制\n\nHolm逐步控制家族型I錯誤，不要求檢定相互獨立；Bonferroni簡單但可能保守。Benjamini–Hochberg則控制不同目標FDR，在其適用條件下使用，不能和FWER當同一承諾。本課用[.01,.03,.20]示範Holm調整為[.03,.06,.20]。\n\n## 差異方向與報告\n\n第26例statsmodels兩兩差定義為第二組−第一組，與前面Welch的A−B方向不同，程式已標示。讀CI若全正，代表第二組較高；反向報告就需同時改差及區間符號。不要只依組名排列猜方向。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n三組平均4、6、8，程式依G1、G2、G3排列差為2、4、2。若整體ANOVA未顯著是否能隨意到處搜尋？不能；事前規劃contrast和事後全部比較有不同程序。任何做法都需預先定義或清楚標探索，並處理家族錯誤。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/26_posthoc.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 26_posthoc.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    groups=[[3,4,5,4],[5,6,7,6],[7,8,9,8]]\n    result={'tukey':posthoc(groups),'games_howell':posthoc(groups,use_var='unequal'),'holm_example':multipletests([.01,.03,.2],method='holm')[1]}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [Tukey與Games–Howell介面](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "8-3-tukeygameshowellholm", "name": "多重比較：Tukey、Games–Howell與Holm", "html": "多重比較：Tukey、Games–Howell與Holm", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "比較家族是什麼", "html": "比較家族是什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "tukey-hsd", "name": "Tukey HSD", "html": "Tukey HSD", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "gameshowell", "name": "Games–Howell", "html": "Games–Howell", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "holm", "name": "Holm與其他控制", "html": "Holm與其他控制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "差異方向與報告", "html": "差異方向與報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "46-two-factor-additive", "group": "anova", "title": "二因子無交互作用模型：加法效果", "summary": "區分模型沒有交互項與實驗沒有重複，避免將兩件事混淆。", "tags": ["變異數分析", "two factor additive"], "example": "27_two_factor_additive.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"8-4\">二因子無交互作用模型：加法效果</h1>\n<p>區分模型沒有交互項與實驗沒有重複，避免將兩件事混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">兩個因子的問題</h2>\n<p>例如訓練方式A有2水準，操作情境B有3水準，觀察連續結果Y。無交互作用加法模型假設A的效果不隨B改變，寫Yijk=μ+αi+βj+εijk。主效果是相對於指定條件與加權方式的平均差，不是任何情境都必然相同的現實真理。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nY_{ijk}=\\mu+\\alpha_i+\\beta_j+\\epsilon_{ijk}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">識別與自由度</h2>\n<p>需設定參照組或和為零等限制避免參數重複。平衡a×b、每格r次，N=abr；加法模型參數1+(a−1)+(b−1)=a+b−1，residual df=N−a−b+1。若含交互項，參數和df會不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">無交互作用不等於無重複</h2>\n<p>每格只有一筆時，完整含交互模型會飽和，沒有獨立的cell內誤差可估；若強制無交互，剩餘變動常混合交互與誤差。它是一個額外假設，不是資料已證明沒有交互。要辨認交互，規劃每格重複非常重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">本課的實際例子</h2>\n<p>第27例2×3、每格8筆，共48筆，資料生成器此例不加交互項，擬合y~C(A)+C(B)。residual df=44，Type II ANOVA表列A、B與Residual。第28例另生成有交互的資料，兩個例子機制不同，不能把數字直接當同一份資料的巢狀比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">不平衡與平方和類型</h2>\n<p>Type I依進入順序、Type II與Type III有各自假設及檢定目標，尤其含交互及不平衡時不可互換解讀。本課主例平衡，仍明確寫Type II；若改資料缺格或不等n，先確認可估性、coding及真正想問的主效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>2×3、N48，加法residual df44；如果加入2個交互自由度，residual df42。觀察線圖大致平行可作線索，但未拒絕交互不等於已證明加法，還需power、設計與領域知識。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/27_two_factor_additive.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 27_two_factor_additive.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">interaction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 二因子無交互作用模型：加法效果 {#8-4}\n\n區分模型沒有交互項與實驗沒有重複，避免將兩件事混淆。\n\n## 兩個因子的問題\n\n例如訓練方式A有2水準，操作情境B有3水準，觀察連續結果Y。無交互作用加法模型假設A的效果不隨B改變，寫Yijk=μ+αi+βj+εijk。主效果是相對於指定條件與加權方式的平均差，不是任何情境都必然相同的現實真理。\n\n$$\nY_{ijk}=\\mu+\\alpha_i+\\beta_j+\\epsilon_{ijk}\n$$\n\n## 識別與自由度\n\n需設定參照組或和為零等限制避免參數重複。平衡a×b、每格r次，N=abr；加法模型參數1+(a−1)+(b−1)=a+b−1，residual df=N−a−b+1。若含交互項，參數和df會不同。\n\n## 無交互作用不等於無重複\n\n每格只有一筆時，完整含交互模型會飽和，沒有獨立的cell內誤差可估；若強制無交互，剩餘變動常混合交互與誤差。它是一個額外假設，不是資料已證明沒有交互。要辨認交互，規劃每格重複非常重要。\n\n## 本課的實際例子\n\n第27例2×3、每格8筆，共48筆，資料生成器此例不加交互項，擬合y~C(A)+C(B)。residual df=44，Type II ANOVA表列A、B與Residual。第28例另生成有交互的資料，兩個例子機制不同，不能把數字直接當同一份資料的巢狀比較。\n\n## 不平衡與平方和類型\n\nType I依進入順序、Type II與Type III有各自假設及檢定目標，尤其含交互及不平衡時不可互換解讀。本課主例平衡，仍明確寫Type II；若改資料缺格或不等n，先確認可估性、coding及真正想問的主效果。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n2×3、N48，加法residual df44；如果加入2個交互自由度，residual df42。觀察線圖大致平行可作線索，但未拒絕交互不等於已證明加法，還需power、設計與領域知識。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/27_two_factor_additive.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 27_two_factor_additive.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=factorial(interaction=False)\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "8-4", "name": "二因子無交互作用模型：加法效果", "html": "二因子無交互作用模型：加法效果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "兩個因子的問題", "html": "兩個因子的問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "識別與自由度", "html": "識別與自由度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "無交互作用不等於無重複", "html": "無交互作用不等於無重複", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "本課的實際例子", "html": "本課的實際例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "不平衡與平方和類型", "html": "不平衡與平方和類型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "47-two-factor-interaction", "group": "anova", "title": "二因子含交互作用：效果依情境改變", "summary": "用差異之差和簡單效果理解交互，而不只讀一個星號。", "tags": ["變異數分析", "two factor interaction"], "example": "28_two_factor_interaction.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"8-5\">二因子含交互作用：效果依情境改變</h1>\n<p>用差異之差和簡單效果理解交互，而不只讀一個星號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">完整模型</h2>\n<p>Yijk=μ+αi+βj+(αβ)ij+εijk。交互作用表示A對結果的差異隨B水準改變；它不是「A和B彼此相關」的同義詞，因子即使隨機獨立分派也可能對結果有交互作用。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nY_{ijk}=\\mu+\\alpha_i+\\beta_j+(\\alpha\\beta)_{ij}+\\epsilon_{ijk}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"22\">2×2的差異之差</h2>\n<p>若B0下A1−A0=2，B1下A1−A0=6，差異之差4代表在此單位與模型下的交互。若改用log尺度，交互定義也會改；「存在交互」必須連同尺度說明。線圖不平行是視覺線索，需配合樣本不確定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"23\">本課2×3生成例</h2>\n<p>第28例A1有基礎+3，B1與B2有+2、+4，另在A1且B2加4，再疊normal noise。每格8次，完整模型y~C(A)*C(B)包含主效果和交互，residual df42。可以按B分開看A的簡單效果，不只報一個跨B平均。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">檢定與後續比較</h2>\n<p>交互df=(a−1)(b−1)。如果交互有實質意義，先解釋條件效果與CI，再慎重解讀平均主效果。多個簡單效果也形成比較家族，要預先規劃調整，不因每個都是「一個t」就忽略多重性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">設計與診斷</h2>\n<p>每格要有足夠樣本與合理獨立誤差，檢查殘差、variance及缺格。不平衡資料下Type II主效果並不自動回答含交互情境中的所有問題；可改用清楚定義的contrast／邊際平均並交代coding。本課只以平衡小例建立機制，不將其當萬用分析器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>如果A在B0有正效、B1有負效，合併主效果接近0，能否說A沒有用？不能，平均可能掩蓋方向相反的條件效果。反之，兩條線沒有交叉但不平行也可以有交互，不必一定出現交叉點。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/28_two_factor_interaction.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 28_two_factor_interaction.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">interaction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 二因子含交互作用：效果依情境改變 {#8-5}\n\n用差異之差和簡單效果理解交互，而不只讀一個星號。\n\n## 完整模型\n\nYijk=μ+αi+βj+(αβ)ij+εijk。交互作用表示A對結果的差異隨B水準改變；它不是「A和B彼此相關」的同義詞，因子即使隨機獨立分派也可能對結果有交互作用。\n\n$$\nY_{ijk}=\\mu+\\alpha_i+\\beta_j+(\\alpha\\beta)_{ij}+\\epsilon_{ijk}\n$$\n\n## 2×2的差異之差\n\n若B0下A1−A0=2，B1下A1−A0=6，差異之差4代表在此單位與模型下的交互。若改用log尺度，交互定義也會改；「存在交互」必須連同尺度說明。線圖不平行是視覺線索，需配合樣本不確定性。\n\n## 本課2×3生成例\n\n第28例A1有基礎+3，B1與B2有+2、+4，另在A1且B2加4，再疊normal noise。每格8次，完整模型y~C(A)*C(B)包含主效果和交互，residual df42。可以按B分開看A的簡單效果，不只報一個跨B平均。\n\n## 檢定與後續比較\n\n交互df=(a−1)(b−1)。如果交互有實質意義，先解釋條件效果與CI，再慎重解讀平均主效果。多個簡單效果也形成比較家族，要預先規劃調整，不因每個都是「一個t」就忽略多重性。\n\n## 設計與診斷\n\n每格要有足夠樣本與合理獨立誤差，檢查殘差、variance及缺格。不平衡資料下Type II主效果並不自動回答含交互情境中的所有問題；可改用清楚定義的contrast／邊際平均並交代coding。本課只以平衡小例建立機制，不將其當萬用分析器。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n如果A在B0有正效、B1有負效，合併主效果接近0，能否說A沒有用？不能，平均可能掩蓋方向相反的條件效果。反之，兩條線沒有交叉但不平行也可以有交互，不必一定出現交叉點。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/28_two_factor_interaction.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 28_two_factor_interaction.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=factorial(interaction=True)\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "8-5", "name": "二因子含交互作用：效果依情境改變", "html": "二因子含交互作用：效果依情境改變", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "完整模型", "html": "完整模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "22", "name": "2×2的差異之差", "html": "2×2的差異之差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "23", "name": "本課2×3生成例", "html": "本課2×3生成例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "檢定與後續比較", "html": "檢定與後續比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "設計與診斷", "html": "設計與診斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "48-exercises-anova", "group": "anova", "title": "ANOVA習題詳解：從平方和到條件效果", "summary": "核對每個自由度、比較方向與實際研究結論。", "tags": ["變異數分析", "exercises anova"], "html": "<h1 id=\"08-anova\">ANOVA習題詳解：從平方和到條件效果</h1>\n<p>核對每個自由度、比較方向與實際研究結論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：一因子手算</h2>\n<p>三組[1,2,3]、[3,4,5]、[5,6,7]，SSB24、SSW6、SST30，df分別2、6、8，F=(24/2)/(6/6)=12。若有人直接24/6=4，漏了均方自由度。η²=.8描述資料分解，不表示因果解釋比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：不等變異</h2>\n<p>三組n很不平衡且SD不同，是否只因總N大便用共同variance ANOVA？答：不能；可事前選Welch並搭配Games–Howell，檢查資料與模型。Levene未拒絕也不是共同variance成立的證明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：兩兩比較數</h2>\n<p>四組全部兩兩比較6對；若想控制家族錯誤，不能六次都用未調整.05後仍宣稱整體5%。Holm、Tukey或其他方法依家族與前提選擇。單一事前contrast回答不同問題，需保留事前規劃紀錄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：二因子自由度</h2>\n<p>2×3、每格8筆，N48。A df1、B df2、交互df2、residual42，合計47=N−1。加法模型未估交互，residual44。無重複設計與無交互模型不是同義，需另說假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題五：交互作用</h2>\n<p>B0下A效果+2、B1下−2，平均可為0。答案應報兩個簡單效果及其不確定性，不能只說A完全沒效果。若兩情境樣本比例不同，平均主效果還會依加權改變，必須明確定義目標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">題六：報告驗收</h2>\n<p>一份合格報告包含設計、有效n、各組摘要、模型、SS類型、F／df／p、預定比較、效果及限制。若資料是自選組別，結論寫關聯而非自動寫因果。將p值替換成星號雖方便排版，不能因此省掉實際差異與區間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">延伸題：兩組關係</h2>\n<p>在相同資料、共同variance、含兩組的傳統模型下，F=t²；但Welch多組或不同處理政策不能直接沿用這個簡化。若軟體結果不一致，先核對是否同組資料、同缺失政策、同等變異假設與同雙側問題，再查數值誤差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html\">Tukey與Games–Howell介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# ANOVA習題詳解：從平方和到條件效果 {#08-anova}\n\n核對每個自由度、比較方向與實際研究結論。\n\n## 題一：一因子手算\n\n三組[1,2,3]、[3,4,5]、[5,6,7]，SSB24、SSW6、SST30，df分別2、6、8，F=(24/2)/(6/6)=12。若有人直接24/6=4，漏了均方自由度。η²=.8描述資料分解，不表示因果解釋比例。\n\n## 題二：不等變異\n\n三組n很不平衡且SD不同，是否只因總N大便用共同variance ANOVA？答：不能；可事前選Welch並搭配Games–Howell，檢查資料與模型。Levene未拒絕也不是共同variance成立的證明。\n\n## 題三：兩兩比較數\n\n四組全部兩兩比較6對；若想控制家族錯誤，不能六次都用未調整.05後仍宣稱整體5%。Holm、Tukey或其他方法依家族與前提選擇。單一事前contrast回答不同問題，需保留事前規劃紀錄。\n\n## 題四：二因子自由度\n\n2×3、每格8筆，N48。A df1、B df2、交互df2、residual42，合計47=N−1。加法模型未估交互，residual44。無重複設計與無交互模型不是同義，需另說假設。\n\n## 題五：交互作用\n\nB0下A效果+2、B1下−2，平均可為0。答案應報兩個簡單效果及其不確定性，不能只說A完全沒效果。若兩情境樣本比例不同，平均主效果還會依加權改變，必須明確定義目標。\n\n## 題六：報告驗收\n\n一份合格報告包含設計、有效n、各組摘要、模型、SS類型、F／df／p、預定比較、效果及限制。若資料是自選組別，結論寫關聯而非自動寫因果。將p值替換成星號雖方便排版，不能因此省掉實際差異與區間。\n\n## 延伸題：兩組關係\n\n在相同資料、共同variance、含兩組的傳統模型下，F=t²；但Welch多組或不同處理政策不能直接沿用這個簡化。若軟體結果不一致，先核對是否同組資料、同缺失政策、同等變異假設與同雙側問題，再查數值誤差。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [Tukey與Games–Howell介面](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "08-anova", "name": "ANOVA習題詳解：從平方和到條件效果", "html": "ANOVA習題詳解：從平方和到條件效果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：一因子手算", "html": "題一：一因子手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：不等變異", "html": "題二：不等變異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：兩兩比較數", "html": "題三：兩兩比較數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：二因子自由度", "html": "題四：二因子自由度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題五：交互作用", "html": "題五：交互作用", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "題六：報告驗收", "html": "題六：報告驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "延伸題：兩組關係", "html": "延伸題：兩組關係", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "49-correlation", "group": "regression", "title": "概論及相關分析：Pearson與Spearman", "summary": "看圖、尺度與配對來源，再量化關聯；相關不等於因果。", "tags": ["相關與迴歸分析", "correlation"], "example": "29_correlation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"9-1-pearsonspearman\">概論及相關分析：Pearson與Spearman</h1>\n<p>看圖、尺度與配對來源，再量化關聯；相關不等於因果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">成對觀察與散布圖</h2>\n<p>每個單位需有(xi,yi)一對，不能把兩欄各自排序後再相關。先畫散布、檢查線性、非線性、群組與極端點。單一係數可掩蓋曲線或分群，也可能被少數高槓桿點主導。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pearson\">Pearson相關</h2>\n<p>r=Σ(x−x̄)(y−ȳ)/√(Σ(x−x̄)²Σ(y−ȳ)²)，介於−1與1，衡量線性關聯。任一變數常數時分母0，不可定義。對正線性尺度變換不變，乘負數會翻符號；樣本r=0不代表所有形式的獨立。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nr=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)(y_i-\\bar y)}{\\sqrt{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2\\sum_i(y_i-\\bar y)^2}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"spearman\">Spearman等級相關</h2>\n<p>先轉秩再求相關，衡量單調關係，對某些極端值與非線性單調關係有不同敏感度；相同值需處理並列秩。它不是任何非正常資料的自動萬用解，也不表示原始尺度上每增1單位有固定變化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">推論與因果</h2>\n<p>Pearson精確小樣本推論通常依iid二元常態模型；一般資料可需漸近或合適重抽。顯著相關不證明方向、沒有混淆或因果。冰品與用電同時上升可能共同受溫度影響；模型中加入變數也不能無條件消除全部混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">實際程式</h2>\n<p>第29例固定合成資料計Pearson和Spearman，保留係數與p。下一節再用同一資料估線性斜率與原始單位。r沒有單位，斜率有y/x單位，兩者用途不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：r=.8是否表示x能因果解釋y的80%？不能。簡單含截距OLS的R²=r²=.64，是該模型資料擬合的平方和比例，仍非因果。若樣本包含兩個來源群組，也需檢查分組後關聯，避免合併造成反向關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/29_correlation.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 29_correlation.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">pearson</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pearsonr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">spearman</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">spearmanr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pearson_r&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">pearson</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">statistic</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pearson_p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">pearson</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pvalue</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;spearman_r&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">spearman</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">statistic</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;spearman_p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">spearman</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pvalue</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;interpretation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;association in synthetic data, not causality&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 概論及相關分析：Pearson與Spearman {#9-1-pearsonspearman}\n\n看圖、尺度與配對來源，再量化關聯；相關不等於因果。\n\n## 成對觀察與散布圖\n\n每個單位需有(xi,yi)一對，不能把兩欄各自排序後再相關。先畫散布、檢查線性、非線性、群組與極端點。單一係數可掩蓋曲線或分群，也可能被少數高槓桿點主導。\n\n## Pearson相關\n\nr=Σ(x−x̄)(y−ȳ)/√(Σ(x−x̄)²Σ(y−ȳ)²)，介於−1與1，衡量線性關聯。任一變數常數時分母0，不可定義。對正線性尺度變換不變，乘負數會翻符號；樣本r=0不代表所有形式的獨立。\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)(y_i-\\bar y)}{\\sqrt{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2\\sum_i(y_i-\\bar y)^2}}\n$$\n\n## Spearman等級相關\n\n先轉秩再求相關，衡量單調關係，對某些極端值與非線性單調關係有不同敏感度；相同值需處理並列秩。它不是任何非正常資料的自動萬用解，也不表示原始尺度上每增1單位有固定變化。\n\n## 推論與因果\n\nPearson精確小樣本推論通常依iid二元常態模型；一般資料可需漸近或合適重抽。顯著相關不證明方向、沒有混淆或因果。冰品與用電同時上升可能共同受溫度影響；模型中加入變數也不能無條件消除全部混淆。\n\n## 實際程式\n\n第29例固定合成資料計Pearson和Spearman，保留係數與p。下一節再用同一資料估線性斜率與原始單位。r沒有單位，斜率有y/x單位，兩者用途不同。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：r=.8是否表示x能因果解釋y的80%？不能。簡單含截距OLS的R²=r²=.64，是該模型資料擬合的平方和比例，仍非因果。若樣本包含兩個來源群組，也需檢查分組後關聯，避免合併造成反向關係。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/29_correlation.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 29_correlation.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    x,y=regression_data();pearson=stats.pearsonr(x,y);spearman=stats.spearmanr(x,y)\n    result={'pearson_r':pearson.statistic,'pearson_p':pearson.pvalue,'spearman_r':spearman.statistic,'spearman_p':spearman.pvalue,'interpretation':'association in synthetic data, not causality'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "9-1-pearsonspearman", "name": "概論及相關分析：Pearson與Spearman", "html": "概論及相關分析：Pearson與Spearman", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "成對觀察與散布圖", "html": "成對觀察與散布圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pearson", "name": "Pearson相關", "html": "Pearson相關", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "spearman", "name": "Spearman等級相關", "html": "Spearman等級相關", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "推論與因果", "html": "推論與因果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "實際程式", "html": "實際程式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "50-linear-regression", "group": "regression", "title": "直線迴歸模式：係數、最小平方與殘差", "summary": "把一條擬合線變成明確的條件平均模型。", "tags": ["相關與迴歸分析", "linear regression"], "example": "30_regression.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"9-2\">直線迴歸模式：係數、最小平方與殘差</h1>\n<p>把一條擬合線變成明確的條件平均模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">模型不是每筆都落在線上</h2>\n<p>Y=β0+β1X+ε，核心假設是條件平均E(ε|X)=0，代表E(Y|X)=β0+β1X。X在此可視為固定設計或條件化觀察，預測誤差仍有變動。截距是X=0的平均，若0在資料外，可能只有代數意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">最小平方解</h2>\n<p>選b0、b1最小化Σ(yi−b0−b1xi)²；只要X有變動，b1=Sxy/Sxx、b0=ȳ−b1x̄。含截距時殘差和約0、殘差與X的內積約0。這些是擬合代數性質，不等於誤差確實獨立或因果無混淆。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nb_1=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)(y_i-\\bar y)}{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2},\n\\qquad b_0=\\bar y-b_1\\bar x\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">擬合與解釋</h2>\n<p>斜率表示模型中X每增1單位，Y條件平均改b1單位；它不自動表示施加干預的效果。R²=1−SSE/SST，含截距的樣本內OLS通常在0到1，不能推廣到所有外部預測或無截距模型。高R²也不代表模型假設、外推或因果正確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">殘差與誤差</h2>\n<p>ε是未知真模型偏差，e是擬合後殘差，二者不同。殘差圖看曲線、漏斗、群聚與特殊點；對Y做迴歸需要檢查誤差條件，不是要求X和Y各自都正常。將輸出標準化也不會自動修復非線性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">實作與已知值</h2>\n<p>第30例使用statsmodels OLS，明確加入截距、拒絕缺失與常數X，回係數、R²、推論與預測。測試另用設計好的x和正交殘差，能手算得到截距1、斜率2與R²=20/27，避免只對照同一套軟體。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若X從公尺換公分，斜率數值除100、預測不變；若Y乘100，斜率截距都乘100。原始範圍1到20卻預測X=100，是外推，不能只因公式能算就聲稱可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/30_regression.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 30_regression.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 直線迴歸模式：係數、最小平方與殘差 {#9-2}\n\n把一條擬合線變成明確的條件平均模型。\n\n## 模型不是每筆都落在線上\n\nY=β0+β1X+ε，核心假設是條件平均E(ε|X)=0，代表E(Y|X)=β0+β1X。X在此可視為固定設計或條件化觀察，預測誤差仍有變動。截距是X=0的平均，若0在資料外，可能只有代數意義。\n\n## 最小平方解\n\n選b0、b1最小化Σ(yi−b0−b1xi)²；只要X有變動，b1=Sxy/Sxx、b0=ȳ−b1x̄。含截距時殘差和約0、殘差與X的內積約0。這些是擬合代數性質，不等於誤差確實獨立或因果無混淆。\n\n$$\nb_1=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)(y_i-\\bar y)}{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2},\n\\qquad b_0=\\bar y-b_1\\bar x\n$$\n\n## 擬合與解釋\n\n斜率表示模型中X每增1單位，Y條件平均改b1單位；它不自動表示施加干預的效果。R²=1−SSE/SST，含截距的樣本內OLS通常在0到1，不能推廣到所有外部預測或無截距模型。高R²也不代表模型假設、外推或因果正確。\n\n## 殘差與誤差\n\nε是未知真模型偏差，e是擬合後殘差，二者不同。殘差圖看曲線、漏斗、群聚與特殊點；對Y做迴歸需要檢查誤差條件，不是要求X和Y各自都正常。將輸出標準化也不會自動修復非線性。\n\n## 實作與已知值\n\n第30例使用statsmodels OLS，明確加入截距、拒絕缺失與常數X，回係數、R²、推論與預測。測試另用設計好的x和正交殘差，能手算得到截距1、斜率2與R²=20/27，避免只對照同一套軟體。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若X從公尺換公分，斜率數值除100、預測不變；若Y乘100，斜率截距都乘100。原始範圍1到20卻預測X=100，是外推，不能只因公式能算就聲稱可靠。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/30_regression.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 30_regression.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    result=regression()\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "9-2", "name": "直線迴歸模式：係數、最小平方與殘差", "html": "直線迴歸模式：係數、最小平方與殘差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "模型不是每筆都落在線上", "html": "模型不是每筆都落在線上", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "最小平方解", "html": "最小平方解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "擬合與解釋", "html": "擬合與解釋", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "殘差與誤差", "html": "殘差與誤差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "實作與已知值", "html": "實作與已知值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "51-regression-inference", "group": "regression", "title": "迴歸統計推論：SE、區間、診斷與預測", "summary": "區分係數不確定、平均反應區間及新觀察預測區間。", "tags": ["相關與迴歸分析", "regression inference"], "example": "31_diagnostics.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"9-3-se\">迴歸統計推論：SE、區間、診斷與預測</h1>\n<p>區分係數不確定、平均反應區間及新觀察預測區間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">斜率標準誤與檢定</h2>\n<p>傳統獨立等變異常態誤差下，s²=SSE/(n−2)，SE(b1)=s/√Sxx，(b1−β10)/SE參照t_(n−2)。只用n−1分母會漏掉已估兩個參數。常態主要用於精確小樣本推論，OLS點估計本身的代數計算不需Y正常。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nSE(b_1)=\\frac{s}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}}},\\qquad\nb_1\\pm t_{1-\\alpha/2,n-2}SE(b_1)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">平均反應與個別預測</h2>\n<p>在x0的平均反應SE=s√(1/n+(x0−x̄)²/Sxx)。新觀察還有個體誤差，預測SE要在根號內多加1，所以通常更寬；遠離x̄時兩者都增寬。軟體summary_frame的mean_ci與obs_ci是不同欄位，不可挑較窄者冒充個別預測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hc3\">異質變異與HC3</h2>\n<p>漏斗殘差可能提示variance隨X變；HC3調整係數協方差估計，保留同一OLS係數，但不能修好非線性、群集相依、混淆或不良外推。若有群集或時間相關，需相應covariance或模型；「robust」不是所有問題都已處理的標章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">特殊點與敏感度</h2>\n<p>槓桿看X位置，殘差看Y偏離，Cook距離綜合影響；大值是查核旗標，不自動刪除。先回查輸入與研究背景，再做有紀錄的敏感度分析，對照納入／排除的理由與結果，避免依p值決定刪點。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實際入口</h2>\n<p>第31例報Breusch–Pagan診斷、classical與HC3 SE、Cook距離及預測區間。小樣本診斷不顯著不等於假設已證實；圖形、設計與領域仍重要。此例是簡單直線主線，多元、GLM與複雜相依另於延伸單元給閱讀入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：HC3後斜率為何沒有變？因調整的是協方差估計。問：95%預測區間是否所有未來點都保證落入？不是，它仍有指定模型下的覆蓋與適用範圍。報告時列清x0、單位、區間種類及外推情況。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/31_diagnostics.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 31_diagnostics.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">sm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">OLS</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_constant</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.diagnostic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">het_breuschpagan</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">lm</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">lmp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">fp</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">het_breuschpagan</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resid</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exog</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;breusch_pagan_lm&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">lm</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;lm_p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">lmp</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;classical_and_HC3&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;small-sample diagnostics do not certify assumptions; HC3 does not fix dependent observations or nonlinear misspecification&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 迴歸統計推論：SE、區間、診斷與預測 {#9-3-se}\n\n區分係數不確定、平均反應區間及新觀察預測區間。\n\n## 斜率標準誤與檢定\n\n傳統獨立等變異常態誤差下，s²=SSE/(n−2)，SE(b1)=s/√Sxx，(b1−β10)/SE參照t_(n−2)。只用n−1分母會漏掉已估兩個參數。常態主要用於精確小樣本推論，OLS點估計本身的代數計算不需Y正常。\n\n$$\nSE(b_1)=\\frac{s}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}}},\\qquad\nb_1\\pm t_{1-\\alpha/2,n-2}SE(b_1)\n$$\n\n## 平均反應與個別預測\n\n在x0的平均反應SE=s√(1/n+(x0−x̄)²/Sxx)。新觀察還有個體誤差，預測SE要在根號內多加1，所以通常更寬；遠離x̄時兩者都增寬。軟體summary_frame的mean_ci與obs_ci是不同欄位，不可挑較窄者冒充個別預測。\n\n## 異質變異與HC3\n\n漏斗殘差可能提示variance隨X變；HC3調整係數協方差估計，保留同一OLS係數，但不能修好非線性、群集相依、混淆或不良外推。若有群集或時間相關，需相應covariance或模型；「robust」不是所有問題都已處理的標章。\n\n## 特殊點與敏感度\n\n槓桿看X位置，殘差看Y偏離，Cook距離綜合影響；大值是查核旗標，不自動刪除。先回查輸入與研究背景，再做有紀錄的敏感度分析，對照納入／排除的理由與結果，避免依p值決定刪點。\n\n## 實際入口\n\n第31例報Breusch–Pagan診斷、classical與HC3 SE、Cook距離及預測區間。小樣本診斷不顯著不等於假設已證實；圖形、設計與領域仍重要。此例是簡單直線主線，多元、GLM與複雜相依另於延伸單元給閱讀入口。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：HC3後斜率為何沒有變？因調整的是協方差估計。問：95%預測區間是否所有未來點都保證落入？不是，它仍有指定模型下的覆蓋與適用範圍。報告時列清x0、單位、區間種類及外推情況。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/31_diagnostics.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 31_diagnostics.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    x,y=regression_data();model=sm.OLS(y,sm.add_constant(x)).fit();from statsmodels.stats.diagnostic import het_breuschpagan\n    lm,lmp,f,fp=het_breuschpagan(model.resid,model.model.exog)\n    result={'breusch_pagan_lm':lm,'lm_p':lmp,'classical_and_HC3':regression(),'note':'small-sample diagnostics do not certify assumptions; HC3 does not fix dependent observations or nonlinear misspecification'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "9-3-se", "name": "迴歸統計推論：SE、區間、診斷與預測", "html": "迴歸統計推論：SE、區間、診斷與預測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "斜率標準誤與檢定", "html": "斜率標準誤與檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "平均反應與個別預測", "html": "平均反應與個別預測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "hc3", "name": "異質變異與HC3", "html": "異質變異與HC3", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "特殊點與敏感度", "html": "特殊點與敏感度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實際入口", "html": "實際入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "52-exercises-regression", "group": "regression", "title": "相關與迴歸習題詳解", "summary": "以手算斜率、殘差與區間語意，檢查軟體輸出。", "tags": ["相關與迴歸分析", "exercises regression"], "html": "<h1 id=\"09\">相關與迴歸習題詳解</h1>\n<p>以手算斜率、殘差與區間語意，檢查軟體輸出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：已知係數</h2>\n<p>x=[−2,−1,0,1,2]，y=1+2x+[1,−2,2,−2,1]。後項殘差和為0，與x內積也0，所以OLS截距1、斜率2。Sxx=10、SSE=14、SSR=40、SST54，R²=40/54=20/27。這是測試中的可手算基準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"r2\">題二：相關與R²</h2>\n<p>在簡單含截距OLS，r的符號與斜率相同，r²=R²；此例r=√(20/27)。如果改成多元迴歸或無截距模型，不能仍用單一兩欄r²代替整體R²。它也不是因果比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題三：殘差與標準誤</h2>\n<p>上例n5，residual df3，s²=14/3，斜率SE=√((14/3)/10)。如果把SSE除5或4，分別當成已知零均值或只估一個參數，都不符合此含截距兩參數模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題四：預測種類</h2>\n<p>問X=0時平均Y的區間與下一個個別Y的區間，哪個寬？答案個別預測較寬，多包含一份新誤差。若X=10在觀察範圍外，即使公式給區間，也需額外說明線性外推未被資料支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題五：診斷與修正</h2>\n<p>殘差呈U型時只改HC3是否修好？不能，U型提示條件平均可能非線性；HC3主要處理某類異質變異協方差。應重新檢查模型、資料機制與研究目標，再用保留資料或適合方法驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題六：一句報告</h2>\n<p>可寫「在此觀察樣本及所列模型下，X每增加1單位，Y條件平均估增加b1，95%係數區間…；資料非隨機分派，未解釋為因果」。合格答案不需套固定句型，但須有方向、單位、區間、n及限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">延伸題：增加截距的重要性</h2>\n<p>若資料真有基準值1卻強制過原點，斜率可能吸收部分截距，殘差和也不再必為0。無截距模型的R²慣例可能與含截距不同，不能將兩個數字直接當同一品質標準。加入截距不是排版選項，而是模型限制的一部分，需要研究理由支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">延伸題：預測與解釋</h2>\n<p>同一個高R²模型可以很會預測，卻無法回答干預效果。若X是與需求共同變動的指標，改變X不一定改變Y。解答要將條件關聯、預測用途及因果目標分開，不能用擬合漂亮取代識別假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 相關與迴歸習題詳解 {#09}\n\n以手算斜率、殘差與區間語意，檢查軟體輸出。\n\n## 題一：已知係數\n\nx=[−2,−1,0,1,2]，y=1+2x+[1,−2,2,−2,1]。後項殘差和為0，與x內積也0，所以OLS截距1、斜率2。Sxx=10、SSE=14、SSR=40、SST54，R²=40/54=20/27。這是測試中的可手算基準。\n\n## 題二：相關與R²\n\n在簡單含截距OLS，r的符號與斜率相同，r²=R²；此例r=√(20/27)。如果改成多元迴歸或無截距模型，不能仍用單一兩欄r²代替整體R²。它也不是因果比例。\n\n## 題三：殘差與標準誤\n\n上例n5，residual df3，s²=14/3，斜率SE=√((14/3)/10)。如果把SSE除5或4，分別當成已知零均值或只估一個參數，都不符合此含截距兩參數模型。\n\n## 題四：預測種類\n\n問X=0時平均Y的區間與下一個個別Y的區間，哪個寬？答案個別預測較寬，多包含一份新誤差。若X=10在觀察範圍外，即使公式給區間，也需額外說明線性外推未被資料支持。\n\n## 題五：診斷與修正\n\n殘差呈U型時只改HC3是否修好？不能，U型提示條件平均可能非線性；HC3主要處理某類異質變異協方差。應重新檢查模型、資料機制與研究目標，再用保留資料或適合方法驗證。\n\n## 題六：一句報告\n\n可寫「在此觀察樣本及所列模型下，X每增加1單位，Y條件平均估增加b1，95%係數區間…；資料非隨機分派，未解釋為因果」。合格答案不需套固定句型，但須有方向、單位、區間、n及限制。\n\n## 延伸題：增加截距的重要性\n\n若資料真有基準值1卻強制過原點，斜率可能吸收部分截距，殘差和也不再必為0。無截距模型的R²慣例可能與含截距不同，不能將兩個數字直接當同一品質標準。加入截距不是排版選項，而是模型限制的一部分，需要研究理由支持。\n\n## 延伸題：預測與解釋\n\n同一個高R²模型可以很會預測，卻無法回答干預效果。若X是與需求共同變動的指標，改變X不一定改變Y。解答要將條件關聯、預測用途及因果目標分開，不能用擬合漂亮取代識別假設。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "09", "name": "相關與迴歸習題詳解", "html": "相關與迴歸習題詳解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：已知係數", "html": "題一：已知係數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "r2", "name": "題二：相關與R²", "html": "題二：相關與R²", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題三：殘差與標準誤", "html": "題三：殘差與標準誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題四：預測種類", "html": "題四：預測種類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題五：診斷與修正", "html": "題五：診斷與修正", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題六：一句報告", "html": "題六：一句報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "延伸題：增加截距的重要性", "html": "延伸題：增加截距的重要性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "延伸題：預測與解釋", "html": "延伸題：預測與解釋", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "53-python-workflow", "group": "survey", "title": "基本操作：環境、欄位字典與可重現分析", "summary": "本章以Python處理同一份合成問卷，不包含SPSS操作。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "python workflow"], "example": "32_questionnaire_scoring.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-1\">基本操作：環境、欄位字典與可重現分析</h1>\n<p>本章以Python處理同一份合成問卷，不包含SPSS操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">軟體與版本基準</h2>\n<p>2026-11-02查核SciPy1.18.1、statsmodels0.15.0、NumPy2.5.4與pandas3.1.0，實測Python3.13.13。科學套件的新版本需要Python≥3.12，本課建議3.13；不要在舊3.11環境強行安裝後降回舊框架卻仍標最新版。官網reference文件可能顯示1.18.0系列，實際套件固定1.18.1修補版。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">安裝與檔案</h2>\n<p>先確認<code>python --version</code>指向已安裝的3.13，再建立虛擬環境並依examples/README安裝鎖版需求。網站閱讀本身不用Python。下載ZIP保留整個examples資料夾，內有course_core、survey.csv與需求檔；不可只取一個入口而漏掉共用模組。</p>\n<h2 id=\"csv\">從CSV到分析資料</h2>\n<p>每列一位虛構填答者，id唯一；group為A/B/C、category為X/Y；六個題項1到5，q3_negative需反向；before／after是同人兩次連續測驗分數。這些名稱有明確意義，不讓欄位順序或數字代碼自己決定分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">載入時立即檢查</h2>\n<p>程式檢查schema、重複ID、類別、題項範圍與有限連續分數；缺失題項保留NaN，不改成0。q3=6−q3_negative，service為q1、q2、q3至少兩題有效才取平均。這是本課明定計分協定，不是所有量表都可自行照用的規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實際執行與解讀</h2>\n<p>第32例回180列、各題缺失、有效分數n與第一筆反向配對。資料相對於<code>__file__</code>定位，因此換工作目錄仍能執行。初次安裝需網路，安裝後40入口使用本機合成資料，不下載問卷或呼叫外部服務。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>如果看到q1=9，是否先當高分繼續算？答：違反1到5契約，應回查來源，不能靜默裁成5。若id重複，也不能無條件保留第一筆；需判斷是重複輸入還是追蹤設計，後者應改資料結構與分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/32_questionnaire_scoring.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 32_questionnaire_scoring.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;rows&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;missing_by_item&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q3_negative&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q4&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q5&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q6&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isna</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_dict</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;service_valid_n&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">service</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">notna</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_reverse_pair&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">q3_negative</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">iloc</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">q3</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">iloc</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;score_policy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mean of q1,q2,q3 with &gt;=2 responses&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/news/\">NumPy正式發布</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 基本操作：環境、欄位字典與可重現分析 {#10-1}\n\n本章以Python處理同一份合成問卷，不包含SPSS操作。\n\n## 軟體與版本基準\n\n2026-11-02查核SciPy1.18.1、statsmodels0.15.0、NumPy2.5.4與pandas3.1.0，實測Python3.13.13。科學套件的新版本需要Python≥3.12，本課建議3.13；不要在舊3.11環境強行安裝後降回舊框架卻仍標最新版。官網reference文件可能顯示1.18.0系列，實際套件固定1.18.1修補版。\n\n## 安裝與檔案\n\n先確認`python --version`指向已安裝的3.13，再建立虛擬環境並依examples/README安裝鎖版需求。網站閱讀本身不用Python。下載ZIP保留整個examples資料夾，內有course_core、survey.csv與需求檔；不可只取一個入口而漏掉共用模組。\n\n## 從CSV到分析資料\n\n每列一位虛構填答者，id唯一；group為A/B/C、category為X/Y；六個題項1到5，q3_negative需反向；before／after是同人兩次連續測驗分數。這些名稱有明確意義，不讓欄位順序或數字代碼自己決定分析。\n\n## 載入時立即檢查\n\n程式檢查schema、重複ID、類別、題項範圍與有限連續分數；缺失題項保留NaN，不改成0。q3=6−q3_negative，service為q1、q2、q3至少兩題有效才取平均。這是本課明定計分協定，不是所有量表都可自行照用的規則。\n\n## 實際執行與解讀\n\n第32例回180列、各題缺失、有效分數n與第一筆反向配對。資料相對於`__file__`定位，因此換工作目錄仍能執行。初次安裝需網路，安裝後40入口使用本機合成資料，不下載問卷或呼叫外部服務。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n如果看到q1=9，是否先當高分繼續算？答：違反1到5契約，應回查來源，不能靜默裁成5。若id重複，也不能無條件保留第一筆；需判斷是重複輸入還是追蹤設計，後者應改資料結構與分析。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/32_questionnaire_scoring.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 32_questionnaire_scoring.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey()\n    result={'rows':len(data),'missing_by_item':data[['q1','q2','q3_negative','q4','q5','q6']].isna().sum().to_dict(),'service_valid_n':int(data.service.notna().sum()),'first_reverse_pair':[data.q3_negative.iloc[0],data.q3.iloc[0]],'score_policy':'mean of q1,q2,q3 with >=2 responses'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [NumPy正式發布](https://numpy.org/news/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-1", "name": "基本操作：環境、欄位字典與可重現分析", "html": "基本操作：環境、欄位字典與可重現分析", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "軟體與版本基準", "html": "軟體與版本基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "安裝與檔案", "html": "安裝與檔案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "csv", "name": "從CSV到分析資料", "html": "從CSV到分析資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "載入時立即檢查", "html": "載入時立即檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實際執行與解讀", "html": "實際執行與解讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "54-questionnaire-design", "group": "survey", "title": "問卷調查與應用：從構念到題目", "summary": "先確定想衡量什麼，再決定抽樣、題項與計分。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "questionnaire design"], "html": "<h1 id=\"10-2\">問卷調查與應用：從構念到題目</h1>\n<p>先確定想衡量什麼，再決定抽樣、題項與計分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">構念與操作化</h2>\n<p>「滿意度」是概念，題項是可觀察的指標；三題平均則是計分規則。定義構念範圍、回想期間及回答情境，避免把不同概念混在同一總分。服務評價、學習準備與測驗成績即使相關，也不是可無條件加總的一件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題目設計</h2>\n<p>一句問一件事、避免誘導、雙重否定與難以回想的期間。選項需涵蓋合理答案並互斥；「不適用／不知道」不等於中立。反向題不會自動消除反應偏差，還可能增加理解負擔，需要先導訪談與實測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">招募與樣本</h2>\n<p>定義目標母體、框、招募與追蹤，記邀請數、有效回覆與排除理由。自願網路問卷通常沒有所有人的已知入選機率，不能只因回收很多就附SRS誤差並推全體。權重、非回應調整與設計需在報告中交代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">計分與缺失政策</h2>\n<p>反向題按原量表規則轉換，例如1到5用6−x。總分／平均、至少幾題、缺失處理與排除標準應事先決定，避免看顯著後才改。對同一量表跨群體比較，還需考量題項理解和測量結構是否可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">本課資料字典</h2>\n<p>service以q1、q2、q3反向後平均；q4、q5、q6示範另一潛在構面；before／after是連續分數，並非把Likert碼誤當百分制。180列來自固定生成器，含少量刻意缺失，便於驗算；它沒有代表真實使用者或正式量表效度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>題：「介面好用而且客服迅速」只有一個同意選項，問題在哪？答：雙重問題，使用者可能一同意一不同意。將兩構面分成明確題項，先導測試再決定是否合成。增加題數若只是重複同一句，可能提高alpha卻未增加有效內容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">先導測試的實際用途</h2>\n<p>請少量符合目標的讀者說出如何理解題目、如何回想和選答案，能發現「最近」期間不一致、反向題誤解或不適用情境。先導資料不只是拿來估alpha；修改題目後量測工具已變，正式分析需保留版本，不能把不同措辭的回覆無說明合併。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html\">statsmodels因素分析</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 問卷調查與應用：從構念到題目 {#10-2}\n\n先確定想衡量什麼，再決定抽樣、題項與計分。\n\n## 構念與操作化\n\n「滿意度」是概念，題項是可觀察的指標；三題平均則是計分規則。定義構念範圍、回想期間及回答情境，避免把不同概念混在同一總分。服務評價、學習準備與測驗成績即使相關，也不是可無條件加總的一件事。\n\n## 題目設計\n\n一句問一件事、避免誘導、雙重否定與難以回想的期間。選項需涵蓋合理答案並互斥；「不適用／不知道」不等於中立。反向題不會自動消除反應偏差，還可能增加理解負擔，需要先導訪談與實測。\n\n## 招募與樣本\n\n定義目標母體、框、招募與追蹤，記邀請數、有效回覆與排除理由。自願網路問卷通常沒有所有人的已知入選機率，不能只因回收很多就附SRS誤差並推全體。權重、非回應調整與設計需在報告中交代。\n\n## 計分與缺失政策\n\n反向題按原量表規則轉換，例如1到5用6−x。總分／平均、至少幾題、缺失處理與排除標準應事先決定，避免看顯著後才改。對同一量表跨群體比較，還需考量題項理解和測量結構是否可比。\n\n## 本課資料字典\n\nservice以q1、q2、q3反向後平均；q4、q5、q6示範另一潛在構面；before／after是連續分數，並非把Likert碼誤當百分制。180列來自固定生成器，含少量刻意缺失，便於驗算；它沒有代表真實使用者或正式量表效度。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n題：「介面好用而且客服迅速」只有一個同意選項，問題在哪？答：雙重問題，使用者可能一同意一不同意。將兩構面分成明確題項，先導測試再決定是否合成。增加題數若只是重複同一句，可能提高alpha卻未增加有效內容。\n\n## 先導測試的實際用途\n\n請少量符合目標的讀者說出如何理解題目、如何回想和選答案，能發現「最近」期間不一致、反向題誤解或不適用情境。先導資料不只是拿來估alpha；修改題目後量測工具已變，正式分析需保留版本，不能把不同措辭的回覆無說明合併。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n- [statsmodels因素分析](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-2", "name": "問卷調查與應用：從構念到題目", "html": "問卷調查與應用：從構念到題目", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "構念與操作化", "html": "構念與操作化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題目設計", "html": "題目設計", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "招募與樣本", "html": "招募與樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "計分與缺失政策", "html": "計分與缺失政策", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "本課資料字典", "html": "本課資料字典", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "先導測試的實際用途", "html": "先導測試的實際用途", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "55-reliability-validity", "group": "survey", "title": "信度與效度：alpha不是量表合格證", "summary": "分清一致性、穩定性與測量解釋的證據，避免只靠閾值判定。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "reliability validity"], "example": "33_reliability.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-3-alpha\">信度與效度：alpha不是量表合格證</h1>\n<p>分清一致性、穩定性與測量解釋的證據，避免只靠閾值判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">信度的不同面向</h2>\n<p>內部一致性看同次題項關係，重測信度看時間穩定，評分者信度看評分一致。它們各有設計與指標，不能拿alpha回答所有信度問題。高一致也可能來自重複題、共同方法或狹窄內容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cronbach-alpha\">Cronbach alpha</h2>\n<p>k題、總分T=各題和，alpha=k/(k−1)(1−Σsj²/sT²)。要先統一計分方向，並使用同一批有效個案建立協方差；任意逐對刪缺失會改數學關係。alpha可以為負，通常需查反向、題意或相關結構，不應為了報表美觀裁成0。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\alpha=\\frac{k}{k-1}\\left(1-\\frac{\\sum_{j=1}^{k}s_j^2}{s_T^2}\\right)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">假設與不能推論的事</h2>\n<p>alpha作某類信度估計有相應測量模型前提；高alpha不證明單因子，也不保證內容或構念效度。刪題提高alpha時，同時檢查內容覆蓋與先驗理由，不把最大化alpha當唯一選題目標。omega等模型式指標另有假設，本課不假稱已實作完整量表驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">效度的證據</h2>\n<p>內容面看題目是否涵蓋構念；與外部準則關係需可信準則與設計；構念面看結構、收斂／區辨及群體可比。效度關於特定分數用途的解釋，不是量表永久不變的一個數字。EFA或顯著相關只是可能證據，不能單獨完成全部論證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實作結果的範圍</h2>\n<p>第33例service三題complete cases173人，反向後alpha約.7969，同時報未反向的結果供比較。不是說超過.7就自動有效；合成資料只示範計算及方向錯誤的影響。有效n與其他分析可能不同，報告需個別列出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>三題完全相同，alpha可等於1，是否最佳量表？不能，可能只重複測很窄的內容。若重新招募、不同語言或不同用途，也需新的適用證據。合理解答同時說統計與內容，不以門檻替代研究判斷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/33_reliability.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 33_reliability.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">correct</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q3&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropna</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">wrong</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">loc</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">correct</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">,[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q3_negative&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;n_complete&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">correct</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;alpha_after_reverse_scoring&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">correct</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;alpha_without_reverse_scoring&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wrong</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;limit&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;alpha alone does not establish validity or unidimensionality&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02310555\">Cronbach（1951）：Coefficient Alpha and the Internal Structure of Tests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html\">statsmodels因素分析</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 信度與效度：alpha不是量表合格證 {#10-3-alpha}\n\n分清一致性、穩定性與測量解釋的證據，避免只靠閾值判定。\n\n## 信度的不同面向\n\n內部一致性看同次題項關係，重測信度看時間穩定，評分者信度看評分一致。它們各有設計與指標，不能拿alpha回答所有信度問題。高一致也可能來自重複題、共同方法或狹窄內容。\n\n## Cronbach alpha\n\nk題、總分T=各題和，alpha=k/(k−1)(1−Σsj²/sT²)。要先統一計分方向，並使用同一批有效個案建立協方差；任意逐對刪缺失會改數學關係。alpha可以為負，通常需查反向、題意或相關結構，不應為了報表美觀裁成0。\n\n$$\n\\alpha=\\frac{k}{k-1}\\left(1-\\frac{\\sum_{j=1}^{k}s_j^2}{s_T^2}\\right)\n$$\n\n## 假設與不能推論的事\n\nalpha作某類信度估計有相應測量模型前提；高alpha不證明單因子，也不保證內容或構念效度。刪題提高alpha時，同時檢查內容覆蓋與先驗理由，不把最大化alpha當唯一選題目標。omega等模型式指標另有假設，本課不假稱已實作完整量表驗證。\n\n## 效度的證據\n\n內容面看題目是否涵蓋構念；與外部準則關係需可信準則與設計；構念面看結構、收斂／區辨及群體可比。效度關於特定分數用途的解釋，不是量表永久不變的一個數字。EFA或顯著相關只是可能證據，不能單獨完成全部論證。\n\n## 實作結果的範圍\n\n第33例service三題complete cases173人，反向後alpha約.7969，同時報未反向的結果供比較。不是說超過.7就自動有效；合成資料只示範計算及方向錯誤的影響。有效n與其他分析可能不同，報告需個別列出。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n三題完全相同，alpha可等於1，是否最佳量表？不能，可能只重複測很窄的內容。若重新招募、不同語言或不同用途，也需新的適用證據。合理解答同時說統計與內容，不以門檻替代研究判斷。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/33_reliability.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 33_reliability.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();correct=data[['q1','q2','q3']].dropna();wrong=data.loc[correct.index,['q1','q2','q3_negative']]\n    result={'n_complete':len(correct),'alpha_after_reverse_scoring':alpha_reliability(correct),'alpha_without_reverse_scoring':alpha_reliability(wrong),'limit':'alpha alone does not establish validity or unidimensionality'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [Cronbach（1951）：Coefficient Alpha and the Internal Structure of Tests](https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02310555)\n- [statsmodels因素分析](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-3-alpha", "name": "信度與效度：alpha不是量表合格證", "html": "信度與效度：alpha不是量表合格證", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "信度的不同面向", "html": "信度的不同面向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "cronbach-alpha", "name": "Cronbach alpha", "html": "Cronbach alpha", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "假設與不能推論的事", "html": "假設與不能推論的事", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "效度的證據", "html": "效度的證據", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實作結果的範圍", "html": "實作結果的範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "56-survey-description", "group": "survey", "title": "敘述統計與交叉分析：先了解回覆者", "summary": "檢定之前先看題項、缺失、分數分布與各組分母。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey description"], "html": "<h1 id=\"10-4\">敘述統計與交叉分析：先了解回覆者</h1>\n<p>檢定之前先看題項、缺失、分數分布與各組分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">逐題描述</h2>\n<p>單題1到5先列各選項人數、有效比例與缺失，保留順序；不要只報一個平均。對service合成分數再報n、平均、SD、中位與IQR，並提醒其近似連續解釋。各題有效n不同時，圖表必須標示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">缺失與樣本流向</h2>\n<p>180列中service有效179，三題信度complete173，六題因素分析complete170。這些不是三份矛盾資料，而是不同事前政策形成的分析集。仍需檢查缺失是否與組別或回覆特性相關，complete-case也有可能產生偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">分組與交叉</h2>\n<p>看group與category人數、各組題項分布及service摘要。探索可以揭露組別不平衡、資料錯誤或後續研究方向，但不要在很多切片中挑一個p小者包裝成事前主假設。「<a href=\"#58-survey-contingency\">交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯</a>」再把交叉表的統計檢定獨立說清楚。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">summary</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">groupby</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;group&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;service&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">agg</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;count&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;std&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">pd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">crosstab</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;group&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;category&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_numpy</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">())</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"mi\">180</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">summary</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">表格如何呈現</h2>\n<p>標題交代資料與期間；欄位寫單位、有效n及百分比方向；小數位依量測精度和用途決定。平均3.0633147不表示量表能量到那麼精細。對離散題項的分布，條形圖比把五個類別當連續密度更直接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：總樣本180，表中某組59人是否漏算？答：可能一人合成分數未達至少兩題，應列排除流向。問：能否對缺失先補0再取平均以維持180？不能，0不在原量表且改變分數定義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 敘述統計與交叉分析：先了解回覆者 {#10-4}\n\n檢定之前先看題項、缺失、分數分布與各組分母。\n\n## 逐題描述\n\n單題1到5先列各選項人數、有效比例與缺失，保留順序；不要只報一個平均。對service合成分數再報n、平均、SD、中位與IQR，並提醒其近似連續解釋。各題有效n不同時，圖表必須標示。\n\n## 缺失與樣本流向\n\n180列中service有效179，三題信度complete173，六題因素分析complete170。這些不是三份矛盾資料，而是不同事前政策形成的分析集。仍需檢查缺失是否與組別或回覆特性相關，complete-case也有可能產生偏差。\n\n## 分組與交叉\n\n看group與category人數、各組題項分布及service摘要。探索可以揭露組別不平衡、資料錯誤或後續研究方向，但不要在很多切片中挑一個p小者包裝成事前主假設。「[交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯](#58-survey-contingency)」再把交叉表的統計檢定獨立說清楚。\n\n```python\nfrom course_core import load_survey\nimport pandas as pd\ndata=load_survey()\nsummary=data.groupby('group')['service'].agg(['count','mean','std'])\ntable=pd.crosstab(data['group'],data['category'])\nassert int(table.to_numpy().sum())==180\nprint(summary)\n```\n\n## 表格如何呈現\n\n標題交代資料與期間；欄位寫單位、有效n及百分比方向；小數位依量測精度和用途決定。平均3.0633147不表示量表能量到那麼精細。對離散題項的分布，條形圖比把五個類別當連續密度更直接。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：總樣本180，表中某組59人是否漏算？答：可能一人合成分數未達至少兩題，應列排除流向。問：能否對缺失先補0再取平均以維持180？不能，0不在原量表且改變分數定義。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-4", "name": "敘述統計與交叉分析：先了解回覆者", "html": "敘述統計與交叉分析：先了解回覆者", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "逐題描述", "html": "逐題描述", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "缺失與樣本流向", "html": "缺失與樣本流向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "分組與交叉", "html": "分組與交叉", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "表格如何呈現", "html": "表格如何呈現", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "57-factor-analysis", "group": "survey", "title": "因素分析：探索結構、KMO、Bartlett與旋轉", "summary": "以真正主軸因素分析示範，與PCA、CFA及效度判斷分開。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "factor analysis"], "example": "34_factor_analysis.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-5-kmobartlett\">因素分析：探索結構、KMO、Bartlett與旋轉</h1>\n<p>以真正主軸因素分析示範，與PCA、CFA及效度判斷分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">潛在共同因素模型</h2>\n<p>標準化題項向量X可寫ΛF+ε，共同因素解釋題項共享變動，unique部分留給各題。PCA以全部變異找線性組合，與共同因素模型目標不同；不能把np.linalg的主成分改名就叫已做EFA。因素數也不該只由「特徵值&gt;1」一條規則決定。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nX=\\Lambda F+\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cov}(X)=\\Lambda\\Phi\\Lambda^T+\\Psi\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">適用性檢查</h2>\n<p>KMO比較簡單相關與偏相關平方，Bartlett球形檢定考察相關矩陣是否為單位矩陣；顯著只支持有相關可探索，不證明選對因素數或量表有效。矩陣奇異、常數題、樣本過少都需先處理，不能只追一個KMO門檻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">提取、因素數與旋轉</h2>\n<p>本課用statsmodels Factor(method='pa')做principal axis，事前固定兩因素以展示已知合成機制；不聲稱這就是資料驅動最優因素數。Varimax為正交旋轉，因素相關被限制為0；真實構念可相關時需考慮斜交、平行分析、理論及穩定性等證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">負荷與共同性</h2>\n<p>負荷大表示與該因素關係較強，符號與列序可翻轉或交換，不代表模型不同。正交時共同性為各負荷平方和；斜交時需計入Φ，不能仍無條件平方相加。看交叉負荷與題意，不只以某個.4門檻機械刪題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">本課資料與限制</h2>\n<p>第34例六題complete170人，反向q3後，以Pearson相關作近似EFA，回KMO、Bartlett、6×2負荷與共同性。Likert為順序，偏態與類別數少時polychoric等處理可能更合適；本例未實作它或CFA，不能由漂亮負荷直接宣布正式效度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：因素1與2交換順序，結果是否錯？不一定，需比較負荷結構與重建相關，符號／排列具有不唯一性。問：可以同一樣本先探索再宣稱獨立確認嗎？不能，確認需新的規劃與資料，或誠實標示探索階段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/34_factor_analysis.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 34_factor_analysis.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q3&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q4&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q5&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;q6&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropna</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html\">statsmodels因素分析</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 因素分析：探索結構、KMO、Bartlett與旋轉 {#10-5-kmobartlett}\n\n以真正主軸因素分析示範，與PCA、CFA及效度判斷分開。\n\n## 潛在共同因素模型\n\n標準化題項向量X可寫ΛF+ε，共同因素解釋題項共享變動，unique部分留給各題。PCA以全部變異找線性組合，與共同因素模型目標不同；不能把np.linalg的主成分改名就叫已做EFA。因素數也不該只由「特徵值>1」一條規則決定。\n\n$$\nX=\\Lambda F+\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cov}(X)=\\Lambda\\Phi\\Lambda^T+\\Psi\n$$\n\n## 適用性檢查\n\nKMO比較簡單相關與偏相關平方，Bartlett球形檢定考察相關矩陣是否為單位矩陣；顯著只支持有相關可探索，不證明選對因素數或量表有效。矩陣奇異、常數題、樣本過少都需先處理，不能只追一個KMO門檻。\n\n## 提取、因素數與旋轉\n\n本課用statsmodels Factor(method='pa')做principal axis，事前固定兩因素以展示已知合成機制；不聲稱這就是資料驅動最優因素數。Varimax為正交旋轉，因素相關被限制為0；真實構念可相關時需考慮斜交、平行分析、理論及穩定性等證據。\n\n## 負荷與共同性\n\n負荷大表示與該因素關係較強，符號與列序可翻轉或交換，不代表模型不同。正交時共同性為各負荷平方和；斜交時需計入Φ，不能仍無條件平方相加。看交叉負荷與題意，不只以某個.4門檻機械刪題。\n\n## 本課資料與限制\n\n第34例六題complete170人，反向q3後，以Pearson相關作近似EFA，回KMO、Bartlett、6×2負荷與共同性。Likert為順序，偏態與類別數少時polychoric等處理可能更合適；本例未實作它或CFA，不能由漂亮負荷直接宣布正式效度。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：因素1與2交換順序，結果是否錯？不一定，需比較負荷結構與重建相關，符號／排列具有不唯一性。問：可以同一樣本先探索再宣稱獨立確認嗎？不能，確認需新的規劃與資料，或誠實標示探索階段。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/34_factor_analysis.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 34_factor_analysis.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();items=data[['q1','q2','q3','q4','q5','q6']].dropna()\n    result=factor_report(items)\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels因素分析](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-5-kmobartlett", "name": "因素分析：探索結構、KMO、Bartlett與旋轉", "html": "因素分析：探索結構、KMO、Bartlett與旋轉", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "潛在共同因素模型", "html": "潛在共同因素模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "適用性檢查", "html": "適用性檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "提取、因素數與旋轉", "html": "提取、因素數與旋轉", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "負荷與共同性", "html": "負荷與共同性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "本課資料與限制", "html": "本課資料與限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "58-survey-contingency", "group": "survey", "title": "交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯", "summary": "從問卷類別計數走到Pearson卡方，清楚交代觀察單位。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey contingency"], "example": "35_survey_crosstab.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-6\">交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯</h1>\n<p>從問卷類別計數走到Pearson卡方，清楚交代觀察單位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">表的問題</h2>\n<p>group A／B／C與category X／Y交叉，每人恰一格，總數180。列百分比回答各group內X／Y分布，欄百分比回答各category中group構成。總樣本比例又是第三種分母，不能在段落中無標示混用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">期望計數與檢定</h2>\n<p>獨立H0下Eij=列和×欄和/180，Pearsonχ²比較觀察與期望，3×2 df2。第35例明確不做Yates校正，回期望數及低於5的格數；不是將列百分比當成六個觀察樣本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">描述與推論分開</h2>\n<p>先報實際計數與比例，再依設計決定推論。若問卷有權重、群集或重複回覆，普通chi2_contingency並未處理這些結構。某格計數為0與某列／欄全0不同，後者讓標準期望程序退化，核心會拒絕。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">效果與後續切片</h2>\n<p>Cramér V量化指定表格下的關聯強度；它無方向，不告訴你哪類造成哪類。若整體有差後探索各格，需檢查殘差、分母與多重比較。不同分組方式可以改表與V，不將一個閾值套所有尺寸表格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">實作讀表</h2>\n<p>第35例同時回row_labels、column_labels、counts及row_percent，確保矩陣數字有對應類別。檢定使用counts；百分比只供解讀。合成資料沒有代表性調查設計，所以結果只用於方法教學，不外推真實人口比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>如果某組X有30人、Y有20人，X列比例60%；全表X共90人，該格占X欄比例33.3%。兩者都對，回答不同條件問題。報表應直接寫「該組內」或「所有X中」，而非只寫一個未標示百分比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/35_survey_crosstab.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 35_survey_crosstab.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">pd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">crosstab</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">category</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;row_labels&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;column_labels&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">columns</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;counts&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_numpy</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;row_percent&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">div</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">axis</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">axis</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_numpy</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pearson_test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">table</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_numpy</span><span class=\"p\">())}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section4/prc45.htm\">NIST交叉分類與獨立性</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯 {#10-6}\n\n從問卷類別計數走到Pearson卡方，清楚交代觀察單位。\n\n## 表的問題\n\ngroup A／B／C與category X／Y交叉，每人恰一格，總數180。列百分比回答各group內X／Y分布，欄百分比回答各category中group構成。總樣本比例又是第三種分母，不能在段落中無標示混用。\n\n## 期望計數與檢定\n\n獨立H0下Eij=列和×欄和/180，Pearsonχ²比較觀察與期望，3×2 df2。第35例明確不做Yates校正，回期望數及低於5的格數；不是將列百分比當成六個觀察樣本。\n\n## 描述與推論分開\n\n先報實際計數與比例，再依設計決定推論。若問卷有權重、群集或重複回覆，普通chi2_contingency並未處理這些結構。某格計數為0與某列／欄全0不同，後者讓標準期望程序退化，核心會拒絕。\n\n## 效果與後續切片\n\nCramér V量化指定表格下的關聯強度；它無方向，不告訴你哪類造成哪類。若整體有差後探索各格，需檢查殘差、分母與多重比較。不同分組方式可以改表與V，不將一個閾值套所有尺寸表格。\n\n## 實作讀表\n\n第35例同時回row_labels、column_labels、counts及row_percent，確保矩陣數字有對應類別。檢定使用counts；百分比只供解讀。合成資料沒有代表性調查設計，所以結果只用於方法教學，不外推真實人口比例。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n如果某組X有30人、Y有20人，X列比例60%；全表X共90人，該格占X欄比例33.3%。兩者都對，回答不同條件問題。報表應直接寫「該組內」或「所有X中」，而非只寫一個未標示百分比。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/35_survey_crosstab.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 35_survey_crosstab.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();table=pd.crosstab(data.group,data.category)\n    result={'row_labels':list(table.index),'column_labels':list(table.columns),'counts':table.to_numpy(),'row_percent':table.div(table.sum(axis=1),axis=0).to_numpy(),'pearson_test':contingency(table.to_numpy())}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST交叉分類與獨立性](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section4/prc45.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-6", "name": "交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯", "html": "交叉表：列百分比、期望數與關聯", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "表的問題", "html": "表的問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "期望計數與檢定", "html": "期望計數與檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "描述與推論分開", "html": "描述與推論分開", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "效果與後續切片", "html": "效果與後續切片", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "實作讀表", "html": "實作讀表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "59-survey-one-sample", "group": "survey", "title": "單一樣本t：合成量表分數與基準值", "summary": "把問卷計分、有效n與近似連續假設接到完整報告。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey one sample"], "example": "36_survey_one_t.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-7-t\">單一樣本t：合成量表分數與基準值</h1>\n<p>把問卷計分、有效n與近似連續假設接到完整報告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">提問與分析集</h2>\n<p>本例問service平均是否與中點3不同，H0:μ_service=3。service已按反向與至少兩題規則建立，有效179人。這不是對每一單題分別檢定，也不是把未回答當3；兩種做法會改估計目標與資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">量表假設</h2>\n<p>三題平均視為近似連續是教學分析選擇，需搭配題項內容、分布與樣本來源。單題順序碼不能無條件視為精確等距。若研究需要更嚴格順序模型或其他估計目標，要另外選方法，不能只以樣本大就省略尺度判斷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">執行與輸出</h2>\n<p>第36例以one_t(...,mu=3)回平均、SE、df178、雙側p及μ的95%CI，另標近似連續與非代表性限制。CI估平均，difference才是相對3的差。p是否顯著與差值是否有實質意義要分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">報告可以怎麼寫</h2>\n<p>「依本次有效合成分數179筆，平均約3.063、SD約.877；在指定近似模型下，檢定相對中點3的差異，並報CI與p。」這句還需附來源、假設及用途。不要改寫「全體使用者滿意」，也不要因平均高於3就先決定單側。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">其他判斷</h2>\n<p>中點3是否真能代表「中性」要看題意與選項；分數有偏態、多峰或天花板時，看完整分布。若目標是至少高於某個實質界值3.5，與測是否等於3是不同檢定問題，需先定義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若把五點題改成七點題，是否仍以3為中點？不對，需依新量表與計分規則改基準。若只改欄位代碼卻保留舊反向公式6−x，也會出現錯誤分數；任何量表更新都需同步schema、計分與推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/36_survey_one_t.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 36_survey_one_t.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">service</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropna</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">mu</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;limit&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;Likert composite treated approximately continuous; not a representative population claim&#39;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc22.htm\">NIST單樣本平均數檢定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 單一樣本t：合成量表分數與基準值 {#10-7-t}\n\n把問卷計分、有效n與近似連續假設接到完整報告。\n\n## 提問與分析集\n\n本例問service平均是否與中點3不同，H0:μ_service=3。service已按反向與至少兩題規則建立，有效179人。這不是對每一單題分別檢定，也不是把未回答當3；兩種做法會改估計目標與資料。\n\n## 量表假設\n\n三題平均視為近似連續是教學分析選擇，需搭配題項內容、分布與樣本來源。單題順序碼不能無條件視為精確等距。若研究需要更嚴格順序模型或其他估計目標，要另外選方法，不能只以樣本大就省略尺度判斷。\n\n## 執行與輸出\n\n第36例以one_t(...,mu=3)回平均、SE、df178、雙側p及μ的95%CI，另標近似連續與非代表性限制。CI估平均，difference才是相對3的差。p是否顯著與差值是否有實質意義要分開。\n\n## 報告可以怎麼寫\n\n「依本次有效合成分數179筆，平均約3.063、SD約.877；在指定近似模型下，檢定相對中點3的差異，並報CI與p。」這句還需附來源、假設及用途。不要改寫「全體使用者滿意」，也不要因平均高於3就先決定單側。\n\n## 其他判斷\n\n中點3是否真能代表「中性」要看題意與選項；分數有偏態、多峰或天花板時，看完整分布。若目標是至少高於某個實質界值3.5，與測是否等於3是不同檢定問題，需先定義。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若把五點題改成七點題，是否仍以3為中點？不對，需依新量表與計分規則改基準。若只改欄位代碼卻保留舊反向公式6−x，也會出現錯誤分數；任何量表更新都需同步schema、計分與推論。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/36_survey_one_t.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 36_survey_one_t.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();result=one_t(data.service.dropna(),mu=3);result['limit']='Likert composite treated approximately continuous; not a representative population claim'\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST單樣本平均數檢定](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc22.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-7-t", "name": "單一樣本t：合成量表分數與基準值", "html": "單一樣本t：合成量表分數與基準值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "提問與分析集", "html": "提問與分析集", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "量表假設", "html": "量表假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "執行與輸出", "html": "執行與輸出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "報告可以怎麼寫", "html": "報告可以怎麼寫", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "其他判斷", "html": "其他判斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "60-survey-independent", "group": "survey", "title": "獨立樣本t：兩類回覆者的平均差", "summary": "以Welch示範分組、有效n、差異方向與區間解讀。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey independent"], "example": "37_survey_independent_t.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-8-t\">獨立樣本t：兩類回覆者的平均差</h1>\n<p>以Welch示範分組、有效n、差異方向與區間解讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">哪兩組與什麼目標</h2>\n<p>取group A與B的service，兩組由不同虛構個人組成，示範獨立組比較；A有效59、B有效60。定義差為A−B，不因結果負號就改排序。此為觀察分組，不是隨機分派，沒有自動的處理因果解釋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"welch\">為何用Welch</h2>\n<p>不強制等母體variance，直接用各組SD及n估SE。兩組樣本數略不同是缺失政策的結果，不能為了整齊刪到相同n。也不需先用Levene預檢挑方法；事前程序與假設要固定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">實際結果</h2>\n<p>第37例同第19核心。固定fixture下A−B約−.2056、95%CI約[−.5342,.1230]、p約.2178，df約116.90。未拒絕不表示兩組相同，區間仍涵蓋負面與正面差；若需等效，須另訂合理界值與設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">效果報告</h2>\n<p>保留原始量表單位，並列兩組n、均值、SD、差與CI。若補Cohen d或Hedges g，需說明標準化分母與小樣本修正，尤其不等variance時定義不唯一。本課不把t或p當效果大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">擴成三組時</h2>\n<p>不能再逐對無調整跑很多t，然後挑最小p；「<a href=\"#62-survey-anova\">單因子變異數分析</a>」與「<a href=\"#63-survey-posthoc\">事後比較</a>」以Welch ANOVA和Games–Howell處理預定三組家族。若同時還做其他問卷目標，整體探索／確認性家族也需另規劃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若改報B−A，差變+.2056、CI變[−.1230,.5342]、雙側p不變。這個對稱關係可檢查報表方向。若同一批人從A狀態轉B狀態，已是配對問題，不能只把欄位名稱改成A/B而保留獨立SE。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/37_survey_independent_t.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 37_survey_independent_t.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">loc</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;service&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropna</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">loc</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;service&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropna</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm\">NIST兩樣本t檢定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 獨立樣本t：兩類回覆者的平均差 {#10-8-t}\n\n以Welch示範分組、有效n、差異方向與區間解讀。\n\n## 哪兩組與什麼目標\n\n取group A與B的service，兩組由不同虛構個人組成，示範獨立組比較；A有效59、B有效60。定義差為A−B，不因結果負號就改排序。此為觀察分組，不是隨機分派，沒有自動的處理因果解釋。\n\n## 為何用Welch\n\n不強制等母體variance，直接用各組SD及n估SE。兩組樣本數略不同是缺失政策的結果，不能為了整齊刪到相同n。也不需先用Levene預檢挑方法；事前程序與假設要固定。\n\n## 實際結果\n\n第37例同第19核心。固定fixture下A−B約−.2056、95%CI約[−.5342,.1230]、p約.2178，df約116.90。未拒絕不表示兩組相同，區間仍涵蓋負面與正面差；若需等效，須另訂合理界值與設計。\n\n## 效果報告\n\n保留原始量表單位，並列兩組n、均值、SD、差與CI。若補Cohen d或Hedges g，需說明標準化分母與小樣本修正，尤其不等variance時定義不唯一。本課不把t或p當效果大小。\n\n## 擴成三組時\n\n不能再逐對無調整跑很多t，然後挑最小p；「[單因子變異數分析](#62-survey-anova)」與「[事後比較](#63-survey-posthoc)」以Welch ANOVA和Games–Howell處理預定三組家族。若同時還做其他問卷目標，整體探索／確認性家族也需另規劃。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若改報B−A，差變+.2056、CI變[−.1230,.5342]、雙側p不變。這個對稱關係可檢查報表方向。若同一批人從A狀態轉B狀態，已是配對問題，不能只把欄位名稱改成A/B而保留獨立SE。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/37_survey_independent_t.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 37_survey_independent_t.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();result=welch(data.loc[data.group=='A','service'].dropna(),data.loc[data.group=='B','service'].dropna())\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST兩樣本t檢定](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-8-t", "name": "獨立樣本t：兩類回覆者的平均差", "html": "獨立樣本t：兩類回覆者的平均差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "哪兩組與什麼目標", "html": "哪兩組與什麼目標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "welch", "name": "為何用Welch", "html": "為何用Welch", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "實際結果", "html": "實際結果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "效果報告", "html": "效果報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "擴成三組時", "html": "擴成三組時", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "61-survey-paired", "group": "survey", "title": "成對樣本t：按ID對齊前後測", "summary": "保留配對的資料關係，避免兩欄看似同長卻錯人配對。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey paired"], "example": "38_survey_paired_t.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-9-tid\">成對樣本t：按ID對齊前後測</h1>\n<p>保留配對的資料關係，避免兩欄看似同長卻錯人配對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">設計與分析變數</h2>\n<p>同人before／after連續分數，定d=after−before，對平均差0作單樣本t。推論條件針對不同人的差值獨立與差值分布，不是要求before和after彼此獨立。前後各自看起來正常也不自動替代差值診斷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"id\">依ID合併</h2>\n<p>第38例刻意將前後表分別打散，再以唯一id合併並<code>validate='one_to_one'</code>。若只按目前列順序相減，會把不同人配在一起。實際研究還需報只有前測、只有後測、完整配對的數量，不能悄悄丟掉失訪者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">手算邏輯</h2>\n<p>t=d̄/(s_d/√n)，df=n−1。配對資訊可降低SE，但不是必然提高power：需看實際相關與差值variance。若同一人有多次追蹤，不一定只兩次差值就能回答全部問題，可能需重複量測或混合模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fixture\">固定fixture結果</h2>\n<p>180對完整連續分數，平均after−before約2.9556，95%CI約[2.3348,3.5764]，t約9.3953。這是合成資料教學觀察，不能當任何課程成效證明；沒有控制組的前後變化也可能包含時間、測驗熟悉或其他影響。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">報告與缺失</h2>\n<p>保留變化方向、單位、配對n、差的SD、CI及p。若有缺失，先定義共同有效配對與失訪分析，不能before刪一批、after刪另一批後仍按索引相減。共同函式只接受已配對有限數列，不替你猜資料關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>同樣一組前後值打散後，若按ID合併，結果應保持；按列配對可能均差仍碰巧相同，但差的SD與p會變。這說明只測平均不足以驗證配對正確，還需直接檢查ID一對一關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/38_survey_paired_t.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 38_survey_paired_t.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;id&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;before&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sample</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">frac</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;id&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;after&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sample</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">frac</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">matched</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">merge</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;id&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">validate</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;one_to_one&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">matched</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">matched</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;matched_by&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;unique respondent id, not row position&#39;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm\">NIST兩樣本t檢定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 成對樣本t：按ID對齊前後測 {#10-9-tid}\n\n保留配對的資料關係，避免兩欄看似同長卻錯人配對。\n\n## 設計與分析變數\n\n同人before／after連續分數，定d=after−before，對平均差0作單樣本t。推論條件針對不同人的差值獨立與差值分布，不是要求before和after彼此獨立。前後各自看起來正常也不自動替代差值診斷。\n\n## 依ID合併\n\n第38例刻意將前後表分別打散，再以唯一id合併並`validate='one_to_one'`。若只按目前列順序相減，會把不同人配在一起。實際研究還需報只有前測、只有後測、完整配對的數量，不能悄悄丟掉失訪者。\n\n## 手算邏輯\n\nt=d̄/(s_d/√n)，df=n−1。配對資訊可降低SE，但不是必然提高power：需看實際相關與差值variance。若同一人有多次追蹤，不一定只兩次差值就能回答全部問題，可能需重複量測或混合模型。\n\n## 固定fixture結果\n\n180對完整連續分數，平均after−before約2.9556，95%CI約[2.3348,3.5764]，t約9.3953。這是合成資料教學觀察，不能當任何課程成效證明；沒有控制組的前後變化也可能包含時間、測驗熟悉或其他影響。\n\n## 報告與缺失\n\n保留變化方向、單位、配對n、差的SD、CI及p。若有缺失，先定義共同有效配對與失訪分析，不能before刪一批、after刪另一批後仍按索引相減。共同函式只接受已配對有限數列，不替你猜資料關係。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n同樣一組前後值打散後，若按ID合併，結果應保持；按列配對可能均差仍碰巧相同，但差的SD與p會變。這說明只測平均不足以驗證配對正確，還需直接檢查ID一對一關係。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/38_survey_paired_t.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 38_survey_paired_t.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();before=data[['id','before']].sample(frac=1,random_state=7);after=data[['id','after']].sample(frac=1,random_state=11)\n    matched=before.merge(after,on='id',validate='one_to_one');result=paired(matched.before,matched.after);result['matched_by']='unique respondent id, not row position'\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [NIST兩樣本t檢定](https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda353.htm)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-9-tid", "name": "成對樣本t：按ID對齊前後測", "html": "成對樣本t：按ID對齊前後測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "設計與分析變數", "html": "設計與分析變數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "id", "name": "依ID合併", "html": "依ID合併", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "手算邏輯", "html": "手算邏輯", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "fixture", "name": "固定fixture結果", "html": "固定fixture結果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "報告與缺失", "html": "報告與缺失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "62-survey-anova", "group": "survey", "title": "單因子變異數分析：三組合成量表分數", "summary": "在同一計分協定下做整體比較，再準備有調整的後續對比。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey anova"], "example": "39_survey_anova_posthoc.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"10-10\">單因子變異數分析：三組合成量表分數</h1>\n<p>在同一計分協定下做整體比較，再準備有調整的後續對比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">研究問題與資料</h2>\n<p>A、B、C三組service平均是否全相等。有效n=[59,60,60]，缺失政策不變。這是獨立組的示範，不適用同人回答三種方案的重複量測；也不能對多個單題逐一試到顯著再只報那一項。</p>\n<h2 id=\"welch\">固定Welch程序</h2>\n<p>第39例用equal_var=False的Welch ANOVA，避免強制共同variance。輸出仍列傳統SS與描述η²供了解資料分解，但不把它當Welch F的精確效果推論。方法名稱、n及差異方向應在報告中保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">解讀實際結果</h2>\n<p>固定fixture下組平均約[2.8305,3.0361,3.3194]，Welch F約5.2262、p約.00671。這支持在指定近似模型下共同平均假設較不相容，不表示三組每對都不同。下一節的Games–Howell才回答各對差異與同時區間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">假設與實質大小</h2>\n<p>同時看各組題項／分數分布、尺度、抽樣與缺失。即使三組平均方向穩定，差.2或.5分是否重要仍需題意與事前界值。合成資料沒有外部使用者與代表性設計，不用其p值推產品或政策結論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">一份可審閱報告</h2>\n<p>說明哪個分數、如何計分、各組有效n、為何採Welch，列摘要、整體結果、預定事後比較與限制。若研究是探索，標示探索；確認性研究需事前分析計畫與控制完整檢定家族，不只是同一次ANOVA後的三對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：整體p=.0067是否等同至少有一對在未調整t下p=.0067？不是，不同檢定統計量及問題。問：可以把已知較差組刪掉後再報另外兩組嗎？除非有事前合理排除定義且透明報告，否則是結果導向選擇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/39_survey_anova_posthoc.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 39_survey_anova_posthoc.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">loc</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;service&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dropna</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to_numpy</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">g</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;group_order&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;welch_anova&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">equal_var</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;games_howell&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">use_var</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;unequal&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html\">Tukey與Games–Howell介面</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 單因子變異數分析：三組合成量表分數 {#10-10}\n\n在同一計分協定下做整體比較，再準備有調整的後續對比。\n\n## 研究問題與資料\n\nA、B、C三組service平均是否全相等。有效n=[59,60,60]，缺失政策不變。這是獨立組的示範，不適用同人回答三種方案的重複量測；也不能對多個單題逐一試到顯著再只報那一項。\n\n## 固定Welch程序\n\n第39例用equal_var=False的Welch ANOVA，避免強制共同variance。輸出仍列傳統SS與描述η²供了解資料分解，但不把它當Welch F的精確效果推論。方法名稱、n及差異方向應在報告中保留。\n\n## 解讀實際結果\n\n固定fixture下組平均約[2.8305,3.0361,3.3194]，Welch F約5.2262、p約.00671。這支持在指定近似模型下共同平均假設較不相容，不表示三組每對都不同。下一節的Games–Howell才回答各對差異與同時區間。\n\n## 假設與實質大小\n\n同時看各組題項／分數分布、尺度、抽樣與缺失。即使三組平均方向穩定，差.2或.5分是否重要仍需題意與事前界值。合成資料沒有外部使用者與代表性設計，不用其p值推產品或政策結論。\n\n## 一份可審閱報告\n\n說明哪個分數、如何計分、各組有效n、為何採Welch，列摘要、整體結果、預定事後比較與限制。若研究是探索，標示探索；確認性研究需事前分析計畫與控制完整檢定家族，不只是同一次ANOVA後的三對。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：整體p=.0067是否等同至少有一對在未調整t下p=.0067？不是，不同檢定統計量及問題。問：可以把已知較差組刪掉後再報另外兩組嗎？除非有事前合理排除定義且透明報告，否則是結果導向選擇。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/39_survey_anova_posthoc.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 39_survey_anova_posthoc.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    data=load_survey();groups=[data.loc[data.group==g,'service'].dropna().to_numpy() for g in ['A','B','C']]\n    result={'group_order':['A','B','C'],'welch_anova':one_way(groups,equal_var=False),'games_howell':posthoc(groups,use_var='unequal')}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [Tukey與Games–Howell介面](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-10", "name": "單因子變異數分析：三組合成量表分數", "html": "單因子變異數分析：三組合成量表分數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "研究問題與資料", "html": "研究問題與資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "welch", "name": "固定Welch程序", "html": "固定Welch程序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "解讀實際結果", "html": "解讀實際結果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "假設與實質大小", "html": "假設與實質大小", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "一份可審閱報告", "html": "一份可審閱報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "63-survey-posthoc", "group": "survey", "title": "事後比較：從整體差異到三對區間", "summary": "閱讀調整p與同時區間，保留家族與差異方向。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "survey posthoc"], "html": "<h1 id=\"10-11\">事後比較：從整體差異到三對區間</h1>\n<p>閱讀調整p與同時區間，保留家族與差異方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">三個比較</h2>\n<p>依A、B、C映射G1、G2、G3，輸出G2−G1、G3−G1、G3−G2。第39例已包含完整程式，本節聚焦閱讀。這個方向與單獨Welch的A−B不同，報告表頭需明確，不能因兩段正負相反就認為計算錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gameshowell\">Games–Howell結果</h2>\n<p>固定fixture下差約[.2056,.4889,.2833]，調整p約[.4327,.00532,.1530]。三對同時區間依序約[−.1883,.5995]、[.1241,.8538]、[−.0770,.6437]。整體顯著仍只有中間這對在該家族程序下拒絕，並不矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">不只讀顯著那對</h2>\n<p>未拒絕的兩對仍需報估計與區間，不能刪除。正區間表示第二組較高；跨0表示在該程序下仍相容於零差及兩方向的一部分。是否符合實質等效或重要性界值，需要另一個事前定義，不能直接由p大小替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">多個研究目標的家族</h2>\n<p>Games–Howell處理這三組的兩兩比較，不自動覆蓋你同時對十種分數、很多分組和十個子群所作全部檢定。探索報告可完整呈現並標示，確認性研究則需先定主次目標與錯誤控制策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">圖表與報告</h2>\n<p>可畫各對差異與CI的forest圖，比只畫星號更清楚。軸使用原量表單位，零線標示無差；若換方向，整段區間反向並交換端點。不要以兩組各自CI是否重疊直接取代差異檢定，兩者不是相同判準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問：A對B未拒絕、B對C未拒絕，是否可推出A對C未拒絕？不能，檢定結果不具有這種傳遞性。三組差與SE可讓端點對比有較明確證據；這不是邏輯矛盾，而是各個假設與不確定性不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">可視化零線</h2>\n<p>若將三對區間畫在同一水平軸，零線提供共同基準，各對差的點估計與寬度同時可見。這比只標一個星號更容易看出未拒絕是接近零還是資訊太少。所有區間須使用同一明確方法，不能將某對換成較窄的未調整區間而不標示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html\">Tukey與Games–Howell介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 事後比較：從整體差異到三對區間 {#10-11}\n\n閱讀調整p與同時區間，保留家族與差異方向。\n\n## 三個比較\n\n依A、B、C映射G1、G2、G3，輸出G2−G1、G3−G1、G3−G2。第39例已包含完整程式，本節聚焦閱讀。這個方向與單獨Welch的A−B不同，報告表頭需明確，不能因兩段正負相反就認為計算錯。\n\n## Games–Howell結果\n\n固定fixture下差約[.2056,.4889,.2833]，調整p約[.4327,.00532,.1530]。三對同時區間依序約[−.1883,.5995]、[.1241,.8538]、[−.0770,.6437]。整體顯著仍只有中間這對在該家族程序下拒絕，並不矛盾。\n\n## 不只讀顯著那對\n\n未拒絕的兩對仍需報估計與區間，不能刪除。正區間表示第二組較高；跨0表示在該程序下仍相容於零差及兩方向的一部分。是否符合實質等效或重要性界值，需要另一個事前定義，不能直接由p大小替代。\n\n## 多個研究目標的家族\n\nGames–Howell處理這三組的兩兩比較，不自動覆蓋你同時對十種分數、很多分組和十個子群所作全部檢定。探索報告可完整呈現並標示，確認性研究則需先定主次目標與錯誤控制策略。\n\n## 圖表與報告\n\n可畫各對差異與CI的forest圖，比只畫星號更清楚。軸使用原量表單位，零線標示無差；若換方向，整段區間反向並交換端點。不要以兩組各自CI是否重疊直接取代差異檢定，兩者不是相同判準。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問：A對B未拒絕、B對C未拒絕，是否可推出A對C未拒絕？不能，檢定結果不具有這種傳遞性。三組差與SE可讓端點對比有較明確證據；這不是邏輯矛盾，而是各個假設與不確定性不同。\n\n## 可視化零線\n\n若將三對區間畫在同一水平軸，零線提供共同基準，各對差的點估計與寬度同時可見。這比只標一個星號更容易看出未拒絕是接近零還是資訊太少。所有區間須使用同一明確方法，不能將某對換成較窄的未調整區間而不標示。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [Tukey與Games–Howell介面](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10-11", "name": "事後比較：從整體差異到三對區間", "html": "事後比較：從整體差異到三對區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "三個比較", "html": "三個比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "gameshowell", "name": "Games–Howell結果", "html": "Games–Howell結果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "不只讀顯著那對", "html": "不只讀顯著那對", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "多個研究目標的家族", "html": "多個研究目標的家族", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "圖表與報告", "html": "圖表與報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "可視化零線", "html": "可視化零線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "64-exercises-survey", "group": "survey", "title": "問卷分析習題詳解：從原始題項到報告", "summary": "把計分、有效樣本、方法與解釋串成一次可重現分析。", "tags": ["問卷調查分析與Python實作", "exercises survey"], "html": "<h1 id=\"10\">問卷分析習題詳解：從原始題項到報告</h1>\n<p>把計分、有效樣本、方法與解釋串成一次可重現分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：反向題</h2>\n<p>五點題原值1、2、3、4、5反向為5、4、3、2、1，公式6−x。缺失維持缺失，不能6−999或先填0。若是七點題，改為8−x；反向公式來自尺度端點，不是永遠6。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：分數缺失</h2>\n<p>service三題至少兩題有效才取平均。[4,NA,2]得3，[NA,NA,5]不計分。本fixture180列中service有效179，三題信度complete173、六題因素complete170。解答需附每個分析n，不能整份報告一律寫180。</p>\n<h2 id=\"alpha\">題三：alpha與效度</h2>\n<p>alpha約.797是否證明正式量表有效？不能；需內容、用途、結構、外部關係與穩定性等證據。漏反向可破壞一致性，但改對方向也只是必要處理之一。完全相同三題可能alpha1，仍不代表內容充分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題四：因素數與旋轉</h2>\n<p>本例固定兩因素是展示已知生成機制，不能當自動選出最佳數目。Varimax正交，對相關構念可能需斜交；Likert的Pearson近似也需交代。把PCA載荷表貼成EFA結果不合格，方法目標不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題五：選擇檢定</h2>\n<p>一組service對3：單樣本t近似；不同人A／B：Welch；同人前後：差值t；A／B／C：Welch ANOVA與適當多重比較；group×category：計數卡方。每項還要檢查設計、尺度與分布，不是只看欄位有幾個。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題六：完整文字</h2>\n<p>寫出合成資料、計分政策、分析集、摘要、估計差與CI、方法／p、調整範圍及限制。不可聲稱真實人口或因果，也不可只挑顯著。「<a href=\"#69-capstone\">完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告</a>」的完整專題會將結果保存為JSON，讓你能核對每段文字的數據來源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html\">statsmodels因素分析</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html\">Tukey與Games–Howell介面</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 問卷分析習題詳解：從原始題項到報告 {#10}\n\n把計分、有效樣本、方法與解釋串成一次可重現分析。\n\n## 題一：反向題\n\n五點題原值1、2、3、4、5反向為5、4、3、2、1，公式6−x。缺失維持缺失，不能6−999或先填0。若是七點題，改為8−x；反向公式來自尺度端點，不是永遠6。\n\n## 題二：分數缺失\n\nservice三題至少兩題有效才取平均。[4,NA,2]得3，[NA,NA,5]不計分。本fixture180列中service有效179，三題信度complete173、六題因素complete170。解答需附每個分析n，不能整份報告一律寫180。\n\n## 題三：alpha與效度\n\nalpha約.797是否證明正式量表有效？不能；需內容、用途、結構、外部關係與穩定性等證據。漏反向可破壞一致性，但改對方向也只是必要處理之一。完全相同三題可能alpha1，仍不代表內容充分。\n\n## 題四：因素數與旋轉\n\n本例固定兩因素是展示已知生成機制，不能當自動選出最佳數目。Varimax正交，對相關構念可能需斜交；Likert的Pearson近似也需交代。把PCA載荷表貼成EFA結果不合格，方法目標不同。\n\n## 題五：選擇檢定\n\n一組service對3：單樣本t近似；不同人A／B：Welch；同人前後：差值t；A／B／C：Welch ANOVA與適當多重比較；group×category：計數卡方。每項還要檢查設計、尺度與分布，不是只看欄位有幾個。\n\n## 題六：完整文字\n\n寫出合成資料、計分政策、分析集、摘要、估計差與CI、方法／p、調整範圍及限制。不可聲稱真實人口或因果，也不可只挑顯著。「[完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告](#69-capstone)」的完整專題會將結果保存為JSON，讓你能核對每段文字的數據來源。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [statsmodels因素分析](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html)\n- [Tukey與Games–Howell介面](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "10", "name": "問卷分析習題詳解：從原始題項到報告", "html": "問卷分析習題詳解：從原始題項到報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：反向題", "html": "題一：反向題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：分數缺失", "html": "題二：分數缺失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "alpha", "name": "題三：alpha與效度", "html": "題三：alpha與效度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題四：因素數與旋轉", "html": "題四：因素數與旋轉", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題五：選擇檢定", "html": "題五：選擇檢定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題六：完整文字", "html": "題六：完整文字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "65-worked-solutions", "group": "appendices", "title": "補充習題解答：計算、選法與合理結論", "summary": "十章已附解答，本單元再以跨章題檢驗完整推理。", "tags": ["解答、附錄與完整專題", "worked solutions"], "example": "24_goodness_of_fit.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"a\">補充習題解答：計算、選法與合理結論</h1>\n<p>十章已附解答，本單元再以跨章題檢驗完整推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">題一：一份資料的三種範圍</h2>\n<p>樣本有20筆等待時間，問「典型等待」「母體平均」與「下一筆等待」應如何分辨？答：前者可用中位、IQR與分布描述；平均的CI估母體μ；新觀察需預測分布／區間，通常包含更大個體變動。三者不能因都以時間為單位就共用一個區間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題二：適合度完整手算</h2>\n<p>六類觀察[18,22,20,16,24,20]，總n120。H0六類等機率，期望皆20；χ²=(4+4+0+16+16+0)/20=2，df5。第24例提供完整計算，沒有由同資料估分布參數，所以不再扣其他自由度。結論是與指定均勻分布的相容程度，不是證明每類真機率完全相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：樣本比例與原始分母</h2>\n<p>A組8/10、B組80/100皆.8，較大樣本通常有較窄比例區間。若只收到一個80%而不知分母，就無法合理重建SE。若比例由加權調查得出，甚至未必能還原成整數成功數，需要原設計與權重資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：方法不合時</h2>\n<p>五個人各測三種方案，直接當15個獨立人做一因子ANOVA錯在哪？答：同人重複有相依；需保留人ID與方案結構，使用適合重複／混合模型或問題特定的配對對比。不是把n從15改5卻仍套同一組F公式即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">題五：研究與軟體</h2>\n<p>軟體成功印出表格是否表示分析有效？不能。資料可能重複ID、錯反向、用百分比當計數、漏截距或把配對打散。檢查契約與已知值、保留可重跑程式，才能讓輸出有可審閱的意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">開放題驗收準則</h2>\n<p>任何實務報告至少交代問題與估計目標、資料來源與設計、變數定義與處理、方法與條件、估計／區間／檢定、診斷及限制。選法不同可以合理，但理由需符合所問問題。若沒有資料證據，應明確說未知，不能補一個漂亮數字當已完成研究。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/24_goodness_of_fit.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 24_goodness_of_fit.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">observed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">18</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">22</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">24</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">full</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">20.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chisquare</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">observed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">f_exp</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;observed&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">observed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;expected&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;chi2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">statistic</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;df&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;p&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pvalue</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;estimated_distribution_parameters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 補充習題解答：計算、選法與合理結論 {#a}\n\n十章已附解答，本單元再以跨章題檢驗完整推理。\n\n## 題一：一份資料的三種範圍\n\n樣本有20筆等待時間，問「典型等待」「母體平均」與「下一筆等待」應如何分辨？答：前者可用中位、IQR與分布描述；平均的CI估母體μ；新觀察需預測分布／區間，通常包含更大個體變動。三者不能因都以時間為單位就共用一個區間。\n\n## 題二：適合度完整手算\n\n六類觀察[18,22,20,16,24,20]，總n120。H0六類等機率，期望皆20；χ²=(4+4+0+16+16+0)/20=2，df5。第24例提供完整計算，沒有由同資料估分布參數，所以不再扣其他自由度。結論是與指定均勻分布的相容程度，不是證明每類真機率完全相等。\n\n## 題三：樣本比例與原始分母\n\nA組8/10、B組80/100皆.8，較大樣本通常有較窄比例區間。若只收到一個80%而不知分母，就無法合理重建SE。若比例由加權調查得出，甚至未必能還原成整數成功數，需要原設計與權重資訊。\n\n## 題四：方法不合時\n\n五個人各測三種方案，直接當15個獨立人做一因子ANOVA錯在哪？答：同人重複有相依；需保留人ID與方案結構，使用適合重複／混合模型或問題特定的配對對比。不是把n從15改5卻仍套同一組F公式即可。\n\n## 題五：研究與軟體\n\n軟體成功印出表格是否表示分析有效？不能。資料可能重複ID、錯反向、用百分比當計數、漏截距或把配對打散。檢查契約與已知值、保留可重跑程式，才能讓輸出有可審閱的意義。\n\n## 開放題驗收準則\n\n任何實務報告至少交代問題與估計目標、資料來源與設計、變數定義與處理、方法與條件、估計／區間／檢定、診斷及限制。選法不同可以合理，但理由需符合所問問題。若沒有資料證據，應明確說未知，不能補一個漂亮數字當已完成研究。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/24_goodness_of_fit.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 24_goodness_of_fit.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    observed=np.array([18,22,20,16,24,20]);expected=np.full(6,20.)\n    test=stats.chisquare(observed,f_exp=expected)\n    result={'observed':observed,'expected':expected,'chi2':test.statistic,'df':5,'p':test.pvalue,'estimated_distribution_parameters':0}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "a", "name": "補充習題解答：計算、選法與合理結論", "html": "補充習題解答：計算、選法與合理結論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "題一：一份資料的三種範圍", "html": "題一：一份資料的三種範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題二：適合度完整手算", "html": "題二：適合度完整手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：樣本比例與原始分母", "html": "題三：樣本比例與原始分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：方法不合時", "html": "題四：方法不合時", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "題五：研究與軟體", "html": "題五：研究與軟體", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "開放題驗收準則", "html": "開放題驗收準則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "66-distribution-tables", "group": "appendices", "title": "分配表、尾向與常用切點", "summary": "將傳統查表與CDF、SF、PPF對照，避免表頭慣例造成錯誤。", "tags": ["解答、附錄與完整專題", "distribution tables"], "html": "<h1 id=\"b\">分配表、尾向與常用切點</h1>\n<p>將傳統查表與CDF、SF、PPF對照，避免表頭慣例造成錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">左尾、右尾與反函數</h2>\n<p>CDF(x)=P(X≤x)，連續分布SF(x)=P(X&gt;x)，PPF(q)找左側累積q的切點。離散SF(k)為P(X&gt;k)，所以P(X≥k)要sf(k−1)。查表若標上尾α，與ppf的輸入q=1−α對應，不能直接把表頭.05當ppf(.05)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">標準常態速查</h2>\n<p>中央90%、95%、99%雙側切點分別約1.64485、1.95996、2.57583。單側α=.05用1.64485，不是1.95996；「95%」需要先說單側還是中央雙側。極小右尾使用sf，避免1−cdf的浮點消去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"t\">t與卡方速查</h2>\n<p>95%中央t切點df1約12.7062、df5約2.5706、df9約2.2622、df29約2.0452；自由度愈大通常愈接近1.96。χ²_9的.025與.975切點約2.7004及19.0228，明顯不對稱。變異數區間反解時，這兩個數字的分母位置會相反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"f\">F與自由度順序</h2>\n<p>F有分子與分母兩個df，F_(4,10)的.95分位約3.4780；交換為(10,4)不是同一切點。若用倒數關係需同時交換df與尾向。傳統表可能欄列順序不同，先讀標題再找數字。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"nb\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cdf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mf\">1e-12</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chi2</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.025</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ppf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.95</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">常見錯誤與解答</h2>\n<p>「雙側.05」不代表兩邊各.05；應各.025。「卡方下界」不一定用小切點作分母，要看正在反解哪個參數。「PPF(.975)」也不等於觀察值的p。這些名稱都含機率，但角色不同；先畫軸、標事件或接受域，再代公式通常最可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 分配表、尾向與常用切點 {#b}\n\n將傳統查表與CDF、SF、PPF對照，避免表頭慣例造成錯誤。\n\n## 左尾、右尾與反函數\n\nCDF(x)=P(X≤x)，連續分布SF(x)=P(X>x)，PPF(q)找左側累積q的切點。離散SF(k)為P(X>k)，所以P(X≥k)要sf(k−1)。查表若標上尾α，與ppf的輸入q=1−α對應，不能直接把表頭.05當ppf(.05)。\n\n## 標準常態速查\n\n中央90%、95%、99%雙側切點分別約1.64485、1.95996、2.57583。單側α=.05用1.64485，不是1.95996；「95%」需要先說單側還是中央雙側。極小右尾使用sf，避免1−cdf的浮點消去。\n\n## t與卡方速查\n\n95%中央t切點df1約12.7062、df5約2.5706、df9約2.2622、df29約2.0452；自由度愈大通常愈接近1.96。χ²_9的.025與.975切點約2.7004及19.0228，明顯不對稱。變異數區間反解時，這兩個數字的分母位置會相反。\n\n## F與自由度順序\n\nF有分子與分母兩個df，F_(4,10)的.95分位約3.4780；交換為(10,4)不是同一切點。若用倒數關係需同時交換df與尾向。傳統表可能欄列順序不同，先讀標題再找數字。\n\n```python\nfrom scipy import stats\nassert abs(stats.norm.cdf(stats.norm.ppf(.975))-.975)<1e-12\nprint(stats.t.ppf(.975,9))\nprint(stats.chi2.ppf([.025,.975],9))\nprint(stats.f.ppf(.95,4,10))\n```\n\n## 常見錯誤與解答\n\n「雙側.05」不代表兩邊各.05；應各.025。「卡方下界」不一定用小切點作分母，要看正在反解哪個參數。「PPF(.975)」也不等於觀察值的p。這些名稱都含機率，但角色不同；先畫軸、標事件或接受域，再代公式通常最可靠。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "b", "name": "分配表、尾向與常用切點", "html": "分配表、尾向與常用切點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "左尾、右尾與反函數", "html": "左尾、右尾與反函數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "標準常態速查", "html": "標準常態速查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "t", "name": "t與卡方速查", "html": "t與卡方速查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "f", "name": "F與自由度順序", "html": "F與自由度順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "常見錯誤與解答", "html": "常見錯誤與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "67-method-selector", "group": "appendices", "title": "方法選擇與分析報告檢核表", "summary": "先選估計目標、資料關係與設計，再選軟體函式。", "tags": ["解答、附錄與完整專題", "method selector"], "html": "<h1 id=\"c\">方法選擇與分析報告檢核表</h1>\n<p>先選估計目標、資料關係與設計，再選軟體函式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">第一層：想估什麼</h2>\n<p>平均、比例、變異、兩組差、關聯與預測是不同目標。單一母體平均可用適當t區間／檢定；二項比例考慮Wilson／exact；variance的精確卡方需正常性。若目標是代表全體，還需抽樣支持，不是方法名稱包含「推論」就足夠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">第二層：資料如何相依</h2>\n<p>不同人兩組可用Welch；同人前後看差值t；三獨立組可用Welch或傳統ANOVA配合條件；多次追蹤需重複／混合模型。類別計數有獨立性／齊一性／適合度；配對二元則另問McNemar等。先保留ID與設計資訊，無法從兩個向量長度自動猜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">方法對照</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>問題</th>\n<th>主線方法</th>\n<th>先檢查</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>一組平均對基準</td>\n<td>單樣本t，σ真已知時Z</td>\n<td>尺度、獨立、分布、SE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>獨立兩平均</td>\n<td>Welch</td>\n<td>兩組獨立與極端值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同人前後平均差</td>\n<td>成對t</td>\n<td>ID、差值與失訪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多組平均</td>\n<td>ANOVA／Welch與相符比較</td>\n<td>組別設計、variance、家族</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>類別關聯</td>\n<td>Pearson卡方／合適精確法</td>\n<td>計數、期望、獨立單位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>線性關聯與預測</td>\n<td>相關／OLS</td>\n<td>形狀、殘差、範圍及混淆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">第三層：近似是否可信</h2>\n<p>看有效n、偏態、重尾、極端值與依賴；圖形與診斷都不是單一通關證明。非參數或bootstrap不代表無假設，改方法可能改估計目標。對所有資料先做常態檢定、再依p分流，也不等於已設計好完整分析程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">報告欄位</h2>\n<p>記錄問題、分析計畫、資料字典、來源／抽樣、處理與排除、n、估計值、CI、檢定／尾向／α、調整、診斷和限制。資料與程式版本要能對回報表。若是探索，明示探索；主假設、事後發現與未驗證猜測分別標清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>「想看有沒有差，所以用t」還缺什麼？至少缺比較的參數、組數、獨立／配對、尺度、設計、方向、有效n與模型條件。若題目其實是兩個比例，平均t可能只是對0／1編碼的另一種近似，應直接選清楚的比例問題與程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf\">ASA的p值聲明</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 方法選擇與分析報告檢核表 {#c}\n\n先選估計目標、資料關係與設計，再選軟體函式。\n\n## 第一層：想估什麼\n\n平均、比例、變異、兩組差、關聯與預測是不同目標。單一母體平均可用適當t區間／檢定；二項比例考慮Wilson／exact；variance的精確卡方需正常性。若目標是代表全體，還需抽樣支持，不是方法名稱包含「推論」就足夠。\n\n## 第二層：資料如何相依\n\n不同人兩組可用Welch；同人前後看差值t；三獨立組可用Welch或傳統ANOVA配合條件；多次追蹤需重複／混合模型。類別計數有獨立性／齊一性／適合度；配對二元則另問McNemar等。先保留ID與設計資訊，無法從兩個向量長度自動猜。\n\n## 方法對照\n\n| 問題 | 主線方法 | 先檢查 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 一組平均對基準 | 單樣本t，σ真已知時Z | 尺度、獨立、分布、SE |\n| 獨立兩平均 | Welch | 兩組獨立與極端值 |\n| 同人前後平均差 | 成對t | ID、差值與失訪 |\n| 多組平均 | ANOVA／Welch與相符比較 | 組別設計、variance、家族 |\n| 類別關聯 | Pearson卡方／合適精確法 | 計數、期望、獨立單位 |\n| 線性關聯與預測 | 相關／OLS | 形狀、殘差、範圍及混淆 |\n\n## 第三層：近似是否可信\n\n看有效n、偏態、重尾、極端值與依賴；圖形與診斷都不是單一通關證明。非參數或bootstrap不代表無假設，改方法可能改估計目標。對所有資料先做常態檢定、再依p分流，也不等於已設計好完整分析程序。\n\n## 報告欄位\n\n記錄問題、分析計畫、資料字典、來源／抽樣、處理與排除、n、估計值、CI、檢定／尾向／α、調整、診斷和限制。資料與程式版本要能對回報表。若是探索，明示探索；主假設、事後發現與未驗證猜測分別標清楚。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n「想看有沒有差，所以用t」還缺什麼？至少缺比較的參數、組數、獨立／配對、尺度、設計、方向、有效n與模型條件。若題目其實是兩個比例，平均t可能只是對0／1編碼的另一種近似，應直接選清楚的比例問題與程序。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [ASA的p值聲明](https://www.amstat.org/asa/files/pdfs/p-valuestatement.pdf)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "c", "name": "方法選擇與分析報告檢核表", "html": "方法選擇與分析報告檢核表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "第一層：想估什麼", "html": "第一層：想估什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "第二層：資料如何相依", "html": "第二層：資料如何相依", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "方法對照", "html": "方法對照", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "第三層：近似是否可信", "html": "第三層：近似是否可信", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "報告欄位", "html": "報告欄位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "68-robust-resampling", "group": "appendices", "title": "延伸：非參數、重抽樣、缺失與多元模型", "summary": "補足應用時常遇到的分岔，同時清楚標示超出原十章主線的範圍。", "tags": ["解答、附錄與完整專題", "robust resampling"], "html": "<h1 id=\"d\">延伸：非參數、重抽樣、缺失與多元模型</h1>\n<p>補足應用時常遇到的分岔，同時清楚標示超出原十章主線的範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">非參數不是無條件</h2>\n<p>Mann–Whitney比較兩組分布／隨機優越關係，在特定同形位置移動模型下才可簡化成中位差檢定。Wilcoxon signed-rank針對配對差值還有對稱等前提，不能只因「不是常態」就任意套用。Kruskal–Wallis也不會自動回答三個母體平均相等的同一問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bootstrap\">Bootstrap的單位</h2>\n<p>從已觀察樣本重抽、重算統計量以近似抽樣變動；iid樣本可按人重抽，配對需整對重抽，群集或時間依賴需相應方法。增加重抽次數降低模擬誤差，不補回失去的代表性、稀少尾端或錯誤測量。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">7.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">8.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">9.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">stats</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bootstrap</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,),</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">confidence_level</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.95</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">n_resamples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;percentile&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">confidence_interval</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">low</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">confidence_interval</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">high</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">confidence_interval</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">缺失不是一種固定值</h2>\n<p>完整案例、事前分數規則、模型或多重插補各有假設。MCAR、MAR、MNAR描述缺失機制，單靠已觀察資料通常無法證明MNAR不存在。平均補值可能壓縮變異並扭曲關聯；不能只為維持n就先補0或全體平均。</p>\n<h2 id=\"glm\">多元與GLM入口</h2>\n<p>加入多個X的OLS可描述條件關聯，但不自動消除混淆或選擇偏差；需檢查編碼、共線性、交互與模型。二元結果可考慮Logistic／GLM，係數在log-odds尺度，解讀不再是原分數每單位直線差。這些是延伸入口，不把本課簡單迴歸宣稱已覆蓋全部模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">敏感度與解答</h2>\n<p>對合理處理政策或模型作預先規劃的敏感度分析，完整呈現哪些結論穩定、哪些改變。若只有某一種刪點或補值能顯著，不應只保留那個結果。可重現程式讓決策可審閱，統計判斷仍需要研究問題與資料機制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.bootstrap.html\">SciPy bootstrap</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 延伸：非參數、重抽樣、缺失與多元模型 {#d}\n\n補足應用時常遇到的分岔，同時清楚標示超出原十章主線的範圍。\n\n## 非參數不是無條件\n\nMann–Whitney比較兩組分布／隨機優越關係，在特定同形位置移動模型下才可簡化成中位差檢定。Wilcoxon signed-rank針對配對差值還有對稱等前提，不能只因「不是常態」就任意套用。Kruskal–Wallis也不會自動回答三個母體平均相等的同一問題。\n\n## Bootstrap的單位\n\n從已觀察樣本重抽、重算統計量以近似抽樣變動；iid樣本可按人重抽，配對需整對重抽，群集或時間依賴需相應方法。增加重抽次數降低模擬誤差，不補回失去的代表性、稀少尾端或錯誤測量。\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\nx=np.array([2.,3.,4.,5.,7.,8.,9.,10.])\nresult=stats.bootstrap((x,),np.mean,confidence_level=.95,\n    n_resamples=2000,method='percentile',rng=np.random.default_rng(7))\nassert result.confidence_interval.low<result.confidence_interval.high\nprint(result.confidence_interval)\n```\n\n## 缺失不是一種固定值\n\n完整案例、事前分數規則、模型或多重插補各有假設。MCAR、MAR、MNAR描述缺失機制，單靠已觀察資料通常無法證明MNAR不存在。平均補值可能壓縮變異並扭曲關聯；不能只為維持n就先補0或全體平均。\n\n## 多元與GLM入口\n\n加入多個X的OLS可描述條件關聯，但不自動消除混淆或選擇偏差；需檢查編碼、共線性、交互與模型。二元結果可考慮Logistic／GLM，係數在log-odds尺度，解讀不再是原分數每單位直線差。這些是延伸入口，不把本課簡單迴歸宣稱已覆蓋全部模型。\n\n## 敏感度與解答\n\n對合理處理政策或模型作預先規劃的敏感度分析，完整呈現哪些結論穩定、哪些改變。若只有某一種刪點或補值能顯著，不應只保留那個結果。可重現程式讓決策可審閱，統計判斷仍需要研究問題與資料機制。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [SciPy bootstrap](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.bootstrap.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "d", "name": "延伸：非參數、重抽樣、缺失與多元模型", "html": "延伸：非參數、重抽樣、缺失與多元模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "非參數不是無條件", "html": "非參數不是無條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "bootstrap", "name": "Bootstrap的單位", "html": "Bootstrap的單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "缺失不是一種固定值", "html": "缺失不是一種固定值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "glm", "name": "多元與GLM入口", "html": "多元與GLM入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "敏感度與解答", "html": "敏感度與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "69-capstone", "group": "appendices", "title": "完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告", "summary": "把計分、描述、信度、因素、比較與限制組成一份可交付結果。", "tags": ["解答、附錄與完整專題", "capstone"], "example": "40_capstone.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"e-csvjson\">完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告</h1>\n<p>把計分、描述、信度、因素、比較與限制組成一份可交付結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">問題與資料契約</h2>\n<p>180位合成填答者、六題Likert與兩次連續分數；不是實地調查。service三題反向後至少兩題才計平均，alpha用三題完整173，EFA用六題完整170，service各組比較有效179。不同分析集都在報告附n，不用一個180蓋掉全部。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">真正執行的分析</h2>\n<p>第40例讀本機CSV，驗證schema與ID，計摘要與alpha、兩因素principal-axis+varimax、A/B Welch、前後差t、三組Welch ANOVA與Games–Howell，最後輸出JSON。它是探索教學的多方法整合，不宣稱已控制所有目標的整體確認性錯誤率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"p\">先讀估計，再讀p</h2>\n<p>例如A−B約−.2056且區間跨0；前後差約2.9556；三組平均依序增加，但只有A/C那對在三對Games–Howell下拒絕。每項需要回到分數定義、單位與設計。前後改變沒有控制組，不能當作某方案造成改善。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">保存與重跑</h2>\n<p>預設只印結果，不寫固定檔案。想保存時指定新路徑：<code>python applied-statistics/examples/40_capstone.py --output runs/statistics-001/report.json</code>。程式拒絕覆蓋既有檔案，保存版本、有效n、計分政策與完整數值。JSON是結果報告，不是可對任意新資料自動套用的萬用模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">可審閱交付</h2>\n<p>附原始合成CSV、資料字典、程式、鎖版需求、分析計畫及文字解讀。若換真資料，需重新檢查授權、來源、尺度、抽樣、缺失、因素與假設，不能只換CSV檔名就沿用所有結論。所有原始資料與輸出都應依研究需求管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">驗收與解答</h2>\n<p>測試確認已知數學值、資料邊界、反向、完整n、配對、模型自由度、存讀及拒絕覆寫；40入口從不同cwd且封鎖socket執行。測試支持程式契約，不證明真實量表效度或研究代表性。你能指出每個表格用了哪些列、回答哪個問題，才算完成這個專題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python\">Python驗算與完整入口</h2>\n<p>專案根目錄執行 <code>python applied-statistics/examples/40_capstone.py</code>。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 40_capstone.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">math</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pandas</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pd</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">stats</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.api</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sm</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">statsmodels.stats.multitest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">multipletests</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SEED</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">describe</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">proportion_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ci</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sample_size_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">welch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">paired</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">z_power</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">variance_ratio</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">contingency</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">one_way</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">posthoc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">load_survey</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha_reliability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factor_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;--output&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">survey_report</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">save_report</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels 0.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html\">SciPy統計文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html\">statsmodels因素分析</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html\">Tukey與Games–Howell介面</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告 {#e-csvjson}\n\n把計分、描述、信度、因素、比較與限制組成一份可交付結果。\n\n## 問題與資料契約\n\n180位合成填答者、六題Likert與兩次連續分數；不是實地調查。service三題反向後至少兩題才計平均，alpha用三題完整173，EFA用六題完整170，service各組比較有效179。不同分析集都在報告附n，不用一個180蓋掉全部。\n\n## 真正執行的分析\n\n第40例讀本機CSV，驗證schema與ID，計摘要與alpha、兩因素principal-axis+varimax、A/B Welch、前後差t、三組Welch ANOVA與Games–Howell，最後輸出JSON。它是探索教學的多方法整合，不宣稱已控制所有目標的整體確認性錯誤率。\n\n## 先讀估計，再讀p\n\n例如A−B約−.2056且區間跨0；前後差約2.9556；三組平均依序增加，但只有A/C那對在三對Games–Howell下拒絕。每項需要回到分數定義、單位與設計。前後改變沒有控制組，不能當作某方案造成改善。\n\n## 保存與重跑\n\n預設只印結果，不寫固定檔案。想保存時指定新路徑：`python applied-statistics/examples/40_capstone.py --output runs/statistics-001/report.json`。程式拒絕覆蓋既有檔案，保存版本、有效n、計分政策與完整數值。JSON是結果報告，不是可對任意新資料自動套用的萬用模型。\n\n## 可審閱交付\n\n附原始合成CSV、資料字典、程式、鎖版需求、分析計畫及文字解讀。若換真資料，需重新檢查授權、來源、尺度、抽樣、缺失、因素與假設，不能只換CSV檔名就沿用所有結論。所有原始資料與輸出都應依研究需求管理。\n\n## 驗收與解答\n\n測試確認已知數學值、資料邊界、反向、完整n、配對、模型自由度、存讀及拒絕覆寫；40入口從不同cwd且封鎖socket執行。測試支持程式契約，不證明真實量表效度或研究代表性。你能指出每個表格用了哪些列、回答哪個問題，才算完成這個專題。\n\n## Python驗算與完整入口\n\n專案根目錄執行 `python applied-statistics/examples/40_capstone.py`。下載包包含獨立共用模組、鎖版需求與資料，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Offline synthetic teaching experiment: 40_capstone.\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom scipy import stats\nimport statsmodels.api as sm\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\nfrom course_core import (SEED,emit,describe,mean_ci,proportion_ci,variance_ci,\n    sample_size_mean,one_t,welch,paired,z_power,variance_test,variance_ratio,\n    contingency,one_way,posthoc,factorial,regression,regression_data,\n    load_survey,alpha_reliability,factor_report,survey_report,save_report)\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    import argparse\n    parser=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__);parser.add_argument('--output',type=Path);args=parser.parse_args(argv)\n    result=survey_report()\n    if args.output:save_report(args.output,result)\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [statsmodels 0.15文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [SciPy統計文件](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/stats.html)\n- [statsmodels因素分析](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.multivariate.factor.Factor.html)\n- [Tukey與Games–Howell介面](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.stats.multicomp.pairwise_tukeyhsd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "e-csvjson", "name": "完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告", "html": "完整專題：從問卷CSV到可重現JSON報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "問題與資料契約", "html": "問題與資料契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "真正執行的分析", "html": "真正執行的分析", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "p", "name": "先讀估計，再讀p", "html": "先讀估計，再讀p", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "保存與重跑", "html": "保存與重跑", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "可審閱交付", "html": "可審閱交付", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "驗收與解答", "html": "驗收與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "python", "name": "Python驗算與完整入口", "html": "Python驗算與完整入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "70-reference", "group": "appendices", "title": "符號、公式、版本與原目錄對照速查", "summary": "讓你回來查定義、尾向與章節位置，保留完整學習脈絡。", "tags": ["解答、附錄與完整專題", "reference"], "html": "<h1 id=\"f\">符號、公式、版本與原目錄對照速查</h1>\n<p>讓你回來查定義、尾向與章節位置，保留完整學習脈絡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">版本與可重現基準</h2>\n<p>查核日期2026-11-02，SciPy1.18.1、statsmodels0.15.0、NumPy2.5.4、pandas3.1.0，Python3.13.13實測。需求檔包含已測相依版本；沒有宣稱每個底層套件都必須全球最新。更新時先重新查官方穩定版，在隔離環境實跑，再同步日期、程式、教材與ZIP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">常用符號</h2>\n<p>母體N、樣本n；母體平均μ、樣本平均x̄；母體variance σ²、樣本s²；母體比例p、樣本p̂；顯著水準α、型II誤差β、power1−β。SD描述觀察分散，SE描述統計量抽樣變動。q通常是左尾累積分位，不一定是上尾面積。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">公式先配條件</h2>\n<p>平均SE=σ/√n是iid有限變異形式；未知σ的t精確需常態，比例二項需要固定n、獨立同p；variance卡方及精確F對正常性更敏感。ANOVA整體檢定不告訴你每對差異；相關與迴歸不自動支持因果。方法名稱永遠不能省略設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">原目錄如何保留</h2>\n<p>原十章的主題與所有細目均保留，章內單元由閱讀器從01重新編號，標題不重複教材舊節號。第十章為「問卷調查分析與Python實作」，基本操作換成Python與資料流程，其餘問卷、信效度、因素、交叉表和各項比較皆保留。十章各有習題詳解，附錄補查表、方法選擇與完整專題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">課程與檔案</h2>\n<p>70個閱讀單元在chapters，course.json定順序與分組；40個Python入口、獨立course_core與survey.csv在examples，完整下載包examples.zip。八個首頁互動實驗用JavaScript計算，沒有在瀏覽器執行SciPy。網站的搜尋、筆記與閱讀進度沿用共用閱讀器，並與其他領域分別保存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">參考與使用方式</h2>\n<p>教材為針對本課原創的說明、手算、合成案例與程式，並提供OpenStax、NIST、ASA及套件官方文件作進一步閱讀，沒有重製特定教科書正文或題庫。數理統計、機率與時間序列仍保留獨立領域；本課聚焦如何對資料選法、診斷、解讀與報告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">最後的自我檢核</h2>\n<p>若看到一個p值，能否說出其H0、模型、觀察單位、尾向、比較家族及效果區間？若做不到，回到對應章節補齊。讀完統計的成果不是記住所有表格數字，而是知道自己能回答什麼、不能從資料推出什麼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">參考與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scipy.org/\">SciPy官方發布</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/\">statsmodels正式文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html\">NumPy統計運算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e\">OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 符號、公式、版本與原目錄對照速查 {#f}\n\n讓你回來查定義、尾向與章節位置，保留完整學習脈絡。\n\n## 版本與可重現基準\n\n查核日期2026-11-02，SciPy1.18.1、statsmodels0.15.0、NumPy2.5.4、pandas3.1.0，Python3.13.13實測。需求檔包含已測相依版本；沒有宣稱每個底層套件都必須全球最新。更新時先重新查官方穩定版，在隔離環境實跑，再同步日期、程式、教材與ZIP。\n\n## 常用符號\n\n母體N、樣本n；母體平均μ、樣本平均x̄；母體variance σ²、樣本s²；母體比例p、樣本p̂；顯著水準α、型II誤差β、power1−β。SD描述觀察分散，SE描述統計量抽樣變動。q通常是左尾累積分位，不一定是上尾面積。\n\n## 公式先配條件\n\n平均SE=σ/√n是iid有限變異形式；未知σ的t精確需常態，比例二項需要固定n、獨立同p；variance卡方及精確F對正常性更敏感。ANOVA整體檢定不告訴你每對差異；相關與迴歸不自動支持因果。方法名稱永遠不能省略設計。\n\n## 原目錄如何保留\n\n原十章的主題與所有細目均保留，章內單元由閱讀器從01重新編號，標題不重複教材舊節號。第十章為「問卷調查分析與Python實作」，基本操作換成Python與資料流程，其餘問卷、信效度、因素、交叉表和各項比較皆保留。十章各有習題詳解，附錄補查表、方法選擇與完整專題。\n\n## 課程與檔案\n\n70個閱讀單元在chapters，course.json定順序與分組；40個Python入口、獨立course_core與survey.csv在examples，完整下載包examples.zip。八個首頁互動實驗用JavaScript計算，沒有在瀏覽器執行SciPy。網站的搜尋、筆記與閱讀進度沿用共用閱讀器，並與其他領域分別保存。\n\n## 參考與使用方式\n\n教材為針對本課原創的說明、手算、合成案例與程式，並提供OpenStax、NIST、ASA及套件官方文件作進一步閱讀，沒有重製特定教科書正文或題庫。數理統計、機率與時間序列仍保留獨立領域；本課聚焦如何對資料選法、診斷、解讀與報告。\n\n## 最後的自我檢核\n\n若看到一個p值，能否說出其H0、模型、觀察單位、尾向、比較家族及效果區間？若做不到，回到對應章節補齊。讀完統計的成果不是記住所有表格數字，而是知道自己能回答什麼、不能從資料推出什麼。\n\n## 參考與官方來源\n\n- [SciPy官方發布](https://scipy.org/)\n- [statsmodels正式文件](https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/)\n- [NumPy統計運算](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/routines.statistics.html)\n- [OpenStax Introductory Statistics 2e](https://openstax.org/details/books/introductory-statistics-2e)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "f", "name": "符號、公式、版本與原目錄對照速查", "html": "符號、公式、版本與原目錄對照速查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "版本與可重現基準", "html": "版本與可重現基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "常用符號", "html": "常用符號", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "公式先配條件", "html": "公式先配條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "原目錄如何保留", "html": "原目錄如何保留", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "課程與檔案", "html": "課程與檔案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "參考與使用方式", "html": "參考與使用方式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "最後的自我檢核", "html": "最後的自我檢核", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "參考與官方來源", "html": "參考與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}]};
